li><li data-list-item-id="eff776c3b771d74b79bb48069396a6120">Colección Obras completas de Benjamín Carrión</li><li data-list-item-id="e126fa3415e942521f98a3f0c21ca4262">Medalla y diploma</li></ul></div><div class="prize-card fade-up"><div class="prize-bg-num">2</div><div class="p-rank">Segundo lugar</div><div class="p-amount">$600 <span>USD</span></div><ul class="p-items"><li data-list-item-id="ef280a643adb4790d89eda6cf73e21b14">Beca completa — Escuela de Formación Política (CAJE)</li><li data-list-item-id="e0aac08c7718fc5d2653188a85b5fa4e0">Colección Obras completas de Benjamín Carrión</li><li data-list-item-id="ea77d4576edcff0958e818db1a910a6a5">Medalla y diploma</li></ul></div><div class="prize-card fade-up"><div class="prize-bg-num">3</div><div class="p-rank">Tercer lugar</div><div class="p-amount">$400 <span>USD</span></div><ul class="p-items"><li data-list-item-id="e04ecd46b6cb8b0d62f1ebe77b7f784e8">Beca matrícula — "¿Cómo Hablar en Público?" (CCE Núcleo Loja)</li><li data-list-item-id="e3bf93d73775e4aad8f8bdfd6a9773ce3">Colección Obras completas de Benjamín Carrión</li><li data-list-item-id="ed06f1c9feb9dd29921f30e8e7cdda173">Medalla y diploma</li></ul></div></div></div></section><!-- INFO BAR --><div class="infobar"><div class="info-item"><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="#B08800" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg><div><div class="info-label">¿Quiénes participan?</div><div class="info-value">Estudiantes universitarios de todo Ecuador</div></div></div><div class="sep">&nbsp;</div><div class="info-item"><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="#B08800" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect height="18" rx="2" ry="2" width="18" x="3" y="4"></rect><line x1="16" x2="16" y1="2" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" x2="8" y1="2" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" x2="21" y1="10" y2="10"></line></svg><div><div class="info-label">Cierre inscripciones</div><div class="info-value">18 de septiembre de 2026</div></div></div><div class="sep">&nbsp;</div><div class="info-item"><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="#B08800" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13S3 17 3 10a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg><div><div class="info-label">Lugar del evento</div><div class="info-value">Loja, Ecuador</div></div></div><div class="sep">&nbsp;</div><div class="info-item"><svg fill="#B08800" height="20" stroke="#B08800" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg><div><div class="info-label">Premio total</div><div class="info-value">$5.000 USD en premios</div></div></div></div><!-- PARTICIPANTES --><section class="section" id="que-es"><div class="section-inner"><div class="section-title">¿Quiénes pueden participar?</div><div class="part-grid"><div class="part-card fade-up"><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="#B08800" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"></path><path d="M6 12v5c0 2 2 3 6 3s6-1 6-3v-5"></path></svg><p class="part-text">Estudiantes de <strong>todas las universidades del Ecuador</strong> que cursen estudios de tercer nivel en cualquier modalidad.</p></div><div class="part-card fade-up"><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="#B08800" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><line x1="3" x2="21" y1="22" y2="22"></line><line x1="6" x2="6" y1="18" y2="11"></line><line x1="10" x2="10" y1="18" y2="11"></line><line x1="14" x2="14" y1="18" y2="11"></line><line x1="18" x2="18" y1="18" y2="11"></line><polygon points="12 2 20 7 4 7"></polygon></svg><p class="part-text">Cada universidad podrá inscribir hasta <strong>dos representantes</strong> debidamente acreditados.</p></div></div></div></section><!-- MODALIDAD --><section class="section alt" id="modalidad"><div class="section-inner"><div class="section-title">Modalidad del concurso</div><div class="modal-list"><div class="modal-item fade-up"><div class="modal-num">1</div><div class="modal-body"><div class="modal-label">Semifinal</div><div class="modal-desc">Los participantes presentarán un discurso sobre uno de los temas propuestos en las bases.</div></div></div><div class="modal-item fade-up"><div class="modal-num">2</div><div class="modal-body"><div class="modal-label">Final</div><div class="modal-desc">Los finalistas expondrán un discurso improvisado sobre un tema de actualidad nacional o internacional asignado por sorteo.</div></div></div><div class="modal-item highlight fade-up"><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="#B08800" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg><div class="modal-body"><div class="modal-label">Tiempo de intervención</div><div class="modal-desc">Entre <strong>4 y 5 minutos</strong> por participante.</div></div></div></div></div></section><!-- TEMÁTICAS --><section class="section" id="tematicas"><div class="section-inner"><div class="section-title">Temáticas</div><div class="temas-grid"><div class="tema-item fade-up"><span class="tema-n">01</span><span class="tema-txt">La paz como responsabilidad de la ONU en el siglo XXI</span></div><div class="tema-item fade-up"><span class="tema-n">02</span><span class="tema-txt">Paz, soberanía y el derecho a la autodeterminación de los pueblos</span></div><div class="tema-item fade-up"><span class="tema-n">03</span><span class="tema-txt">Educación, paz y no violencia</span></div><div class="tema-item fade-up"><span class="tema-n">04</span><span class="tema-txt">La juventud por la paz en el mundo</span></div><div class="tema-item fade-up"><span class="tema-n">05</span><span class="tema-txt">Paz y justicia social</span></div><div class="tema-item fade-up"><span class="tema-n">06</span><span class="tema-txt">Hegemonía política mundial y genocidio</span></div><div class="tema-item fade-up"><span class="tema-n">07</span><span class="tema-txt">Diversidad cultural y convivencia pacífica en un mundo globalizado</span></div><div class="tema-item fade-up"><span class="tema-n">08</span><span class="tema-txt">Cultura de paz frente a la violencia global contemporánea</span></div><div class="tema-item fade-up"><span class="tema-n">09</span><span class="tema-txt">Desarrollo sostenible como camino hacia la paz duradera</span></div><div class="tema-item fade-up"><span class="tema-n">10</span><span class="tema-txt">Liderazgo moral y democracia para un mundo sin violencia</span></div></div></div></section><!-- DESCARGA Y CONTACTO --><section class="section alt" id="inscripciones"><div class="section-inner"><div class="bottom-row"><div class="download-card fade-up"><h3>Descarga las bases del concurso</h3><p>Consulta los requisitos, criterios de evaluación y demás disposiciones oficiales del concurso.</p><p><a class="download-btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-06/BASESORATORIA.pdf">⬇ Descargar PDF</a></p></div><div class="contact-card fade-up"><h3>Más información</h3><p>¿Tienes dudas sobre el proceso de inscripción o las bases del concurso? Escríbenos y te responderemos a la brevedad.</p><p><a class="contact-email" href="mailto:arte.cultura@unl.edu.ec">✉ arte.cultura@unl.edu.ec</a></p></div></div></div></section><!-- ORGANIZADORES --><footer class="org-bar"><div class="org-pill"><img style="object-fit:contain;" src="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/CCE.png" alt="CCE Benjamín Carrión" width="NaN" height="NaN"> <span class="org-name">CCE Benjamín Carrión</span></div><div class="org-pill"><img style="object-fit:contain;" src="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-03/ESCUDO%20UNL%202025-12.png" alt="Universidad Nacional de Loja" width="NaN" height="NaN"><span class="org-name">Universidad Nacional de Loja</span></div></footer><script>\r\n(function(){\r\n\r\n  /* ── PARTÍCULAS ── */\r\n  const canvas = document.getElementById('particles');\r\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\r\n  let W, H, pts = [];\r\n\r\n  function resize(){\r\n    W = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\r\n    H = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\r\n  }\r\n  resize();\r\n  window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\r\n\r\n  for(let i=0;i<55;i++){\r\n    pts.push({\r\n      x: Math.random()*window.innerWidth,\r\n      y: Math.random()*window.innerHeight,\r\n      r: Math.random()*1.4+0.3,\r\n      vx:(Math.random()-.5)*0.18,\r\n      vy:(Math.random()-.5)*0.18,\r\n      o: Math.random()*0.5+0.15\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  function drawParticles(){\r\n    ctx.clearRect(0,0,W,H);\r\n    pts.forEach(p=>{\r\n      ctx.beginPath();\r\n      ctx.arc(p.x,p.y,p.r,0,Math.PI*2);\r\n      ctx.fillStyle=`rgba(160,120,0,${p.o * 0.5})`;\r\n      ctx.fill();\r\n      p.x+=p.vx; p.y+=p.vy;\r\n      if(p.x<0) p.x=W; if(p.x>W) p.x=0;\r\n      if(p.y<0) p.y=H; if(p.y>H) p.y=0;\r\n    });\r\n    requestAnimationFrame(drawParticles);\r\n  }\r\n  drawParticles();\r\n\r\n  /* ── PARALLAX SUAVE EN SCROLL ── */\r\n  const heroImg = document.getElementById('heroImg');\r\n  window.addEventListener('scroll', ()=>{\r\n    const s = window.scrollY;\r\n    if(heroImg) heroImg.style.transform = `translateY(${s*0.12}px) scale(1.05)`;\r\n  }, {passive:true});\r\n\r\n  /* ── FADE-UP OBSERVER ── */\r\n  const els = document.querySelectorAll('.fade-up');\r\n  const obs = new IntersectionObserver(entries=>{\r\n    entries.forEach((e,i)=>{\r\n      if(e.isIntersecting){\r\n        setTimeout(()=>e.target.classList.add('in'), i*80);\r\n        obs.unobserve(e.target);\r\n      }\r\n    });\r\n  },{threshold:.12});\r\n  els.forEach(el=>obs.observe(el));\r\n\r\n})();\r\n</script>	full_html
texto_libre	0	154	1699	es	0	<h4 class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</h4><p class="text-align-justify">Desde la <strong>Coordinación de Vinculación con la Sociedad</strong>, el conocimiento universitario deja de ser un activo estático para convertirse en un motor de cambio social mediante procesos estratégicos de transferencia. Esta labor se materializa en la organización de eventos científicos:&nbsp;<b data-index-in-node="258" data-path-to-node="0"><strong>congresos, seminarios, jornadas científicas, etcétera;</strong></b>&nbsp;espacios diseñados para democratizar los hallazgos académicos y fomentar el diálogo con sectores productivos y comunitarios. Al sacar la investigación de las aulas y exponerla en estos foros de divulgación, la UNL asegura que la innovación científica se traduzca en soluciones prácticas, fortaleciendo el tejido social y garantizando que el saber académico responda a las necesidades reales del entorno.</p><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p><table class="table"><tbody><tr><td nowrap="nowrap"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sic2024"><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/SIC_0.jpg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="5092722b-133e-4871-a83a-2d7f2c55360f" data-entity-type="file" alt="SIC" width="241" height="136"></a><p class="text-align-center"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sic2024" title="SIC"><strong>III Simposio de Investigación Científica: Ciencia para un futuro sostenible</strong></a></p><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/cienf2025" title="CIENF web"><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/Logo%20Congreso%20Enfermeri%CC%81a_0.png" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="49964352-7c3e-4ae0-aaa8-2e8f27bb6282" data-entity-type="file" alt="enf" width="296" height="137"></a><p class="text-align-center"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/cienf2025" title="CIENF"><strong>Congreso Internacional de Enfermería: Cuidado, Innovación e Investigación en el ámbito Familiar y Comunitario</strong></a></p><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/cicafise" title="cicafise"><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/CICAFISE.jpg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="ebc29feb-9da7-4c7a-bafa-6ddc9e9a56e7" data-entity-type="file" alt="CICAFISE" width="337" height="98"></a><p class="text-align-center"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/cicafise" title="cicafise web"><strong>I Congreso Internacional de Investigación en Contabilidad, Auditoría y Finanzas: Innovación y Sostenibilidad Empresarial</strong></a></p><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap"><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/Odontologi%CC%81a.jpg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="2bada46c-4b0e-4519-a87d-eefd61d8c4aa" data-entity-type="file" alt="Odonto" width="332" height="54"><p class="text-align-center"><strong>I Jornadas Científicas Internacionales de la Carrera de Odontología UNL</strong></p><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/ciedl" title="rde3r23"><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/CIEDL.jpg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="0cdbc4c4-2eee-4e77-ba42-1daf886ef481" data-entity-type="file" alt="CIEDL" width="324" height="83"></a><p class="text-align-center"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/ciedl" title="efded"><strong>II Congreso Internacional de Educación a Distancia y en Línea: Experiencias y perspectivas</strong></a></p><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/relas2024" title="er3"><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/RELAS_0.jpg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="a6916f0b-be12-4741-89d1-0125f942ee9e" data-entity-type="file" alt="RELAS" width="224" height="127"></a><p class="text-align-center"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/relas2024" title="relas"><strong>XIV Reunión Latinoamericana de Scarabaeoidología (RELAS) 2024</strong></a></p><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/cigecop2024" title="4f4f4"><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/CIGECOP.jpg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="8233e280-9531-4ac9-8f6e-00398a6dc5c9" data-entity-type="file" alt="CIGECOP" width="276" height="88"></a><p class="text-align-center"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/cigecop2024" title="r4r4r"><strong>Primer Congreso Internacional de Gestión y Contratación Pública. Desafíos y perspectivas 2024</strong></a></p><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap"><a href="https://www.unl.edu.ec/elesl/2021" title="lidi"><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/LIDI_0.png" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="88a60028-0fd1-4655-a1ce-5bb31582125d" data-entity-type="file" alt="LIDI" width="329" height="102"></a><p class="text-align-center"><a href="https://www.unl.edu.ec/elesl/2021" title="lidi"><strong>I Congreso Nacional de Enseñanza de Lenguas Extranjeras y Lenguas Segundas:</strong></a></p><p class="text-align-center"><a href="https://www.unl.edu.ec/elesl/2021" title="lidi"><strong>Investigación, Experiencias y Perspectivas durante y pospandemia</strong></a></p><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/cerp/2021" title="cerp img"><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/CERP.jpg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="310a4f90-d7eb-4f21-b2c9-e3b1539b4fd5" data-entity-type="file" alt="cerp" width="238" height="163"></a><p class="text-align-center"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/cerp/2021" title="cerp"><strong>II Congreso Ecuatoriano de Restauración del Paisaje</strong></a></p><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap"><a href="https://www.unl.edu.ec/joim2026" title="f4f4f"><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/JOIM_0.jpg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="2e299acf-d8ba-4dcc-85ea-6b9696afff31" data-entity-type="file" alt="JOIM" width="291" height="199"></a><p class="text-align-center"><a href="https://www.unl.edu.ec/joim2026" title="4f4f"><strong>Jornadas de Investigación Musical</strong></a></p><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p></td></tr></tbody></table>	full_html
texto_libre	0	142	1723	es	0	<div class="pmi-wrapper"><!-- \r\n    ========================================================\r\n    ESTILOS CSS\r\n    ========================================================\r\n  --><style type="text/css">:root {\r\n      /* Paleta Institucional UNL */\r\n      --pmi-c-navy: #0c2342;\r\n      --pmi-c-blue: #004C7B;\r\n      --pmi-c-green-dark: #247A1E; /* Para textos pequeños (WCAG AA) */\r\n      --pmi-c-green: #4F8E3A;      /* Para firmas o acentos grandes */\r\n      --pmi-c-red: #BF0811;        /* Acento mínimo */\r\n      --pmi-c-white: #ffffff;\r\n      --pmi-c-bg-light: #f4f7f9;\r\n      --pmi-c-text: #211915;\r\n      --pmi-c-text-muted: #5a6673;\r\n      --pmi-c-border: #e2e8f0;\r\n\r\n      /* Variables de UI */\r\n      --pmi-radius-lg: 16px;\r\n      --pmi-radius-md: 12px;\r\n      --pmi-radius-sm: 8px;\r\n      --pmi-shadow-sm: 0 2px 8px rgba(12, 35, 66, 0.05);\r\n      --pmi-shadow-md: 0 8px 24px rgba(12, 35, 66, 0.08);\r\n      --pmi-transition: all 0.3s ease;\r\n      --pmi-max-width: 1170px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* Reset básico local para proteger contra el tema de Drupal */\r\n    .pmi-wrapper {\r\n      font-family: 'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-text);\r\n      line-height: 1.6;\r\n      font-size: 16px; /* Forzado a px */\r\n      background-color: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n      overflow-x: hidden;\r\n      margin: 0;\r\n      padding: 0;\r\n      box-sizing: border-box;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .pmi-wrapper *,\r\n    .pmi-wrapper *::before,\r\n    .pmi-wrapper *::after {\r\n      box-sizing: inherit;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* Tipografía en PX */\r\n    .pmi-wrapper h1 {\r\n      margin-top: 0;\r\n      font-weight: 800;\r\n      line-height: 1.2;\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .pmi-wrapper h2, .pmi-wrapper h3, .pmi-wrapper h4 {\r\n      margin-top: 0;\r\n      font-weight: 700;\r\n      line-height: 1.3;\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-blue);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .pmi-wrapper p {\r\n      margin-top: 0;\r\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* Contenedor principal responsive */\r\n    .pmi-container {\r\n      max-width: var(--pmi-max-width);\r\n      margin: 0 auto;\r\n      padding: 0 20px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* =========================================\r\n       COMPONENTES GLOBALES\r\n       ========================================= */\r\n    .pmi-btn {\r\n      display: inline-flex;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n      justify-content: center;\r\n      padding: 12px 24px;\r\n      font-size: 16px; /* PX */\r\n      font-weight: 600;\r\n      text-decoration: none;\r\n      border-radius: var(--pmi-radius-sm);\r\n      transition: var(--pmi-transition);\r\n      cursor: pointer;\r\n      border: 2px solid transparent;\r\n      text-align: center;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .pmi-btn--primary {\r\n      background-color: var(--pmi-c-blue);\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-white) !important;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-btn--primary:hover, .pmi-btn--primary:focus {\r\n      background-color: #003657;\r\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 76, 123, 0.3);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .pmi-btn--outline {\r\n      background-color: transparent;\r\n      border-color: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-white) !important;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-btn--outline:hover, .pmi-btn--outline:focus {\r\n      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* Etiquetas/Badges */\r\n    .pmi-badge {\r\n      display: inline-block;\r\n      padding: 4px 12px;\r\n      border-radius: 20px;\r\n      font-size: 14px; /* PX */\r\n      font-weight: 600;\r\n      background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\r\n      letter-spacing: 0.5px;\r\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* Iconos SVG genéricos */\r\n    .pmi-icon {\r\n      width: 24px;\r\n      height: 24px;\r\n      fill: none;\r\n      stroke: currentColor;\r\n      stroke-width: 2;\r\n      stroke-linecap: round;\r\n      stroke-linejoin: round;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* =========================================\r\n       SECCIONES ESPECÍFICAS\r\n       ========================================= */\r\n\r\n    /* 1. Hero Section (Convertido en Card para Drupal) */\r\n    .pmi-hero {\r\n      background-color: var(--pmi-c-navy);\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n      padding: 48px 40px;\r\n      position: relative;\r\n      border-radius: 24px; /* Hace que se vea intencionalmente encuadrado */\r\n      margin: 24px 20px; /* Separación del menú principal de Drupal */\r\n      overflow: hidden;\r\n      box-shadow: var(--pmi-shadow-md);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .pmi-hero::before {\r\n      content: '';\r\n      position: absolute;\r\n      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\r\n      background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(0, 76, 123, 0.4) 0%, transparent 50%);\r\n      pointer-events: none;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .pmi-hero__grid {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\r\n      gap: 40px;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n      position: relative;\r\n      z-index: 2;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .pmi-hero__title {\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n      font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px); /* PX */\r\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n      line-height: 1.2;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .pmi-hero__desc {\r\n      font-size: 18px; /* PX */\r\n      margin-bottom: 30px;\r\n      opacity: 0.9;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .pmi-hero__actions {\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      gap: 16px;\r\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* Hero Stats */\r\n    .pmi-hero__stats {\r\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\r\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n      border-radius: var(--pmi-radius-lg);\r\n      padding: 24px;\r\n      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\r\n      gap: 20px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .pmi-stat {\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      flex-direction: column;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-stat__num {\r\n      font-size: 32px; /* PX */\r\n      font-weight: 800;\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n      line-height: 1;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-stat__label {\r\n      font-size: 14px; /* PX */\r\n      opacity: 0.8;\r\n      margin-top: 4px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* 2. Sección base genérica */\r\n    .pmi-section {\r\n      padding: 60px 0;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-section--bg {\r\n      background-color: var(--pmi-c-bg-light);\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-section__title {\r\n      text-align: center;\r\n      font-size: 36px; /* PX (Jerarquía alta) */\r\n      margin-bottom: 40px;\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-navy);\r\n      position: relative;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-section__title::after {\r\n      content: '';\r\n      display: block;\r\n      width: 60px;\r\n      height: 4px;\r\n      background-color: var(--pmi-c-green);\r\n      margin: 16px auto 0;\r\n      border-radius: 2px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* 3. Acerca de & Por qué participar */\r\n    .pmi-about {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\r\n      gap: 60px;\r\n      align-items: start;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-about__content h2 {\r\n      font-size: 32px; /* PX */\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-navy);\r\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-why__list {\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      flex-direction: column;\r\n      gap: 20px;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-why__item {\r\n      background: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n      border: 1px solid var(--pmi-c-border);\r\n      border-radius: var(--pmi-radius-md);\r\n      padding: 20px;\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      align-items: flex-start;\r\n      gap: 16px;\r\n      box-shadow: var(--pmi-shadow-sm);\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-why__icon {\r\n      background-color: rgba(0, 76, 123, 0.1);\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-blue);\r\n      padding: 10px;\r\n      border-radius: var(--pmi-radius-sm);\r\n      display: flex;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-why__item h3 {\r\n      font-size: 18px; /* PX */\r\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-why__item p {\r\n      margin-bottom: 0;\r\n      font-size: 15px; /* PX */\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-text-muted);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* 4. Cómo Funciona (Línea de tiempo horizontal) */\r\n    .pmi-steps {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\r\n      gap: 20px;\r\n      position: relative;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-steps::before {\r\n      content: '';\r\n      position: absolute;\r\n      top: 24px;\r\n      left: 10%;\r\n      right: 10%;\r\n      height: 2px;\r\n      background-color: var(--pmi-c-border);\r\n      z-index: 1;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-step {\r\n      position: relative;\r\n      z-index: 2;\r\n      text-align: center;\r\n      background: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n      padding: 24px 16px;\r\n      border-radius: var(--pmi-radius-md);\r\n      border: 1px solid var(--pmi-c-border);\r\n      box-shadow: var(--pmi-shadow-sm);\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-step__num {\r\n      width: 48px;\r\n      height: 48px;\r\n      background-color: var(--pmi-c-blue);\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n      font-size: 19px; /* PX */\r\n      font-weight: bold;\r\n      border-radius: 50%;\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n      justify-content: center;\r\n      margin: -48px auto 16px;\r\n      border: 4px solid var(--pmi-c-bg-light);\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-step h3 {\r\n      font-size: 18px; /* PX */\r\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-step p {\r\n      font-size: 15px; /* PX */\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-text-muted);\r\n      margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* 5. Objetivos */\r\n    .pmi-grid-4 {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\r\n      gap: 24px;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-card-obj {\r\n      background: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n      padding: 24px;\r\n      border-radius: var(--pmi-radius-md);\r\n      border: 1px solid var(--pmi-c-border);\r\n      box-shadow: var(--pmi-shadow-sm);\r\n      transition: var(--pmi-transition);\r\n      border-top: 4px solid var(--pmi-c-green);\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-card-obj:hover {\r\n      box-shadow: var(--pmi-shadow-md);\r\n      transform: translateY(-2px);\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-card-obj h3 {\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n      gap: 12px;\r\n      font-size: 20px; /* PX */\r\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-card-obj__icon {\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-green-dark);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* 6. Roles */\r\n    .pmi-roles {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\r\n      gap: 32px;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-role-card {\r\n      background: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n      border-radius: var(--pmi-radius-lg);\r\n      border: 1px solid var(--pmi-c-border);\r\n      box-shadow: var(--pmi-shadow-md);\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      flex-direction: column;\r\n      overflow: hidden;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-role-card__header {\r\n      background-color: var(--pmi-c-navy);\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n      padding: 24px;\r\n      text-align: center;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-role-card__header h3 {\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n      margin: 0 0 8px 0;\r\n      font-size: 24px; /* PX */\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-role-card__header p {\r\n      margin: 0;\r\n      opacity: 0.8;\r\n      font-size: 15px; /* PX */\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-role-card__body {\r\n      padding: 24px;\r\n      flex-grow: 1;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-role-card__body ul {\r\n      list-style: none;\r\n      padding: 0;\r\n      margin: 0;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-role-card__body li {\r\n      position: relative;\r\n      padding-left: 28px;\r\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\r\n      font-size: 15px; /* PX */\r\n      line-height: 1.5;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-role-card__body li::before {\r\n      content: '✓';\r\n      position: absolute;\r\n      left: 0;\r\n      top: 0;\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-green-dark);\r\n      font-weight: bold;\r\n      font-size: 18px; /* PX */\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-role-card__footer {\r\n      padding: 24px;\r\n      background-color: var(--pmi-c-bg-light);\r\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--pmi-c-border);\r\n      text-align: center;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-role-card__footer .pmi-btn {\r\n      width: 100%;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* 7. Líneas de Investigación & Productos */\r\n    .pmi-lines {\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n      gap: 16px;\r\n      justify-content: center;\r\n      margin-bottom: 40px;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-line-tag {\r\n      background: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n      border: 1px solid var(--pmi-c-border);\r\n      padding: 12px 24px;\r\n      border-radius: 30px;\r\n      font-size: 16px;\r\n      font-weight: 600;\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-blue);\r\n      box-shadow: var(--pmi-shadow-sm);\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n      gap: 10px;\r\n    }\r\n    /* Estilo de los SVG en Líneas de Investigación */\r\n    .pmi-line-tag .pmi-icon {\r\n      width: 20px;\r\n      height: 20px;\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-green);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .pmi-docs-grid {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\r\n      gap: 24px;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-doc-card {\r\n      background: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n      padding: 24px;\r\n      border-radius: var(--pmi-radius-md);\r\n      border-left: 4px solid var(--pmi-c-blue);\r\n      box-shadow: var(--pmi-shadow-sm);\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-doc-card ul {\r\n      padding-left: 20px;\r\n      margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-doc-card li {\r\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n      font-size: 15px; /* PX */\r\n    }\r\n    /* El h3 de tarjetas internas debe ser notablemente más pequeño que el h2 */\r\n    .pmi-doc-card h3 {\r\n      font-size: 20px !important; \r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* 8. Cronograma Vertical (Timeline) */\r\n    .pmi-timeline {\r\n      position: relative;\r\n      padding-left: 32px;\r\n      margin-top: 24px;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-timeline::before {\r\n      content: '';\r\n      position: absolute;\r\n      left: 7px;\r\n      top: 8px;\r\n      bottom: 8px;\r\n      width: 2px;\r\n      background-color: var(--pmi-c-border);\r\n      z-index: 1; /* Asegura que la línea sea visible */\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-timeline__item {\r\n      position: relative;\r\n      margin-bottom: 32px;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-timeline__item:last-child {\r\n      margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-timeline__marker {\r\n      position: absolute;\r\n      left: -32px;\r\n      top: 2px;\r\n      width: 16px;\r\n      height: 16px;\r\n      border-radius: 50%;\r\n      background-color: var(--pmi-c-blue);\r\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n      z-index: 2; /* Importante para que resalte sobre la línea */\r\n      /* Truco para evitar que Drupal borre la etiqueta vacía */\r\n      display: block;\r\n      color: transparent;\r\n      line-height: 0;\r\n    }\r\n    /* Colores intercalados institucionales para el timeline */\r\n    .pmi-timeline__item:nth-child(1) .pmi-timeline__marker { background-color: var(--pmi-c-blue); }\r\n    .pmi-timeline__item:nth-child(2) .pmi-timeline__marker { background-color: var(--pmi-c-green); }\r\n    .pmi-timeline__item:nth-child(3) .pmi-timeline__marker { background-color: var(--pmi-c-navy); }\r\n    .pmi-timeline__item:nth-child(4) .pmi-timeline__marker { background-color: var(--pmi-c-green-dark); }\r\n    .pmi-timeline__item:nth-child(5) .pmi-timeline__marker { background-color: var(--pmi-c-red); }\r\n\r\n    .pmi-timeline__date {\r\n      display: block;\r\n      font-weight: 700;\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-text);\r\n      font-size: 17px; /* PX */\r\n      margin-bottom: 2px;\r\n    }\r\n    .pmi-timeline__title {\r\n      display: block;\r\n      font-size: 15px; /* PX */\r\n      color: var(--pmi-c-text-muted);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* Ajuste para la tarjeta de Documentos (1 columna vertical) */\r\n    .pmi-docs-inner-grid {\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      flex-direction: column;\r\n      gap: 28px;\r\n      margin-top: 24px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* =========================================\r\n       MEDIA QUERIES (Breakpoints: 991px, 767px)\r\n       ========================================= */\r\n    @media (max-width: 991px) {\r\n      .pmi-hero {\r\n        padding: 40px 24px;\r\n        margin: 20px 10px;\r\n      }\r\n      .pmi-hero__grid, \r\n      .pmi-about, \r\n      .pmi-roles, \r\n      .pmi-docs-grid {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n        gap: 32px;\r\n      }\r\n      \r\n      .pmi-steps {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\r\n        gap: 40px 20px;\r\n      }\r\n      .pmi-steps::before {\r\n        display: none;\r\n      }\r\n      .pmi-step__num {\r\n        margin: -24px auto 16px;\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    @media (max-width: 767px) {\r\n      .pmi-section { padding: 40px 0; }\r\n      \r\n      .pmi-hero__stats {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n        gap: 16px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .pmi-steps {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n      }\r\n      \r\n      .pmi-container {\r\n        padding: 0 15px;\r\n        width: 100%;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .pmi-hero__title { font-size: 28px; }\r\n      .pmi-section__title { font-size: 28px; }\r\n      \r\n      .pmi-role-card__body, .pmi-doc-card {\r\n        word-break: normal;\r\n        overflow-wrap: break-word;\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n/* =========================================\r\n   SECCIÓN CTA - CONTACTO\r\n   ========================================= */\r\n.pmi-cta-section {\r\n  padding: 60px 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.pmi-cta-box {\r\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pmi-c-navy) 0%, var(--pmi-c-blue) 100%);\r\n  border-radius: var(--pmi-radius-lg);\r\n  padding: 56px 40px;\r\n  text-align: center;\r\n  color: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n  box-shadow: var(--pmi-shadow-md);\r\n  position: relative;\r\n  overflow: hidden;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Decoración de fondo sutil */\r\n.pmi-cta-box::before {\r\n  content: '';\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n  top: -40px;\r\n  right: -40px;\r\n  width: 200px;\r\n  height: 200px;\r\n  border-radius: 50%;\r\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\r\n  pointer-events: none;\r\n}\r\n.pmi-cta-box::after {\r\n  content: '';\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n  bottom: -60px;\r\n  left: -40px;\r\n  width: 280px;\r\n  height: 280px;\r\n  border-radius: 50%;\r\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\r\n  pointer-events: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.pmi-cta-icon {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  justify-content: center;\r\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n  color: var(--pmi-c-white);\r\n  opacity: 0.9;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.pmi-cta-title {\r\n  color: var(--pmi-c-white) !important;\r\n  font-size: 32px;\r\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.pmi-cta-desc {\r\n  font-size: 18px;\r\n  opacity: 0.85;\r\n  max-width: 560px;\r\n  margin: 0 auto 32px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.pmi-cta-mailto {\r\n  font-size: 18px !important;\r\n  padding: 14px 32px !important;\r\n  border-width: 2px;\r\n  position: relative;\r\n  z-index: 1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.pmi-cta-mailto:hover {\r\n  background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15) !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Responsive */\r\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\r\n  .pmi-cta-box {\r\n    padding: 40px 24px;\r\n  }\r\n  .pmi-cta-title {\r\n    font-size: 24px;\r\n  }\r\n  .pmi-cta-desc {\r\n    font-size: 16px;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n</style><!-- SECCIÓN 1: HERO --><!-- \r\n    ========================================================\r\n    CONTENIDO HTML\r\n    ========================================================\r\n  --><section class="pmi-hero"><div class="pmi-hero__grid"><div class="pmi-hero__content"><p><span class="pmi-badge">Convocatoria 2026</span></p><h1 class="pmi-title">Programa de Mentorías para la Investigación</h1><p class="pmi-hero__desc">Conecta experiencia y talento para transformar resultados de investigación en publicaciones científicas de alto impacto y productos de divulgación.</p><div class="pmi-hero__actions"><a class="pmi-btn pmi-btn--primary" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdXIvUO9ZrpPIsZxhBxZ9ZvjJESC9koU7I0LY-dvOXhvRTCNQ/viewform" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Postula como Mentor</a><br><a class="pmi-btn pmi-btn--outline" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf2QWFW9JIFGHK6aYDjwyZew6AzGXjqGd5rBqX-XgdYBGLtcw/viewform" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Postula como Novel</a><br><a class="pmi-btn pmi-btn--outline" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-06/BasesconvocatoriaPMIUNL.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Bases de convocatoria</a></div></div><div class="pmi-hero__stats"><div class="pmi-stat"><span class="pmi-stat__num">25</span> <span class="pmi-stat__label">Semanas de programa</span></div><div class="pmi-stat"><span class="pmi-stat__num">2</span> <span class="pmi-stat__label">Perfiles participantes</span></div><div class="pmi-stat"><span class="pmi-stat__num">1</span> <span class="pmi-stat__label">Artículo Scopus garantizado</span></div><div class="pmi-stat"><span class="pmi-stat__num">1</span> <span class="pmi-stat__label">Producto de divulgación</span></div></div></div></section><!-- SECCIÓN 2: ¿QUÉ ES Y POR QUÉ PARTICIPAR? --><section class="pmi-section pmi-container pmi-about"><div class="pmi-about__content"><h2>¿Qué es el PMI-UNL?</h2><p>El Programa de Mentorías para la Investigación fortalece las capacidades de investigación, publicación científica y divulgación del conocimiento generado por docentes y técnicos universitarios de la UNL.</p><p>Conecta investigadores con experiencia (Mentores) y nuevos investigadores (Noveles) para convertir resultados previos en artículos científicos publicables en revistas indexadas de alto impacto.</p><p>Además impulsa el trabajo colaborativo y el fortalecimiento de la cultura científica institucional.</p></div><div class="pmi-why__list"><div class="pmi-why__item"><div class="pmi-why__icon"><svg class="pmi-icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"></path></svg></div><div><h3>Incrementa tu impacto científico</h3><p>Fortalece la producción científica de la UNL y eleva tus indicadores personales.</p></div></div><div class="pmi-why__item"><div class="pmi-why__icon"><svg class="pmi-icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg></div><div><h3>Aprende junto a otros investigadores</h3><p>Construye redes académicas e intercambia conocimientos valiosos.</p></div></div><div class="pmi-why__item"><div class="pmi-why__icon"><svg class="pmi-icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"></path></svg></div><div><h3>Genera impacto social</h3><p>Promueve la divulgación científica acercando la ciencia a la sociedad.</p></div></div></div></section><!-- SECCIÓN 3: OBJETIVOS --><section class="pmi-section pmi-section--bg"><div class="pmi-container"><h2 class="pmi-section__title">Objetivos del Programa</h2><div class="pmi-grid-4"><div class="pmi-card-obj"><h3><svg class="pmi-icon pmi-card-obj__icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 20h9"></path><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"></path></svg>Producción</h3><p>Incrementar el volumen de publicaciones institucionales a nivel global.</p></div><div class="pmi-card-obj"><h3><svg class="pmi-icon pmi-card-obj__icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"></path><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"></path></svg>Publicación</h3><p>Transformar resultados previos de investigación en artículos consolidados.</p></div><div class="pmi-card-obj"><h3><svg class="pmi-icon pmi-card-obj__icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3 6 7 1-5 5 1 7-6-3-6 3 1-7-5-5 7-1 3-6z"></path></svg>Capacitación</h3><p>Fortalecer competencias y habilidades de redacción científica en los docentes.</p></div><div class="pmi-card-obj"><h3><svg class="pmi-icon pmi-card-obj__icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"></circle><line x1="8.59" x2="15.42" y1="13.51" y2="17.49"></line><line x1="15.41" x2="8.59" y1="6.51" y2="10.49"></line></svg>Colaboración</h3><p>Fomentar el intercambio de conocimientos y crear redes investigativas internas.</p></div></div></div></section><!-- SECCIÓN 4: CÓMO FUNCIONA --><section class="pmi-section pmi-container"><h2 class="pmi-section__title">¿Cómo funciona el programa?</h2><div class="pmi-steps"><div class="pmi-step"><div class="pmi-step__num">1</div><h3>Postulación</h3><p>Registro y entrega de la documentación requerida según el perfil.</p></div><div class="pmi-step"><div class="pmi-step__num">2</div><h3>Asignación</h3><p>Conformación estratégica de los equipos de trabajo Mentor-Novel.</p></div><div class="pmi-step"><div class="pmi-step__num">3</div><h3>Mentoría</h3><p>Acompañamiento especializado durante un periodo de 25 semanas.</p></div><div class="pmi-step"><div class="pmi-step__num">4</div><h3>Publicación</h3><p>Sometimiento del artículo a revista indexada y entrega del producto de divulgación.</p></div></div></section><!-- SECCIÓN 5: ROLES (Mentor vs Novel) --><section class="pmi-section pmi-section--bg" id="roles"><div class="pmi-container"><h2 class="pmi-section__title">¿Quiénes pueden participar?</h2><div class="pmi-roles"><!-- Tarjeta Mentor --><div class="pmi-role-card"><div class="pmi-role-card__header"><h3>Investigadores Mentores</h3><p>Guías con amplia trayectoria y experiencia científica.</p></div><div class="pmi-role-card__body"><ul><li data-list-item-id="e65d3d84c02ccef84cc9dbb2680bd852e"><strong>Público:</strong> Docentes investigadores de la UNL con experiencia comprobada en publicación de artículos (SciELO, Scopus o Web of Science).</li><li data-list-item-id="ece7b1aa587375fb7d257fde6ead65d31">Contar con un índice de impacto <strong>mayor a 6</strong> o <strong>más de 15 publicaciones</strong>.</li><li data-list-item-id="e0bfde3b22faa711311903256367a2d09">Tener al menos 5 años de experiencia en investigación.</li><li data-list-item-id="e4350dca720ec5464386718b3fbd01ad9">Haber publicado al menos 3 artículos en los últimos 3 años (incluyendo uno en Scopus).</li><li data-list-item-id="e0ca18b5981bc7f057378ac18699641ab">Tener grado académico de Ph.D.</li></ul></div><div class="pmi-role-card__footer"><a class="pmi-btn pmi-btn--primary" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdXIvUO9ZrpPIsZxhBxZ9ZvjJESC9koU7I0LY-dvOXhvRTCNQ/viewform" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Postular como Mentor</a></div></div><!-- Tarjeta Novel --><div class="pmi-role-card"><div class="pmi-role-card__header" style="background-color:var(--pmi-c-blue);"><h3>Investigadores Noveles</h3><p>Nuevos talentos con datos listos para ser publicados.</p></div><div class="pmi-role-card__body"><ul><li data-list-item-id="e8bcb3759ae67b1e57720a9c638c24324"><strong>Público:</strong> Docentes y técnicos de la UNL.</li><li data-list-item-id="e25a388ead2a8d474c9f7b4ea40344719">Deberán contar obligatoriamente con <strong>datos de investigación recolectados o analizados</strong> que aún no han sido convertidos en un artículo.</li><li data-list-item-id="ef7e81d8b5e61b8c4027916b5fdd03539">Requerir apoyo para la fase final de estructuración, redacción y publicación.</li><li data-list-item-id="e57ec4fc1221d6da0d6af9dfcb7cf412f">Poseer índices de impacto <strong>menores a 6</strong> o <strong>menos de 15 publicaciones</strong> históricas.</li></ul></div><div class="pmi-role-card__footer"><a class="pmi-btn pmi-btn--primary" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf2QWFW9JIFGHK6aYDjwyZew6AzGXjqGd5rBqX-XgdYBGLtcw/viewform" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Postular como Novel</a></div></div></div></div></section><!-- SECCIÓN 6: LÍNEAS DE INVESTIGACIÓN Y PRODUCTOS --><section class="pmi-section pmi-container"><h2 class="pmi-section__title">Líneas de Investigación y Resultados</h2><p class="text-align-center" style="color:var(--pmi-c-text-muted);margin-bottom:24px;">El PMI-UNL impulsa investigaciones alineadas con los dominios estratégicos institucionales:</p><div class="pmi-lines"><span class="pmi-line-tag"><svg class="pmi-icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"></path></svg>Salud Integral <svg class="pmi-icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"></path></svg>Energía e Innovación <svg class="pmi-icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s-8-4.5-8-11.8A8 8 0 0 1 12 2a8 8 0 0 1 8 8.2c0 7.3-8 11.8-8 11.8z"></path></svg>Biodiversidad <svg class="pmi-icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"></path><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"></path></svg>Educación <svg class="pmi-icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle><path d="M16.24 7.76a6 6 0 0 1 0 8.49m-8.48-.01a6 6 0 0 1 0-8.49m11.31-2.82a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14m-14.14 0a10 10 0 0 1 0-14.14"></path></svg>Comunicación <svg class="pmi-icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="14" rx="2" ry="2" width="20" x="2" y="7"></rect><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path></svg>Economía y Desarrollo</span></div><div class="pmi-docs-grid" style="margin-top:40px;"><div class="pmi-doc-card"><h3 style="color:var(--pmi-c-blue);margin-bottom:16px;"><svg class="pmi-icon" style="margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle;" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" x2="8" y1="13" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" x2="8" y1="17" y2="17"></line><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline></svg>1. Artículo Científico</h3><p>Artículo finalizado y sometido a una revista científica indexada de prestigio.</p><ul><li data-list-item-id="e58922b532902075db0aa3852038eafb4">Manuscrito estructurado correctamente.</li><li data-list-item-id="e888423617643dddb4558aebd47c1479d">Acompañamiento integral del mentor.</li><li data-list-item-id="ee2be05e3d0c3770392246deba0289b4c">Revisión por pares internos antes del envío.</li></ul></div><div class="pmi-doc-card" style="border-left-color:var(--pmi-c-green);"><h3 style="color:var(--pmi-c-green-dark);margin-bottom:16px;"><svg class="pmi-icon" style="margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle;" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="12" y2="12"></line><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"></path></svg>2. Producto de Divulgación</h3><p>Material adaptado para que la sociedad comprenda los hallazgos de la investigación.</p><ul><li data-list-item-id="e2b9501876eef5e9e5b8f1dea876d5c38">Infografía, video corto, podcast o presentación pública.</li><li data-list-item-id="e45c6459cf45e208cf4c19af25adfa9cf">Lenguaje adaptado para el público general (no especializado).</li><li data-list-item-id="e8d76118f032061c9d53e05b53ba7e668">Difusión a través de canales institucionales.</li></ul></div></div></section><!-- SECCIÓN 7: DOCUMENTACIÓN Y CRONOGRAMA --><section class="pmi-section pmi-section--bg" id="cronograma"><div class="pmi-container"><h2 class="pmi-section__title">Documentación y Fechas Clave</h2><div class="pmi-docs-grid"><!-- Requisitos Documentales --><div class="pmi-card-obj" style="border-top-style:none;"><h3 style="align-items:center;color:var(--pmi-c-navy);display:flex;gap:8px;"><svg class="pmi-icon" style="color:var(--pmi-c-blue);" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" x2="8" y1="13" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" x2="8" y1="17" y2="17"></line><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline></svg>Documentos para Postular</h3><div class="pmi-docs-inner-grid"><div><h4 style="border-bottom:2px solid var(--pmi-c-border);color:var(--pmi-c-text);font-size:16px;margin-bottom:12px;padding-bottom:8px;">Para Mentores</h4><ul style="font-size:15px;padding-left:20px;"><li data-list-item-id="e21ad9529391700373391d97d2adbdbdd">Formulario de postulación.</li><li data-list-item-id="eb59d2471bb33dda7d5309e9398217fe1">CV académico actualizado (hoja de vida).</li><li data-list-item-id="eb8419eb2244f8171f92666c9996e6682">Carta de disponibilidad de horas para la mentoría.</li></ul></div><div><h4 style="border-bottom:2px solid var(--pmi-c-border);color:var(--pmi-c-text);font-size:16px;margin-bottom:12px;padding-bottom:8px;">Para Noveles</h4><ul style="font-size:15px;padding-left:20px;"><li data-list-item-id="e147660ecfc4cf7e95c868343434ada3c">Formulario de postulación.</li><li data-list-item-id="e7bd419bdbcf93c46f5d267ed5f988d49">CV académico actualizado.</li><li data-list-item-id="e64ce20d4781dbad702ba419bffc60b78">Carta de intención y compromiso.</li><li data-list-item-id="e6fa83f6f0ddc73a5bf943efb89100e08">Resumen ejecutivo del proyecto/datos a publicar.</li></ul></div></div></div><!-- Cronograma Vertical --><div class="pmi-card-obj" style="border-top-style:none;"><h3 style="align-items:center;color:var(--pmi-c-navy);display:flex;gap:8px;"><svg class="pmi-icon" style="color:var(--pmi-c-green);" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="18" rx="2" ry="2" width="18" x="3" y="4"></rect><line x1="16" x2="16" y1="2" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" x2="8" y1="2" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" x2="21" y1="10" y2="10"></line></svg>Cronograma 2026 - 2027</h3><div class="pmi-timeline"><div class="pmi-timeline__item"><span class="pmi-timeline__marker">&nbsp;</span> <span class="pmi-timeline__date">15 Junio 2026</span> <span class="pmi-timeline__title">Apertura de convocatoria</span></div><div class="pmi-timeline__item"><span class="pmi-timeline__marker">&nbsp;</span> <span class="pmi-timeline__date">1 Julio 2026</span> <span class="pmi-timeline__title">Cierre de postulaciones</span></div><div class="pmi-timeline__item"><span class="pmi-timeline__marker">&nbsp;</span> <span class="pmi-timeline__date">13 Julio 2026</span> <span class="pmi-timeline__title">Publicación de resultados</span></div><div class="pmi-timeline__item"><span class="pmi-timeline__marker">&nbsp;</span> <span class="pmi-timeline__date">1 Septiembre 2026</span> <span class="pmi-timeline__title">Inicio del programa</span></div><div class="pmi-timeline__item"><span class="pmi-timeline__marker">&nbsp;</span> <span class="pmi-timeline__date" style="color:var(--pmi-c-red);">19 Febrero 2027</span> <span class="pmi-timeline__title"><strong>Entrega de productos finales</strong></span></div></div></div></div></div></section><!-- SECCIÓN CTA - CONTACTO --><section class="pmi-section pmi-cta-section"><div class="pmi-container"><div class="pmi-cta-box"><div class="pmi-cta-icon"><svg class="pmi-icon" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg></div><h2 class="pmi-cta-title">¿Tienes consultas sobre el programa?</h2><p class="pmi-cta-desc">Nuestro equipo está listo para orientarte en el proceso de postulación y resolver cualquier inquietud que tengas sobre el PMI-UNL.</p><a class="pmi-btn pmi-btn--outline pmi-cta-mailto" href="mailto:programa.mentorias@unl.edu.ec"><svg class="pmi-icon" style="height:20px;margin-right:8px;width:20px;" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline></svg></a><p><a class="pmi-btn pmi-btn--outline pmi-cta-mailto" href="mailto:programa.mentorias@unl.edu.ec">programa.mentorias@unl.edu.ec</a></p></div></div></section><!-- \r\n    ========================================================\r\n    JAVASCRIPT (Lógica local segura)\r\n    ========================================================\r\n  --><script>\r\n    (function() {\r\n      'use strict';\r\n      \r\n      const configurarScrollSuave = () => {\r\n        const enlacesInternos = document.querySelectorAll('.pmi-btn-scroll');\r\n        \r\n        enlacesInternos.forEach(enlace => {\r\n          enlace.addEventListener('click', function(evento) {\r\n            evento.preventDefault();\r\n            const idDestino = this.getAttribute('href');\r\n            \r\n            if (idDestino && idDestino.startsWith('#')) {\r\n              const elementoDestino = document.querySelector(idDestino);\r\n              \r\n              if (elementoDestino) {\r\n                elementoDestino.scrollIntoView({ \r\n                  behavior: 'smooth',\r\n                  block: 'start'\r\n                });\r\n              }\r\n            }\r\n          });\r\n        });\r\n      };\r\n\r\n      if (document.readyState === 'loading') {\r\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', configurarScrollSuave);\r\n      } else {\r\n        configurarScrollSuave();\r\n      }\r\n    })();\r\n  </script></div>	full_html
texto_libre	0	131	1746	es	0	<div style="background-color:#f9f9f9;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);margin:20px 0;padding:20px;"><p>La Universidad Nacional de Loja, mediante las líneas de investigación y los proyectos que en ellas se ejecutan, forma parte de 17 redes y alianzas de investigación en las que participan docentes, investigadores y estudiantes.</p><style type="text/css">/* Comentario: Estilo para resaltar al pasar el mouse */\r\n  .resaltado:hover {\r\n    background-color: #cce5ff; /* Comentario: Cambia el color de fondo a un azul claro */\r\n    border-radius: 8px;        /* Comentario: Aplica un borde redondeado */\r\n    padding: 10px;             /* Comentario: Añade un padding para dar más espacio */\r\n    transition: background-color 0.3s ease; /* Comentario: Añade una transición suave */\r\n  }\r\n</style><div style="background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #ddd;margin-top:10px;padding:15px;"><!-- Comentario: Aplicación de la clase 'resaltado' al <summary> --><details><summary class="resaltado"><strong>Redes de investigación en las que participan docentes de la Universidad Nacional de Loja:</strong></summary><hr><p><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/RedBio_0.png" data-align="right" data-entity-uuid="a7684fae-11f7-4292-adf7-5b64b07fb025" data-entity-type="file" alt="redbio" width="269" height="91"><a href="http://inabio.biodiversidad.gob.ec/">LA RED NACIONAL DE INVESTIGACIÓN SOBRE LA DIVERSIDAD BIOLÓGICA DEL ECUADOR&nbsp;</a></p><ul><li data-list-item-id="e649beeb14b323192cf16206d37b1cf9b">Ing. Nikolay Aguirre</li><li data-list-item-id="e624a3fc389ea491a0014867629f2ad35">Ing. Zhofre Aguirre</li><li data-list-item-id="ee647a1975b9d0777e62b25a5540ad1d8">Ing. Nelson Jaramillo</li><li data-list-item-id="ef5be349a4e21e852687734d490c080ae">Ing. Johana Muñoz</li><li data-list-item-id="e4d66b6092c17443b54ce740fa38bcb28">Ing. Juan Maita</li></ul><hr><p><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/aeeree.png" data-align="right" data-entity-uuid="948eefbc-c318-4260-be13-9a9aeeda849c" data-entity-type="file" alt="aeeree" width="112" height="112"><a href="https://aeeree.org/">ASOCIACIÓN ECUATORIANADE ENERGÍAS RENOVABLES Y EFICIENCIA ENERGÉTICA (AEE-REE)</a></p><ul><li data-list-item-id="ef20a260ac8a47fe4be02b945bd045848">Ing. Carlos Gustavo Samaniego</li><li data-list-item-id="e4b870760c2b890c538af2a9573e0b914">Ing. Juan Carlos Solano</li><li data-list-item-id="e6defc21932d1096533049f3d4c898b2f">Ing. Pablo Fernando Ordóñez</li><li data-list-item-id="e971efcadf667194a9c6b49f17c78a218">Ing. Jorge Luis Maldonado</li></ul><hr><p><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/RedEcuatoriana.png" data-align="right" data-entity-uuid="3adaba5e-3856-4d7a-81d9-fdb6ffc941e4" data-entity-type="file" alt="RedEcuatoriana" width="224" height="53"><a href="https://regap.iaen.edu.ec/" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="RED ECUATORIANA DE GOBIERNO Y ADMINISTRACIÓN PÚBLICA (REGAP)">RED ECUATORIANA DE GOBIERNO Y ADMINISTRACIÓN PÚBLICA (REGAP)</a></p><ul><li data-list-item-id="e24618b62f3fd0fa736a37edf92a1287b"><p class="text-align-justify">Ing. José Rodrigo Maldonado.</p></li></ul><hr><p><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/Relieve.png" data-align="right" data-entity-uuid="880f3521-f74a-4b60-9821-0b9238c49083" data-entity-type="file" alt="Relieve" width="142" height="62"></p><p><a href="https://redrelieve.com">RED LATINOAMERICANA DE INVESTIGACIÓN EN ENERGÍA Y VEHÍCULOS (RELIEVE)</a></p><ul><li data-list-item-id="e92c873a4d5d4f75c77f754d0cb3b9c1a">Ing. Jairo Darío Castillo Calderón.</li></ul><hr><p><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/LOGO-REDU.png" data-align="right" data-entity-uuid="cef9e9c4-95f8-4d2e-bc5a-28b11bb85f85" data-entity-type="file" alt="Redu" width="128" height="75"></p><p><a href="https://redu.edu.ec/">RED ECUATORIANA DE UNIVERSIDADES Y ESCUELAS POLITÉCNICAS PARA LA INVESTIGACIÓN Y POSGRADOS - REDU</a></p><ul><li data-list-item-id="e6b27e69f21a7a06d4ed55abbdf234cc9">Ing. Max Encalada Córdova.</li></ul><hr><p><a href="https://www.unl.edu.ec/investigacion">RED NACIONAL DE CONOCIMIENTO SOBRE PRODUCTOS FORESTALES NO MADERABLES DEL ECUADOR</a></p><ul><li data-list-item-id="ed458a41384dc2c7d2da9a1be99199502">Ing. Paúl Eguiguren.</li></ul><hr><p><a href="https://rediberoestudios.org/"><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/logo-red-iberoamericana-T-600px.png" data-align="right" data-entity-uuid="bb2fecef-1730-4e82-89ec-29faeea15ccb" data-entity-type="file" alt="iberoamericana" width="232" height="50">RED IBEROAMERICANA DE GOBIERNO, POLÍTICA Y GESTIÓN PÚBLICA</a></p><ul><li data-list-item-id="e51203b02773155ce2bdcfc26289cb352">Ing. José Rodrigo Maldonado.</li></ul><hr><p><a href="https://www.unl.edu.ec/investigacion">RED DE EDUCACIÓN INFANTIL LOJA (REDI-Loja)</a></p><ul><li data-list-item-id="e887d05489a41efc86cd5ecb6ca8469c4">Dr. Richard Ruiz</li></ul><hr><p><a href="http://redinvestigacionfeminista.org/">RED FEMINISTA INTERUNIVERSITARIA</a></p><ul><li data-list-item-id="e3c18ac9426a69796fb2669f7193eb71e">Dra. Celsa Beatriz Carrión</li></ul><hr><p><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/Imagen2.png" data-align="right" data-entity-uuid="2f84db0a-709c-47fd-b973-9d321ad5f1f2" data-entity-type="file" alt="CLEI" width="114" height="60"><a href="https://clei.org/">CENTRO LATINO AMERICANO DE ESTUDIOS EN INFORMÁTICA</a></p><ul><li data-list-item-id="e57c3d82e5a10dfb930d9d92933e35bfa">Ing. Luis Chamba Eras</li></ul><hr><p><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/IMHEA.png" data-align="right" data-entity-uuid="5a3b3bec-4f8c-4038-a5c2-472673c6a222" data-entity-type="file" alt="IMHEA" width="244" height="59"><a href="https://imhea.org/">INICIATIVA REGIONAL DE MONITOREO HIDROLÓGICO DE ECOSISTEMAS ANDINOS (IMHEA)</a></p><ul><li data-list-item-id="ed32389ca9ed7a747a7fc87ff40220773">Ing. Nikolay Aguirre.</li></ul><hr><p><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/BOSQUES%20Andinos.png" data-align="right" data-entity-uuid="0f9