texto_libre	0	114	1363	en	0	<div class="drci-micrositio"><style>\r\n.drci-micrositio *{\r\n    margin:0;\r\n    padding:0;\r\n    box-sizing:border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio{\r\n    font-family:'Montserrat', sans-serif;\r\n    color:#1b1b1b;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio a{\r\n    color:#93000b;\r\n    text-decoration:none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =========================================\r\n   INTRO\r\n========================================= */\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio .drci-intro p{\r\n    color:#3a3a3a;\r\n    line-height:1.9;\r\n    font-size:1.05rem;\r\n    text-align:justify;\r\n    margin-bottom:16px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio .drci-intro-titulo{\r\n    color:#93000b;\r\n    font-size:1.3rem;\r\n    font-weight:700;\r\n    margin:30px 0 20px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =========================================\r\n   MODALIDADES\r\n========================================= */\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio .drci-modalidades{\r\n    display:grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));\r\n    gap:20px;\r\n    margin-bottom:50px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio .drci-modalidad{\r\n    background:#ffffff;\r\n    border:1px solid #dfe7f1;\r\n    border-top:4px solid #93000b;\r\n    border-radius:12px;\r\n    padding:24px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio .drci-modalidad h4{\r\n    color:#93000b;\r\n    font-size:1.05rem;\r\n    margin-bottom:10px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio .drci-modalidad p{\r\n    color:#3a3a3a;\r\n    line-height:1.7;\r\n    font-size:.95rem;\r\n    text-align:justify;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =========================================\r\n   IMPORTANTE\r\n========================================= */\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio .drci-importante{\r\n    background:#fbecec;\r\n    border-left:4px solid #93000b;\r\n    border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;\r\n    padding:24px 30px;\r\n    margin-bottom:50px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio .drci-importante h4{\r\n    color:#93000b;\r\n    font-size:1.1rem;\r\n    margin-bottom:10px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio .drci-importante p{\r\n    color:#3a3a3a;\r\n    line-height:1.7;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio .drci-importante a{\r\n    font-weight:700;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =========================================\r\n   FORMULARIOS DESCARGABLES\r\n========================================= */\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio .drci-formularios{\r\n    display:grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));\r\n    gap:24px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio .drci-form-card{\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n    gap:16px;\r\n    background:#ffffff;\r\n    border:1px solid #dfe7f1;\r\n    border-radius:12px;\r\n    padding:22px;\r\n    transition:.3s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio .drci-form-card:hover{\r\n    border-color:#93000b;\r\n    transform:translateY(-4px);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio .drci-form-icon{\r\n    position:relative;\r\n    flex-shrink:0;\r\n    width:48px;\r\n    height:48px;\r\n    border-radius:10px;\r\n    background:#93000b;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio .drci-form-icon::after{\r\n    content:"";\r\n    position:absolute;\r\n    top:50%;\r\n    left:50%;\r\n    width:12px;\r\n    height:12px;\r\n    border-left:2px solid #ffffff;\r\n    border-bottom:2px solid #ffffff;\r\n    transform:translate(-50%,-60%) rotate(-45deg);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.drci-micrositio .drci-form-card span{\r\n    color:#93000b;\r\n    font-weight:700;\r\n    line-height:1.4;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =========================================\r\n   RESPONSIVE\r\n========================================= */\r\n\r\n@media(max-width:480px){\r\n    .drci-micrositio .drci-importante{\r\n        padding:20px;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n</style><!-- INTRO --><div class="drci-intro"><p>Los estudiantes de la Universidad Nacional de Loja pueden tomar asignaturas o un semestre en otras universidades nacionales o internacionales. De igual manera, alumnos extranjeros o nacionales de grado y posgrado pueden tomar asignaturas o semestres en la UNL.</p><div class="drci-intro-titulo">El intercambio estudiantil puede darse de cuatro maneras</div></div><!-- MODALIDADES --><div class="drci-modalidades"><div class="drci-modalidad"><h4>Presencial</h4><p>El/la estudiante de movilidad entrante y saliente tiene que atender presencialmente de acuerdo a los requerimientos de la universidad.</p></div><div class="drci-modalidad"><h4>Semipresencial</h4><p>El/la estudiante puede tomar algunas asignaturas de manera presencial y virtual, de acuerdo a los requerimientos de la universidad.</p></div><div class="drci-modalidad"><h4>Virtual</h4><p>El/la estudiante toma todas las asignaturas o semestre de manera virtual.</p></div><div class="drci-modalidad"><h4>Prácticas / Pasantías</h4><p>El/la estudiante puede realizar sus prácticas preprofesionales tanto en movilidad entrante como saliente, estancias de investigación o docencia, participación en eventos internacionales y visitas académicas y de observación.</p></div></div><!-- IMPORTANTE --><div class="drci-importante"><h4>Importante</h4><p>Descarga el formulario de movilidad estudiantil y envíalo a: <a href="mailto:cooperacion@unl.edu.ec">cooperacion@unl.edu.ec</a></p></div><!-- FORMULARIOS DESCARGABLES --><div class="drci-formularios"><div class="drci-form-icon">&nbsp;</div><p><a class="drci-form-card" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2023-07/Intercambio%20estudiantes%20extranjeros.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>Intercambio estudiantes extranjeros</span>&nbsp;</a></p><div class="drci-form-icon">&nbsp;</div><p><a class="drci-form-card" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2023-07/Intercambio%20estudiantes%20UNL.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>Intercambio estudiantes UNL</span>&nbsp;</a></p></div></div>	full_html
texto_libre	0	111	1372	en	0	<p><br><style type="text/css">/* BASE */\r\n    body {\r\n      margin: 0;\r\n      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\r\n      background: #ffffff;\r\n      color: #111;\r\n      overflow-x: hidden;\r\n    }\r\n    /* FONDO */\r\n    .background {\r\n      position: fixed;\r\n      width: 100%;\r\n      height: 100%;\r\n      z-index: -2;\r\n      background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, #22c55e20, transparent 40%),\r\n                  radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, #16a34a15, transparent 40%);\r\n    }\r\n    /* HERO FULL IMAGE */\r\n    .hero {\r\n      min-height: 80vh;\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n      padding: 60px 8%;\r\n      position: relative;\r\n      color: white;\r\n    }\r\n    .hero::before {\r\n      content: "";\r\n      position: absolute;\r\n      inset: 0;\r\n      background: url('https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/IMG_0503.jpeg') center/cover no-repeat;\r\n      z-index: -1;\r\n    }\r\n    .hero::after {\r\n      content: "";\r\n      position: absolute;\r\n      inset: 0;\r\n      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\r\n      z-index: -1;\r\n    }\r\n    .hero h1 {\r\n      font-size: 3rem;\r\n    }\r\n    .hero span {\r\n      color: #22c55e;\r\n    }\r\n    /* PLANTA */\r\n    .plant-container {\r\n      position: fixed;\r\n      left: 70px;\r\n      top: 0;\r\n      height: 100vh;\r\n      width: 100px;\r\n      z-index: 5;\r\n      pointer-events: none;\r\n      transition: opacity 0.4s ease;\r\n    }\r\n    .plant-container.hide-plant {\r\n      opacity: 0;\r\n    }\r\n    @media (max-width: 900px) {\r\n      .plant-container {\r\n        display: none;\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n    .stem {\r\n      width: 6px;\r\n      background: linear-gradient(#16a34a, #22c55e);\r\n      height: 0;\r\n      margin: auto;\r\n      transition: height 0.25s ease-out;\r\n    }\r\n    .leaf {\r\n      width: 34px;\r\n      height: 20px;\r\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4ade80, #16a34a);\r\n      clip-path: ellipse(50% 50% at 50% 50%);\r\n      position: absolute;\r\n      opacity: 0;\r\n      transform: scale(0) rotate(0deg);\r\n      transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);\r\n      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(22,163,74,0.35);\r\n    }\r\n    .leaf::after {\r\n      content: "";\r\n      position: absolute;\r\n      top: 50%;\r\n      left: 6px;\r\n      right: 6px;\r\n      height: 1.5px;\r\n      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\r\n      transform: translateY(-50%);\r\n    }\r\n    .l1 { top: 90px;  left: 46px; transform-origin: left center; }\r\n    .l2 { top: 210px; left: -18px; transform-origin: right center; }\r\n    .l3 { top: 330px; left: 46px; transform-origin: left center; }\r\n    .l4 { top: 450px; left: -18px; transform-origin: right center; }\r\n    .l5 { top: 570px; left: 46px; transform-origin: left center; }\r\n    .l6 { top: 690px; left: -18px; transform-origin: right center; }\r\n    .leaf.active { opacity: 1; }\r\n    .l1.active { transform: scale(1.15) rotate(-20deg); }\r\n    .l2.active { transform: scale(1.15) rotate(20deg); }\r\n    .l3.active { transform: scale(1.15) rotate(-20deg); }\r\n    .l4.active { transform: scale(1.15) rotate(20deg); }\r\n    .l5.active { transform: scale(1.15) rotate(-20deg); }\r\n    .l6.active { transform: scale(1.15) rotate(20deg); }\r\n    /* SECCIONES */\r\n    .section {\r\n      padding: 50px 8%;\r\n    }\r\n    /* TITULOS */\r\n    h2 {\r\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n    }\r\n    /* GRID */\r\n    .grid {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));\r\n      gap: 15px;\r\n    }\r\n    /* CARD */\r\n    .card {\r\n      background: #f9fafb;\r\n      padding: 20px;\r\n      border-radius: 14px;\r\n      border: 1px solid #eee;\r\n    }\r\n    /* BOTÓN LINK */\r\n    .btn {\r\n      display: inline-block;\r\n      margin-top: 10px;\r\n      padding: 8px 18px;\r\n      border-radius: 20px;\r\n      background: #16a34a;\r\n      color: white;\r\n      text-decoration: none;\r\n    }\r\n    /* ACCORDION */\r\n    .accordion-item {\r\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n      border-radius: 12px;\r\n      overflow: hidden;\r\n      border: 1px solid #eee;\r\n    }\r\n    .accordion-header {\r\n      padding: 15px;\r\n      cursor: pointer;\r\n      background: #f9fafb;\r\n      font-weight: 600;\r\n    }\r\n    .accordion-content {\r\n      max-height: 0;\r\n      overflow: hidden;\r\n      transition: 0.4s;\r\n      padding: 0 15px;\r\n    }\r\n    .accordion-content a {\r\n      display: block;\r\n      margin: 10px 0;\r\n    }\r\n    /* REVEAL */\r\n    .reveal {\r\n      opacity: 0;\r\n      transform: translateY(30px);\r\n      transition: 0.6s;\r\n    }\r\n    .reveal.active {\r\n      opacity: 1;\r\n      transform: translateY(0);\r\n    }\r\n    /* ICONO + */\r\n    .accordion-header {\r\n      position: relative;\r\n      padding-right: 40px;\r\n    }\r\n    .accordion-header::after {\r\n      content: "+";\r\n      position: absolute;\r\n      right: 15px;\r\n      top: 50%;\r\n      transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(0deg);\r\n      font-size: 20px;\r\n      font-weight: bold;\r\n      color: #16a34a;\r\n      transition: transform 0.3s ease;\r\n    }\r\n    /* cuando está abierto */\r\n    .accordion-header.active::after {\r\n      transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(45deg);\r\n    }\r\n    </style></p><div class="background">&nbsp;</div><!-- PLANTA --><div class="plant-container"><div class="stem" id="stem">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l1" id="l1">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l2" id="l2">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l3" id="l3">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l4" id="l4">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l5" id="l5">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l6" id="l6">&nbsp;</div></div><!-- HERO --><div class="hero"><div><h1 class="text-align-center">UNL <span>SOSTENIBLE</span></h1><p class="text-align-center">Innovación, educación y compromiso con el futuro.</p></div></div><!-- POLÍTICAS --><div class="section"><h2><meta charset="UTF-8"></h2><p>La Universidad Nacional de Loja asume su compromiso con el modelo UNL Sostenible, una estrategia institucional orientada a integrar la sostenibilidad en todos sus ámbitos: académico, investigativo, de ge y vinculación con la sociedad. Este compromiso forma parte del Plan Estratégico de Desarrollo Institucional, que busca promover una universidad responsable con el entorno, que fomente la innovación, el uso eficiente de los recursos y la formación de ciudadanos comprometidos con un desarrollo equilibrado y sostenible para el sur del Ecuador y el mundo.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2></div><!-- ACCORDION --><div class="section"><h2>Recursos institucionales</h2><p>Asegura equidad, accesibilidad y participación plena en la UNL</p><div class="accordion"><!-- POLITICAS --><div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header">Políticas y planes</div><div class="accordion-content"><a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/unl_politica_de_inclusion_educativa_2025.pdf" target="_blank">Política de inclusión</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/14-04-26_UNL_PLAN%20SOSTENIBIIDAD%20FINAL%20pdf.pdf" target="_blank">Plan de Gestión de Sostenibilidad</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/PROPUESTA%20POLITICA%20COMPRAS%20E%20INVERSIONES%20SOSTENIBLES%20.pdf" target="_blank">Política de Compras e Inversiones Sostenibles</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/pol%C3%ADtica_de_sostenibilidad_unl_certificacion-signed.pdf" target="_blank">Política de Sostenibilidad de la Universidad Nacional de Loja</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/resoluci%C3%B3n_so-no.03-rocs-no.8.4-07-02-2026_aprobacion_politica_de_sostenibilidad.pdf" target="_blank">Resolución Nro. SO-No.03-ROCS-No-8.4-07-04-2026</a></div></div><!-- PARTICIPACIÓN --><p>Accede a nuestras líneas de participación institucional</p></div><div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header">Participación y democracia</div><div class="accordion-content"><a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/Acuerdo%20SENESCYT-CZ7-2023-001-OS%20Asociacio%CC%81n%20General%20de%20Docentes%20Universitarios%20de%20Loja%20%E2%80%9CAGEDUL%E2%80%9D.pdf" target="_blank">AGEDUL</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/ASA-UNL.PDF.pdf" target="_blank">ASA</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/ESTATUTO%20FEUE%20LOJA.pdf" target="_blank">FEUE Loja</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/Sindicatos%20de%20trabajadores%20la%20Argelia_UNL.pdf" target="_blank">Sindicato La Argelia</a></div></div><!-- DOCUMENTOS --><p>Documento guía para la gestión estratégica de la UNL</p><div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header">Documentos institucionales</div><div class="accordion-content"><a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-10/PEDI_UNL_2024-2028_ACTUALIZADO_PND_2025-2029_VFINAL_OCS_15-10-25.pdf" target="_blank">Plan Estratégico de Desarrollo Institucional (PEDI)</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-10/Informe%20Autodiagno%CC%81stico%20RESIES%20UNL-1.pdf" target="_blank">Informe de Autodiagnóstico RESIES</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-06/2025_unl_memoria_sostenibilidad_29-05-26_1.pdf" target="_blank">Memoria de Sostenibilidad</a></div></div></div><script>\r\n// REVEAL + PLANTA\r\nwindow.addEventListener("scroll", () => {\r\n  document.querySelectorAll(".reveal").forEach(el => {\r\n    let top = el.getBoundingClientRect().top;\r\n    if (top < window.innerHeight - 80) {\r\n      el.classList.add("active");\r\n    }\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  let plantContainer = document.querySelector(".plant-container");\r\n  let stem = document.getElementById("stem");\r\n  if (!plantContainer || !stem) return;\r\n\r\n  let scrollable = document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;\r\n  let progress = scrollable > 0 ? window.scrollY / scrollable : 0;\r\n  progress = Math.min(Math.max(progress, 0), 1);\r\n\r\n  let maxStemHeight = 720; // cubre el top de la última hoja (l6: 690px)\r\n  let growth = progress * maxStemHeight;\r\n  stem.style.height = growth + "px";\r\n\r\n  document.querySelectorAll(".leaf").forEach(leaf => {\r\n    let leafTop = parseInt(getComputedStyle(leaf).top, 10);\r\n    if (growth >= leafTop) {\r\n      leaf.classList.add("active");\r\n    } else {\r\n      leaf.classList.remove("active");\r\n    }\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  // Ocultar la planta cerca del final de la página para no taparse con el footer/contenido final\r\n  plantContainer.classList.toggle("hide-plant", progress > 0.92);\r\n});\r\n// ACCORDION\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll(".accordion-header").forEach(header => {\r\n  header.addEventListener("click", () => {\r\n    let content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    document.querySelectorAll(".accordion-content").forEach(item => {\r\n      if (item !== content) item.style.maxHeight = null;\r\n    });\r\n    content.style.maxHeight = content.scrollHeight + "px";\r\n  });\r\n});\r\n</script><!--\r\n  ==========================================================================\r\n  UNL SOSTENIBLE — Secciones nuevas: "Rankings y reconocimientos" +\r\n  "Iniciativas internacionales"\r\n  ==========================================================================\r\n  CAMBIOS EN ESTA VERSIÓN\r\n  1. Todas las medidas de texto/espaciado pasaron de rem a px.\r\n  2. Los iconos de la sección de rankings ahora representan a los 4 sistemas\r\n     de evaluación (SCImago, UI GreenMetric, THE World University Rankings,\r\n     Webometrics). Son versiones simplificadas/genéricas inspiradas en la\r\n     forma de cada símbolo (columnas, globo, insignia, red), NO reproducciones\r\n     exactas de los logotipos originales -> los logos oficiales son marca\r\n     registrada de cada organización, así que para el logo pixel-perfecto\r\n     te recomiendo descargarlo del kit de prensa/branding de cada ranking\r\n     y reemplazar el <svg> de ese icono por su <img> oficial.\r\n  3. El fondo decorativo de las tarjetas de "Iniciativas internacionales" ya\r\n     no es una hoja tipo burbuja: ahora la tarjeta verde tiene un patrón de\r\n     planta/ramificación (sostenibilidad) y la tarjeta agua tiene un patrón\r\n     de átomo/órbitas (investigación).\r\n  4. Sigue sin tocar la paleta de colores del sitio (variables --unl-verde-*,\r\n     --unl-agua-*, --unl-tierra-* al inicio del <style>).\r\n  5. Los textos marcados "[EDITAR]" siguen siendo plantilla: reemplázalos\r\n     con los datos reales de la universidad.\r\n  ==========================================================================\r\n--><section class="unl-sost-wrap" id="unl-rankings-iniciativas"><style type="text/css">#unl-rankings-iniciativas{\r\n        --unl-verde-950:#0b2b1c;\r\n        --unl-verde-800:#12472c;\r\n        --unl-verde-700:#1b5e39;\r\n        --unl-verde-600:#2c7a4b;\r\n        --unl-verde-400:#5aa878;\r\n        --unl-verde-200:#bfe0cd;\r\n        --unl-verde-100:#e4f3ea;\r\n        --unl-tierra-600:#8a6a3f;\r\n        --unl-tierra-200:#ecdfc7;\r\n        --unl-agua-600:#1f7a8c;\r\n        --unl-agua-200:#cfeef2;\r\n        --unl-texto:#16241c;\r\n        --unl-texto-suave:#4a5c52;\r\n        --unl-borde:#d8e6dc;\r\n        --unl-fondo-card:#ffffff;\r\n        --unl-radio:14px;\r\n        font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n        color: var(--unl-texto);\r\n        max-width: 1180px;\r\n        margin: 0 auto;\r\n        padding: 56px 20px;\r\n        box-sizing: border-box;\r\n      }\r\n      #unl-rankings-iniciativas *{ box-sizing: border-box; }\r\n      .unl-sost-eyebrow{\r\n        display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\r\n        font-size:12px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.08em;\r\n        text-transform:uppercase; color: var(--unl-verde-700);\r\n        background: var(--unl-verde-100);\r\n        border:1px solid var(--unl-verde-200);\r\n        padding:5px 12px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:14px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-sost-eyebrow .dot{\r\n        width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;\r\n        background: var(--unl-verde-600);\r\n        animation: unlPulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-sost-h2{\r\n        font-size: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 34px);\r\n        font-weight: 800; line-height:1.2; margin:0 0 10px;\r\n        color: var(--unl-verde-950);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-sost-sub{\r\n        font-size:16px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave);\r\n        max-width:62ch; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 35px;\r\n      }\r\n      /* ============ SECCIÓN 1: RANKINGS ============ */\r\n      .unl-rank-section{ margin-bottom:72px; position:relative; }\r\n      .unl-rank-grid{\r\n        display:grid;\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));\r\n        gap:20px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-card{\r\n        background: var(--unl-fondo-card);\r\n        border:1px solid var(--unl-borde);\r\n        border-radius: var(--unl-radio);\r\n        padding:24px 22px;\r\n        position:relative;\r\n        overflow:hidden;\r\n        transition: transform .35s ease, box-shadow .35s ease, border-color .35s ease;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-card:hover{\r\n        transform: translateY(-4px);\r\n        box-shadow: 0 14px 28px -14px rgba(18,71,44,.25);\r\n        border-color: var(--unl-verde-400);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-card::before{\r\n        content:"";\r\n        position:absolute; inset:0 0 auto 0; height:4px;\r\n        background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--unl-verde-600), var(--unl-agua-600));\r\n        transform-origin:left; transform:scaleX(0);\r\n        transition: transform .6s ease;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-card.unl-inview::before{ transform:scaleX(1); }\r\n      .unl-rank-icon{\r\n        width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;\r\n        background: var(--unl-verde-100);\r\n        display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\r\n        margin-bottom:16px; color: var(--unl-verde-700);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-icon svg{ width:24px;height:24px; }\r\n      .unl-rank-label{\r\n        font-size:13px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave); font-weight:600;\r\n        text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.03em; margin-bottom:5px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-number{\r\n        font-size:32px; font-weight:800; color: var(--unl-verde-800);\r\n        line-height:1; display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:5px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-number .unl-rank-suffix{ font-size:17px; font-weight:700; color: var(--unl-verde-600); }\r\n      .unl-rank-desc{ font-size:14px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave); margin-top:9px; line-height:1.5; }\r\n      .unl-rank-tag{\r\n        display:inline-block; margin-top:14px; font-size:12px; font-weight:700;\r\n        color: var(--unl-tierra-600); background: var(--unl-tierra-200);\r\n        padding:3px 9px; border-radius:6px;\r\n      }\r\n      /* Ring de progreso circular (áreas evaluadas) */\r\n      .unl-ring-block{\r\n        margin-top:40px; padding-top:35px;\r\n        border-top:1px dashed var(--unl-borde);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-ring-title{ font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 22px; color: var(--unl-verde-950); }\r\n      .unl-ring-grid{\r\n        display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px,1fr));\r\n        gap:20px; text-align:center;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-ring-item{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:10px; }\r\n      .unl-ring-svg{ width:88px; height:88px; }\r\n      .unl-ring-track{ fill:none; stroke: var(--unl-verde-100); stroke-width:8; }\r\n      .unl-ring-bar{\r\n        fill:none; stroke: var(--unl-verde-600); stroke-width:8; stroke-linecap:round;\r\n        stroke-dasharray: 251; stroke-dashoffset: 251;\r\n        transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.4s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-ring-pct{ font-size:15px; font-weight:800; fill: var(--unl-verde-800); }\r\n      .unl-ring-name{ font-size:12px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave); font-weight:600; line-height:1.3; }\r\n      /* ============ SECCIÓN 2: INICIATIVAS INTERNACIONALES ============ */\r\n      .unl-init-section{ position:relative; }\r\n      .unl-init-grid{\r\n        display:grid;\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\r\n        gap:24px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-card{\r\n        background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--unl-verde-950) 0%, var(--unl-verde-800) 100%);\r\n        border-radius: var(--unl-radio);\r\n        padding:28px;\r\n        color:#f2f8f4;\r\n        position:relative;\r\n        overflow:hidden;\r\n        min-height:260px;\r\n        display:flex; flex-direction:column;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-card.unl-agua{\r\n        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0c3b44 0%, #124f5c 100%);\r\n      }\r\n      /* --- Fondos decorativos temáticos --- */\r\n      .unl-init-motif{\r\n        position:absolute; right:-22px; top:-22px; width:190px; height:190px;\r\n        opacity:.16; pointer-events:none;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-motif.unl-motif-atomo{ animation: unlSpin 22s linear infinite; }\r\n      .unl-init-card.unl-agua .unl-init-motif circle,\r\n      .unl-init-card.unl-agua .unl-init-motif ellipse{ stroke:#dff5f8; }\r\n      .unl-init-card:not(.unl-agua) .unl-init-motif path,\r\n      .unl-init-card:not(.unl-agua) .unl-init-motif circle{ stroke:#d9f0e2; fill:#d9f0e2; }\r\n      .unl-init-top{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:18px; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n      .unl-init-badge{\r\n        font-size:11px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em;\r\n        background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); padding:5px 10px; border-radius:999px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-year{ font-size:12px; color:#cfe6d8; font-weight:600; }\r\n      .unl-init-name{ font-size:20px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 9px; line-height:1.25; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n      .unl-init-desc{ font-size:15px; color:#d8ebe0; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 19px; flex:1; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n      .unl-init-progress-row{ margin-top:auto; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n      .unl-init-progress-label{\r\n        display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:12px;\r\n        color:#cfe6d8; margin-bottom:6px; font-weight:600;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-bar-track{\r\n        width:100%; height:8px; border-radius:999px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.14);\r\n        overflow:hidden;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-bar-fill{\r\n        height:100%; border-radius:999px;\r\n        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7fd7a5, #b7e8c9);\r\n        width:0%; transition: width 1.6s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-agua .unl-init-bar-fill{ background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6cc9d6, #a9e4ec); }\r\n      @keyframes unlSpin{ from{ transform: rotate(0deg);} to{ transform: rotate(360deg);} }\r\n      @keyframes unlPulse{\r\n        0%,100%{ opacity:1; transform:scale(1); }\r\n        50%{ opacity:.4; transform:scale(1.3); }\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-fade-up{\r\n        opacity:0; transform: translateY(18px);\r\n        transition: opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-fade-up.unl-inview{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }\r\n      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\r\n        #unl-rankings-iniciativas *{ animation:none !important; transition:none !important; }\r\n        .unl-fade-up{ opacity:1; transform:none; }\r\n      }\r\n      @media (max-width: 620px){\r\n        #unl-rankings-iniciativas{ padding: 40px 16px; }\r\n        .unl-rank-number{ font-size:26px; }\r\n      }\r\n    </style><!-- ===================== SECCIÓN 1: RANKINGS ===================== --><div class="unl-rank-section"><p><span class="unl-sost-eyebrow">Reconocimientos</span></p><h2 class="unl-sost-h2">Rankings y reconocimientos en sostenibilidad</h2><p class="unl-sost-sub">Resultados obtenidos por la Universidad Nacional de Loja en los principales sistemas internacionales que evalúan investigación, impacto y sostenibilidad institucional.</p><div class="unl-rank-grid"><!-- Tarjeta 1: SCImago --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 8l9-5 9 5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><rect height="9" width="2.4" x="4" y="9"></rect><rect height="9" width="2.4" x="9" y="9"></rect><rect height="9" width="2.4" x="14" y="9"></rect><rect height="9" width="1.6" x="19" y="9"></rect><rect height="2" width="18" x="3" y="19"></rect></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">SCImago Institutions Rankings</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="8">0</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Entre universidades públicas del Ecuador por su impacto, la calidad y la visibilidad de la producción científica.</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición 2025</span></p></div><!-- Tarjeta 2: UI GreenMetric --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M4 10.5c2.5 1.2 5 1.2 8 .3s6-.3 8 1"></path><path d="M6 16c2 .8 4.2.8 6.5 0s4.8-.6 6.6.4"></path><path d="M12 3.5v17"></path></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">UI GreenMetric World University Rankings</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="004">0</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Entre universidades públicas del Ecuador por acciones en infraestructura sostenible, energía, manejo de residuos, agua, transporte y educación ambiental.</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición 2025</span></p></div><!-- Tarjeta 3: THE World University Rankings --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="18" rx="5" width="18" x="3" y="3"></rect><path d="M8 8h3.2v8H8z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path><path d="M13 8h1.4v8H13z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path><path d="M15.6 8h1.4v8h-1.4z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">THE World University Rankings</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="0005">0</span><span class="unl-rank-suffix">[EDITAR]</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Mejor universidad pública del Ecuador</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición 2025</span></p></div><!-- Tarjeta 4: Webometrics --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.2"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2"></circle><path d="M7.6 7.2l3 3.4M16.4 7.2l-3 3.4M7.6 16.8l3-3.4M16.4 16.8l-3-3.4"></path></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">Webometrics Ranking Web of Universities</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="000">0</span><span class="unl-rank-suffix">[EDITAR]</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Posición según presencia, apertura e impacto del sitio web institucional. [EDITAR con dato real]</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición [EDITAR año]</span></p></div></div><p><!-- Áreas evaluadas: anillos de progreso -->&nbsp;</p><div class="unl-ring-block unl-fade-up"><h3 class="unl-ring-title">Desempeño por área evaluada [EDITAR con puntajes reales]</h3><div class="unl-ring-grid"><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="72" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">72%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Entorno e</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">infraestructura</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="58" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">58%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Energía y</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">cambio climático</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="65" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">65%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Gestión de</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">residuos</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="80" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">80%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Uso eficiente</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">del agua</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="61" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">61%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Transporte</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">sostenible</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="88" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">88%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Educación e</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">investigación</span></div></div></div></div><!-- ===================== SECCIÓN 2: INICIATIVAS INTERNACIONALES ===================== --><div class="unl-init-section"><p><span class="unl-sost-eyebrow">Cooperación internacional</span></p><h2 class="unl-sost-h2">Iniciativas y concursos internacionales</h2><p class="unl-sost-sub">La UNL participa actualmente en las siguientes iniciativas internacionales orientadas a fortalecer su modelo de sostenibilidad institucional. [EDITAR: reemplazar nombres, descripciones y avance real]</p><div class="unl-init-grid"><!-- Iniciativa 1: motivo de planta / ramificación --><div class="unl-init-card unl-fade-up"><svg class="unl-init-motif unl-motif-planta" aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M50 95V50" fill="none" stroke-width="2"></path><path d="M50 70C38 66 30 56 30 44" fill="none" stroke-width="2"></path><path d="M50 60C62 56 70 46 70 34" fill="none" stroke-width="2"></path><path d="M50 50C41 45 36 36 37 26" fill="none" stroke-width="2"></path><circle cx="30" cy="44" r="4"></circle><circle cx="70" cy="34" r="4"></circle><circle cx="37" cy="26" r="4"></circle><circle cx="50" cy="18" r="5"></circle></svg><div class="unl-init-top"><span class="unl-init-badge">Iniciativa 1</span> <span class="unl-init-year">[EDITAR año inicio]</span></div><h3 class="unl-init-name">[EDITAR: nombre de la iniciativa internacional 1]</h3><p class="unl-init-desc">[EDITAR: descripción breve — qué es la iniciativa, quién la convoca y qué compromiso concreto asumió la UNL al participar].</p><div class="unl-init-progress-row"><div class="unl-init-progress-label"><span>Avance del compromiso</span><span class="unl-init-pct">0%</span></div><div class="unl-init-bar-track"><div class="unl-init-bar-fill" data-pct="45">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div><!-- Iniciativa 2: motivo de átomo / órbitas --><div class="unl-init-card unl-agua unl-fade-up"><svg class="unl-init-motif unl-motif-atomo" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><ellipse cx="50" cy="50" rx="42" ry="16"></ellipse><ellipse cx="50" cy="50" rx="42" ry="16" transform="rotate(60 50 50)"></ellipse><ellipse cx="50" cy="50" rx="42" ry="16" transform="rotate(120 50 50)"></ellipse><circle cx="50" cy="50" fill="currentColor" r="6" stroke="none"></circle><circle cx="92" cy="50" fill="currentColor" r="3" stroke="none"></circle><circle cx="26" cy="78" fill="currentColor" r="3" stroke="none"></circle><circle cx="26" cy="22" fill="currentColor" r="3" stroke="none"></circle></svg><div class="unl-init-top"><span class="unl-init-badge">Iniciativa 2</span> <span class="unl-init-year">[EDITAR año inicio]</span></div><h3 class="unl-init-name">[EDITAR: nombre de la iniciativa internacional 2]</h3><p class="unl-init-desc">[EDITAR: descripción breve — objetivo del concurso o red, alcance geográfico y en qué consiste la participación de la UNL].</p><div class="unl-init-progress-row"><div class="unl-init-progress-label"><span>Avance del compromiso</span><span class="unl-init-pct">0%</span></div><div class="unl-init-bar-track"><div class="unl-init-bar-fill" data-pct="62">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>\r\n(function(){\r\n  var root = document.getElementById('unl-rankings-iniciativas');\r\n  if(!root) return;\r\n  var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\r\n  function animateCount(el){\r\n    var target = parseInt(el.getAttribute('data-target'), 10) || 0;\r\n    if(reduce){ el.textContent = target; return; }\r\n    var start = 0, dur = 1400, t0 = null;\r\n    function step(ts){\r\n      if(!t0) t0 = ts;\r\n      var p = Math.min((ts - t0) / dur, 1);\r\n      el.textContent = Math.round(start + (target - start) * p);\r\n      if(p < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);\r\n    }\r\n    requestAnimationFrame(step);\r\n  }\r\n  function animateRing(circle){\r\n    var pct = parseFloat(circle.getAttribute('data-pct')) || 0;\r\n    var offset = 251 - (251 * pct / 100);\r\n    circle.style.strokeDashoffset = offset;\r\n  }\r\n  function animateBar(bar){\r\n    var pct = parseFloat(bar.getAttribute('data-pct')) || 0;\r\n    bar.style.width = pct + '%';\r\n    var label = bar.closest('.unl-init-progress-row').querySelector('.unl-init-pct');\r\n    if(label) label.textContent = pct + '%';\r\n  }\r\n  var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){\r\n    entries.forEach(function(entry){\r\n      if(!entry.isIntersecting) return;\r\n      var el = entry.target;\r\n      el.classList.add('unl-inview');\r\n      el.querySelectorAll('.unl-rank-count').forEach(animateCount);\r\n      el.querySelectorAll('.unl-ring-bar').forEach(animateRing);\r\n      el.querySelectorAll('.unl-init-bar-fill').forEach(animateBar);\r\n      io.unobserve(el);\r\n    });\r\n  }, { threshold: .3 });\r\n  root.querySelectorAll('.unl-fade-up, .unl-rank-card').forEach(function(el){\r\n    io.observe(el);\r\n  });\r\n})();\r\n</script>	full_html
texto_libre	0	111	1376	en	0	<p><br><style type="text/css">/* BASE */\r\n            body {\r\n              margin: 0;\r\n              font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\r\n              background: #ffffff;\r\n              color: #111;\r\n              overflow-x: hidden;\r\n            }\r\n            /* FONDO */\r\n            .background {\r\n              position: fixed;\r\n              width: 100%;\r\n              height: 100%;\r\n              z-index: -2;\r\n              background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, #22c55e20, transparent 40%),\r\n                          radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, #16a34a15, transparent 40%);\r\n            }\r\n            /* HERO FULL IMAGE */\r\n            .hero {\r\n              min-height: 80vh;\r\n              display: flex;\r\n              align-items: center;\r\n              padding: 60px 8%;\r\n              position: relative;\r\n              color: white;\r\n            }\r\n            .hero::before {\r\n              content: "";\r\n              position: absolute;\r\n              inset: 0;\r\n              background: url('https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/IMG_0503.jpeg') center/cover no-repeat;\r\n              z-index: -1;\r\n            }\r\n            .hero::after {\r\n              content: "";\r\n              position: absolute;\r\n              inset: 0;\r\n              background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\r\n              z-index: -1;\r\n            }\r\n            .hero h1 {\r\n              font-size: 3rem;\r\n            }\r\n            .hero span {\r\n              color: #22c55e;\r\n            }\r\n            /* PLANTA */\r\n           .plant-container {\r\n  position: fixed;\r\n  left: 70px;\r\n  top: 0;\r\n  height: 100vh;\r\n  width: 100px;\r\n  z-index: 5;\r\n  pointer-events: none;\r\n  transition: opacity 0.4s ease;\r\n}\r\n.plant-container.hide-plant {\r\n  opacity: 0;\r\n}\r\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\r\n  .plant-container {\r\n    display: none;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n.stem {\r\n  width: 6px;\r\n  background: linear-gradient(#16a34a, #22c55e);\r\n  height: 0;\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n  left: 47px;\r\n  top: 0;\r\n  transition: height 0.25s ease-out;\r\n}\r\n.leaf {\r\n  width: 34px;\r\n  height: 20px;\r\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4ade80, #16a34a);\r\n  clip-path: ellipse(50% 50% at 50% 50%);\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n  opacity: 0;\r\n  transform: scale(0) rotate(0deg);\r\n  transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);\r\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(22,163,74,0.35);\r\n}\r\n.leaf::after {\r\n  content: "";\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n  top: 50%;\r\n  left: 6px;\r\n  right: 6px;\r\n  height: 1.5px;\r\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\r\n  transform: translateY(-50%);\r\n}\r\n.l1 { top: 90px;  left: 50px; transform-origin: left center; }\r\n.l2 { top: 210px; left: 17px; transform-origin: right center; }\r\n.l3 { top: 330px; left: 50px; transform-origin: left center; }\r\n.l4 { top: 450px; left: 17px; transform-origin: right center; }\r\n.l5 { top: 570px; left: 50px; transform-origin: left center; }\r\n.l6 { top: 690px; left: 17px; transform-origin: right center; }\r\n.leaf.active { opacity: 1; }\r\n.l1.active { transform: scale(1.15) rotate(-20deg); }\r\n.l2.active { transform: scale(1.15) rotate(20deg); }\r\n.l3.active { transform: scale(1.15) rotate(-20deg); }\r\n.l4.active { transform: scale(1.15) rotate(20deg); }\r\n.l5.active { transform: scale(1.15) rotate(-20deg); }\r\n.l6.active { transform: scale(1.15) rotate(20deg); }\r\n            /* SECCIONES */\r\n            .section {\r\n              padding: 50px 8%;\r\n            }\r\n            /* TITULOS */\r\n            h2 {\r\n              margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n            }\r\n            /* GRID */\r\n            .grid {\r\n              display: grid;\r\n              grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));\r\n              gap: 15px;\r\n            }\r\n            /* CARD */\r\n            .card {\r\n              background: #f9fafb;\r\n              padding: 20px;\r\n              border-radius: 14px;\r\n              border: 1px solid #eee;\r\n            }\r\n            /* BOTÓN LINK */\r\n            .btn {\r\n              display: inline-block;\r\n              margin-top: 10px;\r\n              padding: 8px 18px;\r\n              border-radius: 20px;\r\n              background: #16a34a;\r\n              color: white;\r\n              text-decoration: none;\r\n            }\r\n            /* ACCORDION */\r\n            .accordion-item {\r\n              margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n              border-radius: 12px;\r\n              overflow: hidden;\r\n              border: 1px solid #eee;\r\n            }\r\n            .accordion-header {\r\n              padding: 15px;\r\n              cursor: pointer;\r\n              background: #f9fafb;\r\n              font-weight: 600;\r\n            }\r\n            .accordion-content {\r\n              max-height: 0;\r\n              overflow: hidden;\r\n              transition: 0.4s;\r\n              padding: 0 15px;\r\n            }\r\n            .accordion-content a {\r\n              display: block;\r\n              margin: 10px 0;\r\n            }\r\n            /* REVEAL */\r\n            .reveal {\r\n              opacity: 0;\r\n              transform: translateY(30px);\r\n              transition: 0.6s;\r\n            }\r\n            .reveal.active {\r\n              opacity: 1;\r\n              transform: translateY(0);\r\n            }\r\n            /* ICONO + */\r\n            .accordion-header {\r\n              position: relative;\r\n              padding-right: 40px;\r\n            }\r\n            .accordion-header::after {\r\n              content: "+";\r\n              position: absolute;\r\n              right: 15px;\r\n              top: 50%;\r\n              transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(0deg);\r\n              font-size: 20px;\r\n              font-weight: bold;\r\n              color: #16a34a;\r\n              transition: transform 0.3s ease;\r\n            }\r\n            /* cuando está abierto */\r\n            .accordion-header.active::after {\r\n              transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(45deg);\r\n            }\r\n            </style></p><div class="background">&nbsp;</div><!-- PLANTA --><div class="plant-container"><div class="stem" id="stem">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l1" id="l1">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l2" id="l2">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l3" id="l3">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l4" id="l4">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l5" id="l5">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l6" id="l6">&nbsp;</div></div><!-- HERO --><div class="hero"><div><h1 class="text-align-center">UNL <span>SOSTENIBLE</span></h1><p class="text-align-center">Innovación, educación y compromiso con el futuro.</p></div></div><!-- POLÍTICAS --><div class="section"><h2><meta charset="UTF-8"></h2><p>La Universidad Nacional de Loja asume su compromiso con el modelo UNL Sostenible, una estrategia institucional orientada a integrar la sostenibilidad en todos sus ámbitos: académico, investigativo, de ge y vinculación con la sociedad. Este compromiso forma parte del Plan Estratégico de Desarrollo Institucional, que busca promover una universidad responsable con el entorno, que fomente la innovación, el uso eficiente de los recursos y la formación de ciudadanos comprometidos con un desarrollo equilibrado y sostenible para el sur del Ecuador y el mundo.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2></div><!-- ACCORDION --><div class="section"><h2>Recursos institucionales</h2><p>Asegura equidad, accesibilidad y participación plena en la UNL</p><div class="accordion"><!-- POLITICAS --><div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header">Políticas y planes</div><div class="accordion-content"><a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/unl_politica_de_inclusion_educativa_2025.pdf" target="_blank">Política de inclusión</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/14-04-26_UNL_PLAN%20SOSTENIBIIDAD%20FINAL%20pdf.pdf" target="_blank">Plan de Gestión de Sostenibilidad</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/PROPUESTA%20POLITICA%20COMPRAS%20E%20INVERSIONES%20SOSTENIBLES%20.pdf" target="_blank">Política de Compras e Inversiones Sostenibles</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/pol%C3%ADtica_de_sostenibilidad_unl_certificacion-signed.pdf" target="_blank">Política de Sostenibilidad de la Universidad Nacional de Loja</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/resoluci%C3%B3n_so-no.03-rocs-no.8.4-07-02-2026_aprobacion_politica_de_sostenibilidad.pdf" target="_blank">Resolución Nro. SO-No.03-ROCS-No-8.4-07-04-2026</a></div></div><!-- PARTICIPACIÓN --><p>Accede a nuestras líneas de participación institucional</p></div><div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header">Participación y democracia</div><div class="accordion-content"><a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/Acuerdo%20SENESCYT-CZ7-2023-001-OS%20Asociacio%CC%81n%20General%20de%20Docentes%20Universitarios%20de%20Loja%20%E2%80%9CAGEDUL%E2%80%9D.pdf" target="_blank">AGEDUL</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/ASA-UNL.PDF.pdf" target="_blank">ASA</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/ESTATUTO%20FEUE%20LOJA.pdf" target="_blank">FEUE Loja</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/Sindicatos%20de%20trabajadores%20la%20Argelia_UNL.pdf" target="_blank">Sindicato La Argelia</a></div></div><!-- DOCUMENTOS --><p>Documento guía para la gestión estratégica de la UNL</p><div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header">Documentos institucionales</div><div class="accordion-content"><a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-10/PEDI_UNL_2024-2028_ACTUALIZADO_PND_2025-2029_VFINAL_OCS_15-10-25.pdf" target="_blank">Plan Estratégico de Desarrollo Institucional (PEDI)</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-10/Informe%20Autodiagno%CC%81stico%20RESIES%20UNL-1.pdf" target="_blank">Informe de Autodiagnóstico RESIES</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-06/2025_unl_memoria_sostenibilidad_29-05-26_1.pdf" target="_blank">Memoria de Sostenibilidad</a></div></div></div><script>\r\n// REVEAL + PLANTA (crecimiento)\r\nwindow.addEventListener("scroll", () => {\r\n  document.querySelectorAll(".reveal").forEach(el => {\r\n    let top = el.getBoundingClientRect().top;\r\n    if (top < window.innerHeight - 80) {\r\n      el.classList.add("active");\r\n    }\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  let stem = document.getElementById("stem");\r\n  if (!stem) return;\r\n\r\n  let scrollable = document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;\r\n  let progress = scrollable > 0 ? window.scrollY / scrollable : 0;\r\n  progress = Math.min(Math.max(progress, 0), 1);\r\n\r\n  let maxStemHeight = 720;\r\n  let growth = progress * maxStemHeight;\r\n  stem.style.height = growth + "px";\r\n\r\n  document.querySelectorAll(".leaf").forEach(leaf => {\r\n    let leafTop = parseInt(getComputedStyle(leaf).top, 10);\r\n    if (growth >= leafTop) {\r\n      leaf.classList.add("active");\r\n    } else {\r\n      leaf.classList.remove("active");\r\n    }\r\n  });\r\n});\r\n\r\n// PLANTA: ocultar cuando se entra a zonas con contenido denso\r\n(function(){\r\n  let plantContainer = document.querySelector(".plant-container");\r\n  if (!plantContainer) return;\r\n\r\n  let dangerZones = document.querySelectorAll("#unl-rankings-iniciativas, .accordion");\r\n  let activeZones = new Set();\r\n\r\n  let zoneObserver = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\r\n    entries.forEach(entry => {\r\n      if (entry.isIntersecting) {\r\n        activeZones.add(entry.target);\r\n      } else {\r\n        activeZones.delete(entry.target);\r\n      }\r\n    });\r\n    plantContainer.classList.toggle("hide-plant", activeZones.size > 0);\r\n  }, { threshold: 0.1 });\r\n\r\n  dangerZones.forEach(zone => zoneObserver.observe(zone));\r\n})();\r\n// ACCORDION\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll(".accordion-header").forEach(header => {\r\n  header.addEventListener("click", () => {\r\n    let content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    document.querySelectorAll(".accordion-content").forEach(item => {\r\n      if (item !== content) item.style.maxHeight = null;\r\n    });\r\n    content.style.maxHeight = content.scrollHeight + "px";\r\n  });\r\n});\r\n</script><!--\r\n  ==========================================================================\r\n  UNL SOSTENIBLE — Secciones nuevas: "Rankings y reconocimientos" +\r\n  "Iniciativas internacionales"\r\n  ==========================================================================\r\n  CAMBIOS EN ESTA VERSIÓN\r\n  1. Todas las medidas de texto/espaciado pasaron de rem a px.\r\n  2. Los iconos de la sección de rankings ahora representan a los 4 sistemas\r\n     de evaluación (SCImago, UI GreenMetric, THE World University Rankings,\r\n     Webometrics). Son versiones simplificadas/genéricas inspiradas en la\r\n     forma de cada símbolo (columnas, globo, insignia, red), NO reproducciones\r\n     exactas de los logotipos originales -> los logos oficiales son marca\r\n     registrada de cada organización, así que para el logo pixel-perfecto\r\n     te recomiendo descargarlo del kit de prensa/branding de cada ranking\r\n     y reemplazar el <svg> de ese icono por su <img> oficial.\r\n  3. El fondo decorativo de las tarjetas de "Iniciativas internacionales" ya\r\n     no es una hoja tipo burbuja: ahora la tarjeta verde tiene un patrón de\r\n     planta/ramificación (sostenibilidad) y la tarjeta agua tiene un patrón\r\n     de átomo/órbitas (investigación).\r\n  4. Sigue sin tocar la paleta de colores del sitio (variables --unl-verde-*,\r\n     --unl-agua-*, --unl-tierra-* al inicio del <style>).\r\n  5. Los textos marcados "[EDITAR]" siguen siendo plantilla: reemplázalos\r\n     con los datos reales de la universidad.\r\n  ==========================================================================\r\n--><section class="unl-sost-wrap" id="unl-rankings-iniciativas"><style type="text/css">#unl-rankings-iniciativas{\r\n                --unl-verde-950:#0b2b1c;\r\n                --unl-verde-800:#12472c;\r\n                --unl-verde-700:#1b5e39;\r\n                --unl-verde-600:#2c7a4b;\r\n                --unl-verde-400:#5aa878;\r\n                --unl-verde-200:#bfe0cd;\r\n                --unl-verde-100:#e4f3ea;\r\n                --unl-tierra-600:#8a6a3f;\r\n                --unl-tierra-200:#ecdfc7;\r\n                --unl-agua-600:#1f7a8c;\r\n                --unl-agua-200:#cfeef2;\r\n                --unl-texto:#16241c;\r\n                --unl-texto-suave:#4a5c52;\r\n                --unl-borde:#d8e6dc;\r\n                --unl-fondo-card:#ffffff;\r\n                --unl-radio:14px;\r\n                font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n                color: var(--unl-texto);\r\n                max-width: 1180px;\r\n                margin: 0 auto;\r\n                padding: 56px 20px;\r\n                box-sizing: border-box;\r\n              }\r\n              #unl-rankings-iniciativas *{ box-sizing: border-box; }\r\n              .unl-sost-eyebrow{\r\n                display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\r\n                font-size:12px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.08em;\r\n                text-transform:uppercase; color: var(--unl-verde-700);\r\n                background: var(--unl-verde-100);\r\n                border:1px solid var(--unl-verde-200);\r\n                padding:5px 12px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:14px;\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-sost-eyebrow .dot{\r\n                width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;\r\n                background: var(--unl-verde-600);\r\n                animation: unlPulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-sost-h2{\r\n                font-size: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 34px);\r\n                font-weight: 800; line-height:1.2; margin:0 0 10px;\r\n                color: var(--unl-verde-950);\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-sost-sub{\r\n                font-size:16px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave);\r\n                max-width:62ch; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 35px;\r\n              }\r\n              /* ============ SECCIÓN 1: RANKINGS ============ */\r\n              .unl-rank-section{ margin-bottom:72px; position:relative; }\r\n              .unl-rank-grid{\r\n                display:grid;\r\n                grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));\r\n                gap:20px;\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-rank-card{\r\n                background: var(--unl-fondo-card);\r\n                border:1px solid var(--unl-borde);\r\n                border-radius: var(--unl-radio);\r\n                padding:24px 22px;\r\n                position:relative;\r\n                overflow:hidden;\r\n                transition: transform .35s ease, box-shadow .35s ease, border-color .35s ease;\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-rank-card:hover{\r\n                transform: translateY(-4px);\r\n                box-shadow: 0 14px 28px -14px rgba(18,71,44,.25);\r\n                border-color: var(--unl-verde-400);\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-rank-card::before{\r\n                content:"";\r\n                position:absolute; inset:0 0 auto 0; height:4px;\r\n                background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--unl-verde-600), var(--unl-agua-600));\r\n                transform-origin:left; transform:scaleX(0);\r\n                transition: transform .6s ease;\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-rank-card.unl-inview::before{ transform:scaleX(1); }\r\n              .unl-rank-icon{\r\n                width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;\r\n                background: var(--unl-verde-100);\r\n                display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\r\n                margin-bottom:16px; color: var(--unl-verde-700);\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-rank-icon svg{ width:24px;height:24px; }\r\n              .unl-rank-label{\r\n                font-size:13px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave); font-weight:600;\r\n                text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.03em; margin-bottom:5px;\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-rank-number{\r\n                font-size:32px; font-weight:800; color: var(--unl-verde-800);\r\n                line-height:1; display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:5px;\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-rank-number .unl-rank-suffix{ font-size:17px; font-weight:700; color: var(--unl-verde-600); }\r\n              .unl-rank-desc{ font-size:14px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave); margin-top:9px; line-height:1.5; }\r\n              .unl-rank-tag{\r\n                display:inline-block; margin-top:14px; font-size:12px; font-weight:700;\r\n                color: var(--unl-tierra-600); background: var(--unl-tierra-200);\r\n                padding:3px 9px; border-radius:6px;\r\n              }\r\n              /* Ring de progreso circular (áreas evaluadas) */\r\n              .unl-ring-block{\r\n                margin-top:40px; padding-top:35px;\r\n                border-top:1px dashed var(--unl-borde);\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-ring-title{ font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 22px; color: var(--unl-verde-950); }\r\n              .unl-ring-grid{\r\n                display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px,1fr));\r\n                gap:20px; text-align:center;\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-ring-item{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:10px; }\r\n              .unl-ring-svg{ width:88px; height:88px; }\r\n              .unl-ring-track{ fill:none; stroke: var(--unl-verde-100); stroke-width:8; }\r\n              .unl-ring-bar{\r\n                fill:none; stroke: var(--unl-verde-600); stroke-width:8; stroke-linecap:round;\r\n                stroke-dasharray: 251; stroke-dashoffset: 251;\r\n                transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.4s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-ring-pct{ font-size:15px; font-weight:800; fill: var(--unl-verde-800); }\r\n              .unl-ring-name{ font-size:12px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave); font-weight:600; line-height:1.3; }\r\n              /* ============ SECCIÓN 2: INICIATIVAS INTERNACIONALES ============ */\r\n              .unl-init-section{ position:relative; }\r\n              .unl-init-grid{\r\n                display:grid;\r\n                grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\r\n                gap:24px;\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-init-card{\r\n                background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--unl-verde-950) 0%, var(--unl-verde-800) 100%);\r\n                border-radius: var(--unl-radio);\r\n                padding:28px;\r\n                color:#f2f8f4;\r\n                position:relative;\r\n                overflow:hidden;\r\n                min-height:260px;\r\n                display:flex; flex-direction:column;\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-init-card.unl-agua{\r\n                background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0c3b44 0%, #124f5c 100%);\r\n              }\r\n              /* --- Fondos decorativos temáticos --- */\r\n              .unl-init-motif{\r\n                position:absolute; right:-22px; top:-22px; width:190px; height:190px;\r\n                opacity:.16; pointer-events:none;\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-init-motif.unl-motif-atomo{ animation: unlSpin 22s linear infinite; }\r\n              .unl-init-card.unl-agua .unl-init-motif circle,\r\n              .unl-init-card.unl-agua .unl-init-motif ellipse{ stroke:#dff5f8; }\r\n              .unl-init-card:not(.unl-agua) .unl-init-motif path,\r\n              .unl-init-card:not(.unl-agua) .unl-init-motif circle{ stroke:#d9f0e2; fill:#d9f0e2; }\r\n              .unl-init-top{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:18px; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n              .unl-init-badge{\r\n                font-size:11px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em;\r\n                background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); padding:5px 10px; border-radius:999px;\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-init-year{ font-size:12px; color:#cfe6d8; font-weight:600; }\r\n              .unl-init-name{ font-size:20px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 9px; line-height:1.25; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n              .unl-init-desc{ font-size:15px; color:#d8ebe0; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 19px; flex:1; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n              .unl-init-progress-row{ margin-top:auto; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n              .unl-init-progress-label{\r\n                display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:12px;\r\n                color:#cfe6d8; margin-bottom:6px; font-weight:600;\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-init-bar-track{\r\n                width:100%; height:8px; border-radius:999px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.14);\r\n                overflow:hidden;\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-init-bar-fill{\r\n                height:100%; border-radius:999px;\r\n                background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7fd7a5, #b7e8c9);\r\n                width:0%; transition: width 1.6s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-agua .unl-init-bar-fill{ background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6cc9d6, #a9e4ec); }\r\n              @keyframes unlSpin{ from{ transform: rotate(0deg);} to{ transform: rotate(360deg);} }\r\n              @keyframes unlPulse{\r\n                0%,100%{ opacity:1; transform:scale(1); }\r\n                50%{ opacity:.4; transform:scale(1.3); }\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-fade-up{\r\n                opacity:0; transform: translateY(18px);\r\n                transition: opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;\r\n              }\r\n              .unl-fade-up.unl-inview{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }\r\n              @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\r\n                #unl-rankings-iniciativas *{ animation:none !important; transition:none !important; }\r\n                .unl-fade-up{ opacity:1; transform:none; }\r\n              }\r\n              @media (max-width: 620px){\r\n                #unl-rankings-iniciativas{ padding: 40px 16px; }\r\n                .unl-rank-number{ font-size:26px; }\r\n              }\r\n            </style><!-- ===================== SECCIÓN 1: RANKINGS ===================== --><div class="unl-rank-section"><p><span class="unl-sost-eyebrow">Reconocimientos</span></p><h2 class="unl-sost-h2">Rankings y reconocimientos en sostenibilidad</h2><p class="unl-sost-sub">Resultados obtenidos por la Universidad Nacional de Loja en los principales sistemas internacionales que evalúan investigación, impacto y sostenibilidad institucional.</p><div class="unl-rank-grid"><!-- Tarjeta 1: SCImago --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 8l9-5 9 5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><rect height="9" width="2.4" x="4" y="9"></rect><rect height="9" width="2.4" x="9" y="9"></rect><rect height="9" width="2.4" x="14" y="9"></rect><rect height="9" width="1.6" x="19" y="9"></rect><rect height="2" width="18" x="3" y="19"></rect></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">SCImago Institutions Rankings</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="8">0</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Entre universidades públicas del Ecuador por su impacto, la calidad y la visibilidad de la producción científica.</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición 2025</span></p></div><!-- Tarjeta 2: UI GreenMetric --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M4 10.5c2.5 1.2 5 1.2 8 .3s6-.3 8 1"></path><path d="M6 16c2 .8 4.2.8 6.5 0s4.8-.6 6.6.4"></path><path d="M12 3.5v17"></path></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">UI GreenMetric World University Rankings</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="004">0</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Entre universidades públicas del Ecuador por acciones en infraestructura sostenible, energía, manejo de residuos, agua, transporte y educación ambiental.</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición 2025</span></p></div><!-- Tarjeta 3: THE World University Rankings --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="18" rx="5" width="18" x="3" y="3"></rect><path d="M8 8h3.2v8H8z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path><path d="M13 8h1.4v8H13z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path><path d="M15.6 8h1.4v8h-1.4z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">THE World University Rankings</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="0005">0</span><span class="unl-rank-suffix">[EDITAR]</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Mejor universidad pública del Ecuador</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición 2025</span></p></div><!-- Tarjeta 4: Webometrics --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.2"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2"></circle><path d="M7.6 7.2l3 3.4M16.4 7.2l-3 3.4M7.6 16.8l3-3.4M16.4 16.8l-3-3.4"></path></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">Webometrics Ranking Web of Universities</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="000">0</span><span class="unl-rank-suffix">[EDITAR]</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Posición según presencia, apertura e impacto del sitio web institucional. [EDITAR con dato real]</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición [EDITAR año]</span></p></div></div><p><!-- Áreas evaluadas: anillos de progreso -->&nbsp;</p><div class="unl-ring-block unl-fade-up"><h3 class="unl-ring-title">Desempeño por área evaluada [EDITAR con puntajes reales]</h3><div class="unl-ring-grid"><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="72" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">72%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Entorno e</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">infraestructura</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="58" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">58%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Energía y</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">cambio climático</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="65" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">65%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Gestión de</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">residuos</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="80" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">80%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Uso eficiente</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">del agua</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="61" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">61%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Transporte</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">sostenible</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="88" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">88%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Educación e</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">investigación</span></div></div></div></div><!-- ===================== SECCIÓN 2: INICIATIVAS INTERNACIONALES ===================== --><div class="unl-init-section"><p><span class="unl-sost-eyebrow">Cooperación internacional</span></p><h2 class="unl-sost-h2">Iniciativas y concursos internacionales</h2><p class="unl-sost-sub">La UNL participa actualmente en las siguientes iniciativas internacionales orientadas a fortalecer su modelo de sostenibilidad institucional. [EDITAR: reemplazar nombres, descripciones y avance real]</p><div class="unl-init-grid"><!-- Iniciativa 1: motivo de planta / ramificación --><div class="unl-init-card unl-fade-up"><svg class="unl-init-motif unl-motif-planta" aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M50 95V50" fill="none" stroke-width="2"></path><path d="M50 70C38 66 30 56 30 44" fill="none" stroke-width="2"></path><path d="M50 60C62 56 70 46 70 34" fill="none" stroke-width="2"></path><path d="M50 50C41 45 36 36 37 26" fill="none" stroke-width="2"></path><circle cx="30" cy="44" r="4"></circle><circle cx="70" cy="34" r="4"></circle><circle cx="37" cy="26" r="4"></circle><circle cx="50" cy="18" r="5"></circle></svg><div class="unl-init-top"><span class="unl-init-badge">Iniciativa 1</span> <span class="unl-init-year">[EDITAR año inicio]</span></div><h3 class="unl-init-name">[EDITAR: nombre de la iniciativa internacional 1]</h3><p class="unl-init-desc">[EDITAR: descripción breve — qué es la iniciativa, quién la convoca y qué compromiso concreto asumió la UNL al participar].</p><div class="unl-init-progress-row"><div class="unl-init-progress-label"><span>Avance del compromiso</span><span class="unl-init-pct">0%</span></div><div class="unl-init-bar-track"><div class="unl-init-bar-fill" data-pct="45">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div><!-- Iniciativa 2: motivo de átomo / órbitas --><div class="unl-init-card unl-agua unl-fade-up"><svg class="unl-init-motif unl-motif-atomo" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><ellipse cx="50" cy="50" rx="42" ry="16"></ellipse><ellipse cx="50" cy="50" rx="42" ry="16" transform="rotate(60 50 50)"></ellipse><ellipse cx="50" cy="50" rx="42" ry="16" transform="rotate(120 50 50)"></ellipse><circle cx="50" cy="50" fill="currentColor" r="6" stroke="none"></circle><circle cx="92" cy="50" fill="currentColor" r="3" stroke="none"></circle><circle cx="26" cy="78" fill="currentColor" r="3" stroke="none"></circle><circle cx="26" cy="22" fill="currentColor" r="3" stroke="none"></circle></svg><div class="unl-init-top"><span class="unl-init-badge">Iniciativa 2</span> <span class="unl-init-year">[EDITAR año inicio]</span></div><h3 class="unl-init-name">[EDITAR: nombre de la iniciativa internacional 2]</h3><p class="unl-init-desc">[EDITAR: descripción breve — objetivo del concurso o red, alcance geográfico y en qué consiste la participación de la UNL].</p><div class="unl-init-progress-row"><div class="unl-init-progress-label"><span>Avance del compromiso</span><span class="unl-init-pct">0%</span></div><div class="unl-init-bar-track"><div class="unl-init-bar-fill" data-pct="62">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>\r\n(function(){\r\n  var root = document.getElementById('unl-rankings-iniciativas');\r\n  if(!root) return;\r\n  var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\r\n  function animateCount(el){\r\n    var target = parseInt(el.getAttribute('data-target'), 10) || 0;\r\n    if(reduce){ el.textContent = target; return; }\r\n    var start = 0, dur = 1400, t0 = null;\r\n    function step(ts){\r\n      if(!t0) t0 = ts;\r\n      var p = Math.min((ts - t0) / dur, 1);\r\n      el.textContent = Math.round(start + (target - start) * p);\r\n      if(p < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);\r\n    }\r\n    requestAnimationFrame(step);\r\n  }\r\n  function animateRing(circle){\r\n    var pct = parseFloat(circle.getAttribute('data-pct')) || 0;\r\n    var offset = 251 - (251 * pct / 100);\r\n    circle.style.strokeDashoffset = offset;\r\n  }\r\n  function animateBar(bar){\r\n    var pct = parseFloat(bar.getAttribute('data-pct')) || 0;\r\n    bar.style.width = pct + '%';\r\n    var label = bar.closest('.unl-init-progress-row').querySelector('.unl-init-pct');\r\n    if(label) label.textContent = pct + '%';\r\n  }\r\n  var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){\r\n    entries.forEach(function(entry){\r\n      if(!entry.isIntersecting) return;\r\n      var el = entry.target;\r\n      el.classList.add('unl-inview');\r\n      el.querySelectorAll('.unl-rank-count').forEach(animateCount);\r\n      el.querySelectorAll('.unl-ring-bar').forEach(animateRing);\r\n      el.querySelectorAll('.unl-init-bar-fill').forEach(animateBar);\r\n      io.unobserve(el);\r\n    });\r\n  }, { threshold: .3 });\r\n  root.querySelectorAll('.unl-fade-up, .unl-rank-card').forEach(function(el){\r\n    io.observe(el);\r\n  });\r\n})();\r\n</script>	full_html
texto_libre	0	111	1380	en	0	<p><br><style type="text/css">/* BASE */\r\n        body {\r\n          margin: 0;\r\n          font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\r\n          background: #ffffff;\r\n          color: #111;\r\n          overflow-x: hidden;\r\n        }\r\n        /* FONDO */\r\n        .background {\r\n  position: fixed;\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  height: 100%;\r\n  z-index: -2;\r\n  background:\r\n    linear-gradient(180deg, #22c55e18 0%, transparent 25%),\r\n    radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, #22c55e20, transparent 40%),\r\n    radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, #16a34a15, transparent 40%);\r\n}\r\n        /* SECCIONES */\r\n        .section {\r\n          padding: 50px 8%;\r\n        }\r\n        /* TITULOS */\r\n        h2 {\r\n          margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n        }\r\n        /* GRID */\r\n        .grid {\r\n          display: grid;\r\n          grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));\r\n          gap: 15px;\r\n        }\r\n        /* CARD */\r\n        .card {\r\n          background: #f9fafb;\r\n          padding: 20px;\r\n          border-radius: 14px;\r\n          border: 1px solid #eee;\r\n        }\r\n        /* BOTÓN LINK */\r\n        .btn {\r\n          display: inline-block;\r\n          margin-top: 10px;\r\n          padding: 8px 18px;\r\n          border-radius: 20px;\r\n          background: #16a34a;\r\n          color: white;\r\n          text-decoration: none;\r\n        }\r\n        /* ACCORDION */\r\n        .accordion-item {\r\n          margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n          border-radius: 12px;\r\n          overflow: hidden;\r\n          border: 1px solid #eee;\r\n        }\r\n        .accordion-header {\r\n          padding: 15px;\r\n          cursor: pointer;\r\n          background: #f9fafb;\r\n          font-weight: 600;\r\n        }\r\n        .accordion-content {\r\n          max-height: 0;\r\n          overflow: hidden;\r\n          transition: 0.4s;\r\n          padding: 0 15px;\r\n        }\r\n        .accordion-content a {\r\n          display: block;\r\n          margin: 10px 0;\r\n        }\r\n        /* REVEAL */\r\n        .reveal {\r\n          opacity: 0;\r\n          transform: translateY(30px);\r\n          transition: 0.6s;\r\n        }\r\n        .reveal.active {\r\n          opacity: 1;\r\n          transform: translateY(0);\r\n        }\r\n        /* ICONO + */\r\n        .accordion-header {\r\n          position: relative;\r\n          padding-right: 40px;\r\n        }\r\n        .accordion-header::after {\r\n          content: "+";\r\n          position: absolute;\r\n          right: 15px;\r\n          top: 50%;\r\n          transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(0deg);\r\n          font-size: 20px;\r\n          font-weight: bold;\r\n          color: #16a34a;\r\n          transition: transform 0.3s ease;\r\n        }\r\n        /* cuando está abierto */\r\n        .accordion-header.active::after {\r\n          transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(45deg);\r\n        }\r\n        </style></p><div class="background">&nbsp;</div><!-- POLÍTICAS --><div class="section"><h2><meta charset="UTF-8"></h2><p>La Universidad Nacional de Loja asume su compromiso con el modelo UNL Sostenible, una estrategia institucional orientada a integrar la sostenibilidad en todos sus ámbitos: académico, investigativo, de ge y vinculación con la sociedad. Este compromiso forma parte del Plan Estratégico de Desarrollo Institucional, que busca promover una universidad responsable con el entorno, que fomente la innovación, el uso eficiente de los recursos y la formación de ciudadanos comprometidos con un desarrollo equilibrado y sostenible para el sur del Ecuador y el mundo.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2></div><!-- ACCORDION --><div class="section"><h2>Recursos institucionales</h2><p>Asegura equidad, accesibilidad y participación plena en la UNL</p><div class="accordion"><!-- POLITICAS --><div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header">Políticas y planes</div><div class="accordion-content"><a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/unl_politica_de_inclusion_educativa_2025.pdf" target="_blank">Política de inclusión</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/14-04-26_UNL_PLAN%20SOSTENIBIIDAD%20FINAL%20pdf.pdf" target="_blank">Plan de Gestión de Sostenibilidad</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/PROPUESTA%20POLITICA%20COMPRAS%20E%20INVERSIONES%20SOSTENIBLES%20.pdf" target="_blank">Política de Compras e Inversiones Sostenibles</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/pol%C3%ADtica_de_sostenibilidad_unl_certificacion-signed.pdf" target="_blank">Política de Sostenibilidad de la Universidad Nacional de Loja</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/resoluci%C3%B3n_so-no.03-rocs-no.8.4-07-02-2026_aprobacion_politica_de_sostenibilidad.pdf" target="_blank">Resolución Nro. SO-No.03-ROCS-No-8.4-07-04-2026</a></div></div><!-- PARTICIPACIÓN --><p>Accede a nuestras líneas de participación institucional</p></div><div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header">Participación y democracia</div><div class="accordion-content"><a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/Acuerdo%20SENESCYT-CZ7-2023-001-OS%20Asociacio%CC%81n%20General%20de%20Docentes%20Universitarios%20de%20Loja%20%E2%80%9CAGEDUL%E2%80%9D.pdf" target="_blank">AGEDUL</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/ASA-UNL.PDF.pdf" target="_blank">ASA</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/ESTATUTO%20FEUE%20LOJA.pdf" target="_blank">FEUE Loja</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/Sindicatos%20de%20trabajadores%20la%20Argelia_UNL.pdf" target="_blank">Sindicato La Argelia</a></div></div><!-- DOCUMENTOS --><p>Documento guía para la gestión estratégica de la UNL</p><div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header">Documentos institucionales</div><div class="accordion-content"><a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-10/PEDI_UNL_2024-2028_ACTUALIZADO_PND_2025-2029_VFINAL_OCS_15-10-25.pdf" target="_blank">Plan Estratégico de Desarrollo Institucional (PEDI)</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-10/Informe%20Autodiagno%CC%81stico%20RESIES%20UNL-1.pdf" target="_blank">Informe de Autodiagnóstico RESIES</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-06/2025_unl_memoria_sostenibilidad_29-05-26_1.pdf" target="_blank">Memoria de Sostenibilidad</a></div></div></div><script>\r\n// REVEAL\r\nwindow.addEventListener("scroll", () => {\r\n  document.querySelectorAll(".reveal").forEach(el => {\r\n    let top = el.getBoundingClientRect().top;\r\n    if (top < window.innerHeight - 80) {\r\n      el.classList.add("active");\r\n    }\r\n  });\r\n});\r\n// ACCORDION\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll(".accordion-header").forEach(header => {\r\n  header.addEventListener("click", () => {\r\n    let content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    document.querySelectorAll(".accordion-content").forEach(item => {\r\n      if (item !== content) item.style.maxHeight = null;\r\n    });\r\n    content.style.maxHeight = content.scrollHeight + "px";\r\n  });\r\n});\r\n</script><!--\r\n  ==========================================================================\r\n  UNL SOSTENIBLE — Secciones nuevas: "Rankings y reconocimientos" +\r\n  "Iniciativas internacionales"\r\n  ==========================================================================\r\n  CAMBIOS EN ESTA VERSIÓN\r\n  1. Todas las medidas de texto/espaciado pasaron de rem a px.\r\n  2. Los iconos de la sección de rankings ahora representan a los 4 sistemas\r\n     de evaluación (SCImago, UI GreenMetric, THE World University Rankings,\r\n     Webometrics). Son versiones simplificadas/genéricas inspiradas en la\r\n     forma de cada símbolo (columnas, globo, insignia, red), NO reproducciones\r\n     exactas de los logotipos originales -> los logos oficiales son marca\r\n     registrada de cada organización, así que para el logo pixel-perfecto\r\n     te recomiendo descargarlo del kit de prensa/branding de cada ranking\r\n     y reemplazar el <svg> de ese icono por su <img> oficial.\r\n  3. El fondo decorativo de las tarjetas de "Iniciativas internacionales" ya\r\n     no es una hoja tipo burbuja: ahora la tarjeta verde tiene un patrón de\r\n     planta/ramificación (sostenibilidad) y la tarjeta agua tiene un patrón\r\n     de átomo/órbitas (investigación).\r\n  4. Sigue sin tocar la paleta de colores del sitio (variables --unl-verde-*,\r\n     --unl-agua-*, --unl-tierra-* al inicio del <style>).\r\n  5. Los textos marcados "[EDITAR]" siguen siendo plantilla: reemplázalos\r\n     con los datos reales de la universidad.\r\n  ==========================================================================\r\n--><section class="unl-sost-wrap" id="unl-rankings-iniciativas"><style type="text/css">#unl-rankings-iniciativas{\r\n            --unl-verde-950:#0b2b1c;\r\n            --unl-verde-800:#12472c;\r\n            --unl-verde-700:#1b5e39;\r\n            --unl-verde-600:#2c7a4b;\r\n            --unl-verde-400:#5aa878;\r\n            --unl-verde-200:#bfe0cd;\r\n            --unl-verde-100:#e4f3ea;\r\n            --unl-tierra-600:#8a6a3f;\r\n            --unl-tierra-200:#ecdfc7;\r\n            --unl-agua-600:#1f7a8c;\r\n            --unl-agua-200:#cfeef2;\r\n            --unl-texto:#16241c;\r\n            --unl-texto-suave:#4a5c52;\r\n            --unl-borde:#d8e6dc;\r\n            --unl-fondo-card:#ffffff;\r\n            --unl-radio:14px;\r\n            font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n            color: var(--unl-texto);\r\n            max-width: 1180px;\r\n            margin: 0 auto;\r\n            padding: 56px 20px;\r\n            box-sizing: border-box;\r\n          }\r\n          #unl-rankings-iniciativas *{ box-sizing: border-box; }\r\n          .unl-sost-eyebrow{\r\n            display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\r\n            font-size:12px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.08em;\r\n            text-transform:uppercase; color: var(--unl-verde-700);\r\n            background: var(--unl-verde-100);\r\n            border:1px solid var(--unl-verde-200);\r\n            padding:5px 12px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:14px;\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-sost-eyebrow .dot{\r\n            width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;\r\n            background: var(--unl-verde-600);\r\n            animation: unlPulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-sost-h2{\r\n            font-size: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 34px);\r\n            font-weight: 800; line-height:1.2; margin:0 0 10px;\r\n            color: var(--unl-verde-950);\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-sost-sub{\r\n            font-size:16px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave);\r\n            max-width:62ch; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 35px;\r\n          }\r\n          /* ============ SECCIÓN 1: RANKINGS ============ */\r\n          .unl-rank-section{ margin-bottom:72px; position:relative; }\r\n          .unl-rank-grid{\r\n            display:grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));\r\n            gap:20px;\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-rank-card{\r\n            background: var(--unl-fondo-card);\r\n            border:1px solid var(--unl-borde);\r\n            border-radius: var(--unl-radio);\r\n            padding:24px 22px;\r\n            position:relative;\r\n            overflow:hidden;\r\n            transition: transform .35s ease, box-shadow .35s ease, border-color .35s ease;\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-rank-card:hover{\r\n            transform: translateY(-4px);\r\n            box-shadow: 0 14px 28px -14px rgba(18,71,44,.25);\r\n            border-color: var(--unl-verde-400);\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-rank-card::before{\r\n            content:"";\r\n            position:absolute; inset:0 0 auto 0; height:4px;\r\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--unl-verde-600), var(--unl-agua-600));\r\n            transform-origin:left; transform:scaleX(0);\r\n            transition: transform .6s ease;\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-rank-card.unl-inview::before{ transform:scaleX(1); }\r\n          .unl-rank-icon{\r\n            width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;\r\n            background: var(--unl-verde-100);\r\n            display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\r\n            margin-bottom:16px; color: var(--unl-verde-700);\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-rank-icon svg{ width:24px;height:24px; }\r\n          .unl-rank-label{\r\n            font-size:13px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave); font-weight:600;\r\n            text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.03em; margin-bottom:5px;\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-rank-number{\r\n            font-size:32px; font-weight:800; color: var(--unl-verde-800);\r\n            line-height:1; display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:5px;\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-rank-number .unl-rank-suffix{ font-size:17px; font-weight:700; color: var(--unl-verde-600); }\r\n          .unl-rank-desc{ font-size:14px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave); margin-top:9px; line-height:1.5; }\r\n          .unl-rank-tag{\r\n            display:inline-block; margin-top:14px; font-size:12px; font-weight:700;\r\n            color: var(--unl-tierra-600); background: var(--unl-tierra-200);\r\n            padding:3px 9px; border-radius:6px;\r\n          }\r\n          /* Ring de progreso circular (áreas evaluadas) */\r\n          .unl-ring-block{\r\n            margin-top:40px; padding-top:35px;\r\n            border-top:1px dashed var(--unl-borde);\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-ring-title{ font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 22px; color: var(--unl-verde-950); }\r\n          .unl-ring-grid{\r\n            display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px,1fr));\r\n            gap:20px; text-align:center;\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-ring-item{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:10px; }\r\n          .unl-ring-svg{ width:88px; height:88px; }\r\n          .unl-ring-track{ fill:none; stroke: var(--unl-verde-100); stroke-width:8; }\r\n          .unl-ring-bar{\r\n            fill:none; stroke: var(--unl-verde-600); stroke-width:8; stroke-linecap:round;\r\n            stroke-dasharray: 251; stroke-dashoffset: 251;\r\n            transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.4s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-ring-pct{ font-size:15px; font-weight:800; fill: var(--unl-verde-800); }\r\n          .unl-ring-name{ font-size:12px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave); font-weight:600; line-height:1.3; }\r\n          /* ============ SECCIÓN 2: INICIATIVAS INTERNACIONALES ============ */\r\n          .unl-init-section{ position:relative; }\r\n          .unl-init-grid{\r\n            display:grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\r\n            gap:24px;\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-init-card{\r\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--unl-verde-950) 0%, var(--unl-verde-800) 100%);\r\n            border-radius: var(--unl-radio);\r\n            padding:28px;\r\n            color:#f2f8f4;\r\n            position:relative;\r\n            overflow:hidden;\r\n            min-height:260px;\r\n            display:flex; flex-direction:column;\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-init-card.unl-agua{\r\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0c3b44 0%, #124f5c 100%);\r\n          }\r\n          /* --- Fondos decorativos temáticos --- */\r\n          .unl-init-motif{\r\n            position:absolute; right:-22px; top:-22px; width:190px; height:190px;\r\n            opacity:.16; pointer-events:none;\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-init-motif.unl-motif-atomo{ animation: unlSpin 22s linear infinite; }\r\n          .unl-init-card.unl-agua .unl-init-motif circle,\r\n          .unl-init-card.unl-agua .unl-init-motif ellipse{ stroke:#dff5f8; }\r\n          .unl-init-card:not(.unl-agua) .unl-init-motif path,\r\n          .unl-init-card:not(.unl-agua) .unl-init-motif circle{ stroke:#d9f0e2; fill:#d9f0e2; }\r\n          .unl-init-top{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:18px; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n          .unl-init-badge{\r\n            font-size:11px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em;\r\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); padding:5px 10px; border-radius:999px;\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-init-year{ font-size:12px; color:#cfe6d8; font-weight:600; }\r\n          .unl-init-name{ font-size:20px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 9px; line-height:1.25; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n          .unl-init-desc{ font-size:15px; color:#d8ebe0; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 19px; flex:1; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n          .unl-init-progress-row{ margin-top:auto; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n          .unl-init-progress-label{\r\n            display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:12px;\r\n            color:#cfe6d8; margin-bottom:6px; font-weight:600;\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-init-bar-track{\r\n            width:100%; height:8px; border-radius:999px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.14);\r\n            overflow:hidden;\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-init-bar-fill{\r\n            height:100%; border-radius:999px;\r\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7fd7a5, #b7e8c9);\r\n            width:0%; transition: width 1.6s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-agua .unl-init-bar-fill{ background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6cc9d6, #a9e4ec); }\r\n          @keyframes unlSpin{ from{ transform: rotate(0deg);} to{ transform: rotate(360deg);} }\r\n          @keyframes unlPulse{\r\n            0%,100%{ opacity:1; transform:scale(1); }\r\n            50%{ opacity:.4; transform:scale(1.3); }\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-fade-up{\r\n            opacity:0; transform: translateY(18px);\r\n            transition: opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;\r\n          }\r\n          .unl-fade-up.unl-inview{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }\r\n          @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\r\n            #unl-rankings-iniciativas *{ animation:none !important; transition:none !important; }\r\n            .unl-fade-up{ opacity:1; transform:none; }\r\n          }\r\n          @media (max-width: 620px){\r\n            #unl-rankings-iniciativas{ padding: 40px 16px; }\r\n            .unl-rank-number{ font-size:26px; }\r\n          }\r\n        </style><!-- ===================== SECCIÓN 1: RANKINGS ===================== --><div class="unl-rank-section"><p><span class="unl-sost-eyebrow">Reconocimientos</span></p><h2 class="unl-sost-h2">Rankings y reconocimientos en sostenibilidad</h2><p class="unl-sost-sub">Resultados obtenidos por la Universidad Nacional de Loja en los principales sistemas internacionales que evalúan investigación, impacto y sostenibilidad institucional.</p><div class="unl-rank-grid"><!-- Tarjeta 1: SCImago --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 8l9-5 9 5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><rect height="9" width="2.4" x="4" y="9"></rect><rect height="9" width="2.4" x="9" y="9"></rect><rect height="9" width="2.4" x="14" y="9"></rect><rect height="9" width="1.6" x="19" y="9"></rect><rect height="2" width="18" x="3" y="19"></rect></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">SCImago Institutions Rankings</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="8">0</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Entre universidades públicas del Ecuador por su impacto, la calidad y la visibilidad de la producción científica.</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición 2025</span></p></div><!-- Tarjeta 2: UI GreenMetric --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M4 10.5c2.5 1.2 5 1.2 8 .3s6-.3 8 1"></path><path d="M6 16c2 .8 4.2.8 6.5 0s4.8-.6 6.6.4"></path><path d="M12 3.5v17"></path></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">UI GreenMetric World University Rankings</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="004">0</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Entre universidades públicas del Ecuador por acciones en infraestructura sostenible, energía, manejo de residuos, agua, transporte y educación ambiental.</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición 2025</span></p></div><!-- Tarjeta 3: THE World University Rankings --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="18" rx="5" width="18" x="3" y="3"></rect><path d="M8 8h3.2v8H8z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path><path d="M13 8h1.4v8H13z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path><path d="M15.6 8h1.4v8h-1.4z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">THE World University Rankings</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="0005">0</span><span class="unl-rank-suffix">[EDITAR]</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Mejor universidad pública del Ecuador</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición 2025</span></p></div><!-- Tarjeta 4: Webometrics --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.2"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2"></circle><path d="M7.6 7.2l3 3.4M16.4 7.2l-3 3.4M7.6 16.8l3-3.4M16.4 16.8l-3-3.4"></path></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">Webometrics Ranking Web of Universities</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="000">0</span><span class="unl-rank-suffix">[EDITAR]</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Posición según presencia, apertura e impacto del sitio web institucional. [EDITAR con dato real]</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición [EDITAR año]</span></p></div></div><p><!-- Áreas evaluadas: anillos de progreso -->&nbsp;</p><div class="unl-ring-block unl-fade-up"><h3 class="unl-ring-title">Desempeño por área evaluada [EDITAR con puntajes reales]</h3><div class="unl-ring-grid"><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="72" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">72%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Entorno e</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">infraestructura</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="58" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">58%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Energía y</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">cambio climático</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="65" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">65%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Gestión de</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">residuos</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="80" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">80%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Uso eficiente</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">del agua</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="61" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">61%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Transporte</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">sostenible</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="88" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">88%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Educación e</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">investigación</span></div></div></div></div><!-- ===================== SECCIÓN 2: INICIATIVAS INTERNACIONALES ===================== --><div class="unl-init-section"><p><span class="unl-sost-eyebrow">Cooperación internacional</span></p><h2 class="unl-sost-h2">Iniciativas y concursos internacionales</h2><p class="unl-sost-sub">La UNL participa actualmente en las siguientes iniciativas internacionales orientadas a fortalecer su modelo de sostenibilidad institucional. [EDITAR: reemplazar nombres, descripciones y avance real]</p><div class="unl-init-grid"><!-- Iniciativa 1: motivo de planta / ramificación --><div class="unl-init-card unl-fade-up"><svg class="unl-init-motif unl-motif-planta" aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M50 95V50" fill="none" stroke-width="2"></path><path d="M50 70C38 66 30 56 30 44" fill="none" stroke-width="2"></path><path d="M50 60C62 56 70 46 70 34" fill="none" stroke-width="2"></path><path d="M50 50C41 45 36 36 37 26" fill="none" stroke-width="2"></path><circle cx="30" cy="44" r="4"></circle><circle cx="70" cy="34" r="4"></circle><circle cx="37" cy="26" r="4"></circle><circle cx="50" cy="18" r="5"></circle></svg><div class="unl-init-top"><span class="unl-init-badge">Iniciativa 1</span> <span class="unl-init-year">[EDITAR año inicio]</span></div><h3 class="unl-init-name">[EDITAR: nombre de la iniciativa internacional 1]</h3><p class="unl-init-desc">[EDITAR: descripción breve — qué es la iniciativa, quién la convoca y qué compromiso concreto asumió la UNL al participar].</p><div class="unl-init-progress-row"><div class="unl-init-progress-label"><span>Avance del compromiso</span><span class="unl-init-pct">0%</span></div><div class="unl-init-bar-track"><div class="unl-init-bar-fill" data-pct="45">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div><!-- Iniciativa 2: motivo de átomo / órbitas --><div class="unl-init-card unl-agua unl-fade-up"><svg class="unl-init-motif unl-motif-atomo" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><ellipse cx="50" cy="50" rx="42" ry="16"></ellipse><ellipse cx="50" cy="50" rx="42" ry="16" transform="rotate(60 50 50)"></ellipse><ellipse cx="50" cy="50" rx="42" ry="16" transform="rotate(120 50 50)"></ellipse><circle cx="50" cy="50" fill="currentColor" r="6" stroke="none"></circle><circle cx="92" cy="50" fill="currentColor" r="3" stroke="none"></circle><circle cx="26" cy="78" fill="currentColor" r="3" stroke="none"></circle><circle cx="26" cy="22" fill="currentColor" r="3" stroke="none"></circle></svg><div class="unl-init-top"><span class="unl-init-badge">Iniciativa 2</span> <span class="unl-init-year">[EDITAR año inicio]</span></div><h3 class="unl-init-name">[EDITAR: nombre de la iniciativa internacional 2]</h3><p class="unl-init-desc">[EDITAR: descripción breve — objetivo del concurso o red, alcance geográfico y en qué consiste la participación de la UNL].</p><div class="unl-init-progress-row"><div class="unl-init-progress-label"><span>Avance del compromiso</span><span class="unl-init-pct">0%</span></div><div class="unl-init-bar-track"><div class="unl-init-bar-fill" data-pct="62">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>\r\n(function(){\r\n  var root = document.getElementById('unl-rankings-iniciativas');\r\n  if(!root) return;\r\n  var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\r\n  function animateCount(el){\r\n    var target = parseInt(el.getAttribute('data-target'), 10) || 0;\r\n    if(reduce){ el.textContent = target; return; }\r\n    var start = 0, dur = 1400, t0 = null;\r\n    function step(ts){\r\n      if(!t0) t0 = ts;\r\n      var p = Math.min((ts - t0) / dur, 1);\r\n      el.textContent = Math.round(start + (target - start) * p);\r\n      if(p < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);\r\n    }\r\n    requestAnimationFrame(step);\r\n  }\r\n  function animateRing(circle){\r\n    var pct = parseFloat(circle.getAttribute('data-pct')) || 0;\r\n    var offset = 251 - (251 * pct / 100);\r\n    circle.style.strokeDashoffset = offset;\r\n  }\r\n  function animateBar(bar){\r\n    var pct = parseFloat(bar.getAttribute('data-pct')) || 0;\r\n    bar.style.width = pct + '%';\r\n    var label = bar.closest('.unl-init-progress-row').querySelector('.unl-init-pct');\r\n    if(label) label.textContent = pct + '%';\r\n  }\r\n  var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){\r\n    entries.forEach(function(entry){\r\n      if(!entry.isIntersecting) return;\r\n      var el = entry.target;\r\n      el.classList.add('unl-inview');\r\n      el.querySelectorAll('.unl-rank-count').forEach(animateCount);\r\n      el.querySelectorAll('.unl-ring-bar').forEach(animateRing);\r\n      el.querySelectorAll('.unl-init-bar-fill').forEach(animateBar);\r\n      io.unobserve(el);\r\n    });\r\n  }, { threshold: .3 });\r\n  root.querySelectorAll('.unl-fade-up, .unl-rank-card').forEach(function(el){\r\n    io.observe(el);\r\n  });\r\n})();\r\n</script>	full_html
texto_libre	0	110	1383	en	0	<style type="text/css">/* =========================================\r\nPALETA OFICIAL UNL\r\n========================================= */\r\n:root{\r\n    --primary:#93000b;\r\n    --primary-light:#93000b;\r\n    --secondary:#0A56A8;\r\n    --bg:#f4f7fb;\r\n    --white:#ffffff;\r\n    --text:#1b1b1b;\r\n    --gray:#6f7785;\r\n    --border:#dfe7f1;\r\n    --shadow:0 10px 35px rgba(0, 31, 78, 0.10);\r\n    --radius:22px;\r\n}\r\n/* =========================================\r\nRESET\r\n========================================= */\r\n*{\r\n    margin:0;\r\n    padding:0;\r\n    box-sizing:border-box;\r\n}\r\nhtml{\r\n    scroll-behavior:smooth;\r\n}\r\nbody{\r\n    font-family:'Montserrat', sans-serif;\r\n    background:var(--bg);\r\n    color:var(--text);\r\n    overflow-x:hidden;\r\n}\r\n/* =========================================\r\nOCULTAR NAVBAR INTERNO\r\nPARA NO AFECTAR EL HEADER DEL SITIO\r\n========================================= */\r\nbody > .navbar{\r\n    display:none !important;\r\n}\r\n/* =========================================\r\nHERO\r\n========================================= */\r\n.hero{\r\n    position:relative;\r\n    min-height:52vh;\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n    justify-content:center;\r\n    overflow:hidden;\r\n    padding-top:140px;\r\n    padding-bottom:70px;\r\n    background:\r\n    linear-gradient(\r\n    135deg,\r\n    #440105 0%,\r\n    #6b0108 45%,\r\n    #93000b 100%\r\n    );\r\n}\r\n.hero::before{\r\n    content:"";\r\n    position:absolute;\r\n    width:480px;\r\n    height:480px;\r\n    border-radius:50%;\r\n    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\r\n    top:-220px;\r\n    right:-120px;\r\n}\r\n.hero::after{\r\n    content:"";\r\n    position:absolute;\r\n    width:350px;\r\n    height:350px;\r\n    border-radius:50%;\r\n    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\r\n    bottom:-180px;\r\n    left:-100px;\r\n}\r\n.hero-content{\r\n    position:relative;\r\n    z-index:10;\r\n    width:90%;\r\n    max-width:1000px;\r\n    text-align:center;\r\n    color:white;\r\n}\r\n.badge{\r\n    display:inline-flex;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n    gap:10px;\r\n    padding:10px 18px;\r\n    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.10);\r\n    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\r\n    border-radius:100px;\r\n    backdrop-filter:blur(12px);\r\n    margin-bottom:22px;\r\n    animation:fadeUp 1s ease;\r\n}\r\n.badge span{\r\n    font-size:.85rem;\r\n    font-weight:600;\r\n    letter-spacing:.3px;\r\n}\r\n.hero h2{\r\n    font-size:5.2rem;\r\n.hero .hero-content h2{\r\n    font-family:'Montserrat', sans-serif !important;\r\n    font-size:clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem) !important;\r\n    font-weight:800 !important;\r\n    line-height:1.1 !important;\r\n    margin-bottom:20px;\r\n    color:#ffffff !important;\r\n    animation:fadeUp 1.1s ease;\r\n}\r\n.hero .hero-content p{\r\n    font-family:'Montserrat', sans-serif !important;\r\n    max-width:760px;\r\n    margin:auto;\r\n    font-size:3.08rem !important;\r\n    line-height:1.9 !important;\r\n    font-weight:400 !important;\r\n    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92) !important;\r\n    animation:fadeUp 1.2s ease;\r\n}\r\n.hero .badge span{\r\n    font-size:.9rem !important;\r\n    font-weight:600 !important;\r\n    color:white !important;\r\n}\r\n    font-weight:800;\r\n    line-height:1.1;\r\n    margin-bottom:20px;\r\n    animation:fadeUp 1.1s ease;\r\n}\r\n.hero p{\r\n    max-width:760px;\r\n    margin:auto;\r\n    font-size:1.02rem;\r\n    line-height:1.9;\r\n    opacity:.92;\r\n    animation:fadeUp 1.2s ease;\r\n}\r\n/* =========================================\r\nSECCIONES\r\n========================================= */\r\n.section{\r\n    padding:110px 0;\r\n}\r\n.container{\r\n    width:90%;\r\n    max-width:1400px;\r\n    margin:auto;\r\n}\r\n.section-title{\r\n    text-align:center;\r\n    margin-bottom:70px;\r\n}\r\n.section-title h3{\r\n    font-size:2.7rem;\r\n    color:var(--primary);\r\n    margin-bottom:18px;\r\n}\r\n.section-title p{\r\n    max-width:760px;\r\n    margin:auto;\r\n    color:var(--gray);\r\n    line-height:1.8;\r\n}\r\n/* =========================================\r\nCARDS\r\n========================================= */\r\n.cards-grid{\r\n    display:grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(340px,1fr));\r\n    gap:34px;\r\n}\r\n.card{\r\n    position:relative;\r\n    background:var(--white);\r\n    border-radius:var(--radius);\r\n    overflow:hidden;\r\n    box-shadow:var(--shadow);\r\n    transition:.4s ease;\r\n    border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03);\r\n}\r\n.card:hover{\r\n    transform:translateY(-12px);\r\n}\r\n.card-top{\r\n    position:relative;\r\n    height:220px;\r\n    background:\r\n    linear-gradient(\r\n    135deg,\r\n    #440105 0%,\r\n    #6b0108 45%,\r\n    #93000b 100%\r\n    );\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n    justify-content:center;\r\n    overflow:hidden;\r\n}\r\n.card-top::before{\r\n    content:"";\r\n    position:absolute;\r\n    width:300px;\r\n    height:300px;\r\n    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\r\n    border-radius:50%;\r\n    top:-100px;\r\n    right:-60px;\r\n}\r\n.card-year{\r\n    position:relative;\r\n    z-index:2;\r\n    font-size:5rem;\r\n    font-weight:800;\r\n    color:white;\r\n    letter-spacing:4px;\r\n}\r\n.card-content{\r\n    padding:34px;\r\n}\r\n.card-content h4{\r\n    font-size:1.4rem;\r\n    color:var(--primary);\r\n    margin-bottom:16px;\r\n}\r\n.card-content p{\r\n    color:var(--gray);\r\n    line-height:1.7;\r\n    margin-bottom:26px;\r\n}\r\n.card-actions{\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    gap:14px;\r\n    flex-wrap:wrap;\r\n}\r\n.btn{\r\n    flex:1;\r\n    min-width:130px;\r\n    padding:14px 18px;\r\n    border:none;\r\n    border-radius:14px;\r\n    cursor:pointer;\r\n    text-decoration:none;\r\n    font-weight:700;\r\n    transition:.3s ease;\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n    justify-content:center;\r\n    gap:10px;\r\n    font-family:'Montserrat', sans-serif;\r\n}\r\n.btn-primary{\r\n    background:var(--primary);\r\n    color:white;\r\n}\r\n.btn-primary:hover{\r\n    background:var(--primary-light);\r\n}\r\n.btn-secondary{\r\n    background:#eef4fb;\r\n    color:var(--primary);\r\n}\r\n.btn-secondary:hover{\r\n    background:#dfeeff;\r\n}\r\n/* =========================================\r\nMODAL PDF\r\n========================================= */\r\n.modal{\r\n    position:fixed;\r\n    inset:0;\r\n    background:rgba(0,0,0,0.78);\r\n    z-index:9999;\r\n    display:none;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n    justify-content:center;\r\n    padding:30px;\r\n}\r\n.modal.active{\r\n    display:flex;\r\n}\r\n.modal-content{\r\n    width:100%;\r\n    max-width:1200px;\r\n    height:90vh;\r\n    background:white;\r\n    border-radius:22px;\r\n    overflow:hidden;\r\n    position:relative;\r\n    animation:zoom .35s ease;\r\n}\r\n.close-modal{\r\n    position:absolute;\r\n    top:16px;\r\n    right:16px;\r\n    width:46px;\r\n    height:46px;\r\n    border-radius:50%;\r\n    background:rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\r\n    border:none;\r\n    cursor:pointer;\r\n    font-size:1.2rem;\r\n    z-index:10;\r\n    transition:.3s;\r\n}\r\n.close-modal:hover{\r\n    background:rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\r\n}\r\n.modal iframe{\r\n    width:100%;\r\n    height:100%;\r\n    border:none;\r\n}\r\n/* =========================================\r\nANIMACIONES\r\n========================================= */\r\n@keyframes fadeUp{\r\n    from{\r\n        opacity:0;\r\n        transform:translateY(40px);\r\n    }\r\n    to{\r\n        opacity:1;\r\n        transform:translateY(0);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n@keyframes zoom{\r\n    from{\r\n        opacity:0;\r\n        transform:scale(.9);\r\n    }\r\n    to{\r\n        opacity:1;\r\n        transform:scale(1);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n/* =========================================\r\nRESPONSIVE\r\n========================================= */\r\n@media(max-width:992px){\r\n    .hero h2{\r\n        font-size:2.6rem;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n@media(max-width:768px){\r\n    .hero{\r\n        padding-top:120px;\r\n    }\r\n    .hero h2{\r\n        font-size:2.1rem;\r\n    }\r\n    .section-title h3{\r\n        font-size:2rem;\r\n    }\r\n    .card-year{\r\n        font-size:4rem;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n@media(max-width:480px){\r\n    .hero h2{\r\n        font-size:1.8rem;\r\n    }\r\n    .hero p{\r\n        font-size:.95rem;\r\n    }\r\n    .card-content{\r\n        padding:24px;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n</style><!-- =========================================\r\nHERO\r\n========================================= --><section class="hero"><div class="hero-content"><h4 class="badge"><span>Repositorio Institucional</span></h4><h2>Planes Operativos Anuales</h2><h5>Accede a los documentos oficiales correspondientes a los Planes Operativos Anuales de la Universidad Nacional de Loja.</h5><h5>&nbsp;</h5></div></section><!-- =========================================\r\nPLANES\r\n========================================= --><section class="section" id="planes"><div class="container"><div class="section-title"><h3>Documentos Institucionales</h3><p>Explora los planes operativos anuales disponibles. Cada documento puede visualizarse directamente desde el micrositio o descargarse en formato PDF.</p></div><div class="cards-grid"><!-- 2024 --><div class="card"><div class="card-top"><div class="card-year">2024</div></div><div class="card-content"><h4>POA 2024</h4><p>&nbsp;Plan Operativo Anual 2024</p><div class="card-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary openPdf" data-pdf="http://172.190.19.169/sites/default/files/2026-09/poa_2024_mas_resolucio%CC%81n0207210001777305442.pdf">Visualizar</button><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="http://172.190.19.169/sites/default/files/2026-09/poa_2024_mas_resolucio%CC%81n0207210001777305442.pdf" download="" title="POA 2024">Descargar</a></div></div></div><!-- 2025 --><div class="card"><div class="card-top"><div class="card-year">2025</div></div><div class="card-content"><h4>POA 2025</h4><p>&nbsp;Plan Operativo Anual 2025.</p><div class="card-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary openPdf" data-pdf="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-05/poa_2025_mas_resolucio%CC%81n0046180001777305442.pdf">Visualizar</button><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-05/poa_2025_mas_resolucio%CC%81n0046180001777305442.pdf" download="" title="POA 2025">Descargar</a></div></div></div><!-- 2026 --><div class="card"><div class="card-top"><div class="card-year">2026</div></div><div class="card-content"><h4>POA 2026</h4><p>&nbsp;Plan Operativo Anual&nbsp;2026.</p><div class="card-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary openPdf" data-pdf="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-05/poa-2026_mas_resolucion-aprobacio%CC%81n0405566001777305441.pdf">Visualizar</button><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-05/poa-2026_mas_resolucion-aprobacio%CC%81n0405566001777305441.pdf" download="" title="POA 2026">Descargar</a></div></div></div></div></div></section><!-- =========================================\r\nMODAL PDF\r\n========================================= --><div class="modal" id="pdfModal"><div class="modal-content"><button class="close-modal" id="closeModal">✕</button><iframe id="pdfViewer"></iframe></div></div><!-- =========================================\r\nJS\r\n========================================= --><script>\r\nconst modal = document.getElementById("pdfModal");\r\nconst pdfViewer = document.getElementById("pdfViewer");\r\nconst closeModal = document.getElementById("closeModal");\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll(".openPdf").forEach(button => {\r\n    button.addEventListener("click", () => {\r\n        const pdf = button.getAttribute("data-pdf");\r\n        pdfViewer.src = pdf;\r\n        modal.classList.add("active");\r\n        document.body.style.overflow = "hidden";\r\n    });\r\n});\r\nfunction closePdf(){\r\n    modal.classList.remove("active");\r\n    pdfViewer.src = "";\r\n    document.body.style.overflow = "auto";\r\n}\r\ncloseModal.addEventListener("click", closePdf);\r\nmodal.addEventListener("click", (e) => {\r\n    if(e.target === modal){\r\n        closePdf();\r\n    }\r\n});\r\ndocument.addEventListener("keydown", (e)=>{\r\n    if(e.key === "Escape"){\r\n        closePdf();\r\n    }\r\n});\r\n</script>	full_html
