odas las asignaturas o semestre de manera virtual.</p></div><div class="drci-modalidad"><h4>Prácticas / Pasantías</h4><p>El/la estudiante puede realizar sus prácticas preprofesionales tanto en movilidad entrante como saliente, estancias de investigación o docencia, participación en eventos internacionales y visitas académicas y de observación.</p></div></div><!-- IMPORTANTE (texto) --><div class="drci-importante"><h4>Importante</h4><p>Descarga el formulario de movilidad estudiantil y envíalo a: cooperacion@unl.edu.ec</p></div><!-- 3 CUADRADOS: FORMULARIO + 2 PDFS --><div class="drci-cuadros"><a class="drci-cuadro" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/ocs/2023-07/FORMULARIO%20POSTULANTE.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Formulario de movilidad estudiantil</a> <a class="drci-cuadro" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2023-07/Intercambio%20estudiantes%20extranjeros.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Intercambio estudiantes extranjeros</a> <a class="drci-cuadro" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2023-07/Intercambio%20estudiantes%20UNL.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Intercambio estudiantes UNL</a></div></div>	full_html
texto_libre	0	111	1369	en	0	<style type="text/css">\r\n\r\n  .unl-sostenibilidad-wrapper {\r\n    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\r\n    color: #111;\r\n    position: relative;\r\n    overflow-x: hidden;\r\n  }\r\n  \r\n  .plant-container {\r\n    position: fixed;\r\n    left: 40px;\r\n    top: 0;\r\n    height: 100vh;\r\n    width: 80px;\r\n    z-index: 10;\r\n    pointer-events: none;\r\n  }\r\n  .stem {\r\n    width: 6px;\r\n    background: linear-gradient(#16a34a, #22c55e);\r\n    height: 0;\r\n    margin: auto;\r\n  }\r\n  .leaf {\r\n    width: 22px;\r\n    height: 12px;\r\n    background: #22c55e;\r\n    border-radius: 20px;\r\n    position: absolute;\r\n    opacity: 0;\r\n    transform: scale(0);\r\n    transition: 0.5s;\r\n  }\r\n  .l1 { top: 150px; }\r\n  .l2 { top: 350px; }\r\n  .l3 { top: 550px; }\r\n  .l4 { top: 750px; }\r\n  \r\n  /* SECCIONES */\r\n  .unl-sostenibilidad-wrapper .section {\r\n    padding: 50px 8%;\r\n    position: relative;\r\n    z-index: 2;\r\n  }\r\n  .unl-sostenibilidad-wrapper h2 {\r\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n  }\r\n  \r\n  /* BOTÓN LINK */\r\n  .unl-sostenibilidad-wrapper .btn {\r\n    display: inline-block;\r\n    margin-top: 10px;\r\n    padding: 8px 18px;\r\n    border-radius: 20px;\r\n    background: #16a34a;\r\n    color: white;\r\n    text-decoration: none;\r\n    transition: background 0.3s;\r\n  }\r\n  .unl-sostenibilidad-wrapper .btn:hover {\r\n    background: #128039;\r\n  }\r\n  \r\n  /* ACCORDION */\r\n  .accordion-item {\r\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n    border-radius: 12px;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    border: 1px solid #eee;\r\n  }\r\n  .accordion-header {\r\n    padding: 15px;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    background: #f9fafb;\r\n    font-weight: 600;\r\n    position: relative;\r\n    padding-right: 40px;\r\n  }\r\n  .accordion-content {\r\n    max-height: 0;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    transition: 0.4s;\r\n    padding: 0 15px;\r\n  }\r\n  .accordion-content a {\r\n    display: block;\r\n    margin: 10px 0;\r\n  }\r\n  .accordion-header::after {\r\n    content: "+";\r\n    position: absolute;\r\n    right: 15px;\r\n    top: 50%;\r\n    transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(0deg);\r\n    font-size: 20px;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    color: #16a34a;\r\n    transition: transform 0.3s ease;\r\n  }\r\n  .accordion-header.active::after {\r\n    transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(45deg);\r\n  }\r\n  \r\n  /* REVEAL (Animación al hacer scroll) */\r\n  .reveal {\r\n    opacity: 0;\r\n    transform: translateY(30px);\r\n    transition: 0.6s;\r\n  }\r\n  .reveal.active {\r\n    opacity: 1;\r\n    transform: translateY(0);\r\n  }\r\n</style><div class="unl-sostenibilidad-wrapper"><!-- PLANTA ANIMADA SCROLL --><div class="plant-container"><div class="stem" id="stem">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l1" id="l1">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l2" id="l2">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l3" id="l3">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l4" id="l4">&nbsp;</div></div><!-- POLÍTICAS --><div class="section reveal"><h2>Políticas y Compromiso</h2><p>La Universidad Nacional de Loja asume su compromiso con el modelo UNL Sostenible, una estrategia institucional orientada a integrar la sostenibilidad en todos sus ámbitos: académico, investigativo, de gestión y vinculación con la sociedad. Este compromiso forma parte del Plan Estratégico de Desarrollo Institucional, que busca promover una universidad responsable con el entorno, que fomente la innovación, el uso eficiente de los recursos y la formación de ciudadanos comprometidos con un desarrollo equilibrado y sostenible para el sur del Ecuador y el mundo.</p></div><!-- ACCORDION RECURSOS --><div class="section reveal"><h2>Recursos institucionales</h2><p>Asegura equidad, accesibilidad y participación plena en la UNL.</p><div class="accordion"><!-- POLÍTICAS Y PLANES --><div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header">Políticas y planes</div><div class="accordion-content"><a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/unl_politica_de_inclusion_educativa_2025.pdf" target="_blank">Política de inclusión</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/14-04-26_UNL_PLAN%20SOSTENIBIIDAD%20FINAL%20pdf.pdf" target="_blank">Plan de Gestión de Sostenibilidad</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/PROPUESTA%20POLITICA%20COMPRAS%20E%20INVERSIONES%20SOSTENIBLES%20.pdf" target="_blank">Política de Compras e Inversiones Sostenibles</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/pol%C3%ADtica_de_sostenibilidad_unl_certificacion-signed.pdf" target="_blank">Política de Sostenibilidad de la Universidad Nacional de Loja</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/resoluci%C3%B3n_so-no.03-rocs-no.8.4-07-02-2026_aprobacion_politica_de_sostenibilidad.pdf" target="_blank">Resolución Nro. SO-No.03-ROCS-No-8.4-07-04-2026</a></div></div><!-- PARTICIPACIÓN --><div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header">Participación y democracia</div><div class="accordion-content"><p style="margin-bottom:0;padding-top:10px;">Accede a nuestras líneas de participación institucional:</p><p><a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/Acuerdo%20SENESCYT-CZ7-2023-001-OS%20Asociacio%CC%81n%20General%20de%20Docentes%20Universitarios%20de%20Loja%20%E2%80%9CAGEDUL%E2%80%9D.pdf" target="_blank">AGEDUL</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/ASA-UNL.PDF.pdf" target="_blank">ASA</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/ESTATUTO%20FEUE%20LOJA.pdf" target="_blank">FEUE Loja</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/Sindicatos%20de%20trabajadores%20la%20Argelia_UNL.pdf" target="_blank">Sindicato La Argelia</a></p></div></div><!-- DOCUMENTOS --><div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header">Documentos institucionales</div><div class="accordion-content"><p style="margin-bottom:0;padding-top:10px;">Documento guía para la gestión estratégica de la UNL:</p><p><a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-10/PEDI_UNL_2024-2028_ACTUALIZADO_PND_2025-2029_VFINAL_OCS_15-10-25.pdf" target="_blank">Plan Estratégico de Desarrollo Institucional (PEDI)</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-10/Informe%20Autodiagno%CC%81stico%20RESIES%20UNL-1.pdf" target="_blank">Informe de Autodiagnóstico RESIES</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-06/2025_unl_memoria_sostenibilidad_29-05-26_1.pdf" target="_blank">Memoria de Sostenibilidad</a></p></div></div></div></div></div><!-- =========================================\r\n     SCRIPT SCROLL Y ACORDEÓN\r\n     ========================================= --><script>\r\n  // REVEAL ANIMATION\r\n  window.addEventListener("scroll", () => {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll(".reveal").forEach(el => {\r\n      let top = el.getBoundingClientRect().top;\r\n      if (top < window.innerHeight - 80) {\r\n        el.classList.add("active");\r\n      }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    // PLANTA\r\n    let scroll = window.scrollY;\r\n    let stem = document.getElementById("stem");\r\n    if(stem) {\r\n      let growth = (scroll / document.body.scrollHeight) * window.innerHeight;\r\n      stem.style.height = growth + "px";\r\n      if (scroll > 150) showLeaf("l1");\r\n      if (scroll > 400) showLeaf("l2");\r\n      if (scroll > 800) showLeaf("l3");\r\n      if (scroll > 1200) showLeaf("l4");\r\n    }\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  function showLeaf(id) {\r\n    let leaf = document.getElementById(id);\r\n    if(leaf) {\r\n      leaf.style.opacity = 1;\r\n      leaf.style.transform = "scale(1)";\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  // ACCORDION BEHAVIOR\r\n  document.querySelectorAll(".accordion-header").forEach(header => {\r\n    header.addEventListener("click", () => {\r\n      let content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n      // Cerrar los demás\r\n      document.querySelectorAll(".accordion-content").forEach(item => {\r\n        if (item !== content) {\r\n          item.style.maxHeight = null;\r\n          item.previousElementSibling.classList.remove("active");\r\n        }\r\n      });\r\n      // Abrir/cerrar el actual\r\n      if (content.style.maxHeight) {\r\n        content.style.maxHeight = null;\r\n        header.classList.remove("active");\r\n      } else {\r\n        content.style.maxHeight = content.scrollHeight + "px";\r\n        header.classList.add("active");\r\n      }\r\n    });\r\n  });\r\n</script><!-- ==========================================================================\r\n     UNL SOSTENIBLE — Rankins e Iniciativas \r\n     (Se mantiene igual al diseño previo)\r\n     ========================================================================== --><section class="unl-sost-wrap" id="unl-rankings-iniciativas"><style type="text/css">\r\n      #unl-rankings-iniciativas{\r\n        --unl-verde-950:#0b2b1c;\r\n        --unl-verde-800:#12472c;\r\n        --unl-verde-700:#1b5e39;\r\n        --unl-verde-600:#2c7a4b;\r\n        --unl-verde-400:#5aa878;\r\n        --unl-verde-200:#bfe0cd;\r\n        --unl-verde-100:#e4f3ea;\r\n        --unl-tierra-600:#8a6a3f;\r\n        --unl-tierra-200:#ecdfc7;\r\n        --unl-agua-600:#1f7a8c;\r\n        --unl-agua-200:#cfeef2;\r\n        --unl-texto:#16241c;\r\n        --unl-texto-suave:#4a5c52;\r\n        --unl-borde:#d8e6dc;\r\n        --unl-fondo-card:#ffffff;\r\n        --unl-radio:14px;\r\n        font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n        color: var(--unl-texto);\r\n        max-width: 1180px;\r\n        margin: 0 auto;\r\n        padding: 56px 20px;\r\n        box-sizing: border-box;\r\n      }\r\n      #unl-rankings-iniciativas *{ box-sizing: border-box; }\r\n      .unl-sost-eyebrow{\r\n        display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\r\n        font-size:12px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.08em;\r\n        text-transform:uppercase; color: var(--unl-verde-700);\r\n        background: var(--unl-verde-100);\r\n        border:1px solid var(--unl-verde-200);\r\n        padding:5px 12px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:14px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-sost-eyebrow .dot{\r\n        width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;\r\n        background: var(--unl-verde-600);\r\n        animation: unlPulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-sost-h2{\r\n        font-size: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 34px);\r\n        font-weight: 800; line-height:1.2; margin:0 0 10px;\r\n        color: var(--unl-verde-950);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-sost-sub{\r\n        font-size:16px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave);\r\n        max-width:62ch; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 35px;\r\n      }\r\n      /* SECCIÓN 1: RANKINGS */\r\n      .unl-rank-section{ margin-bottom:72px; position:relative; }\r\n      .unl-rank-grid{\r\n        display:grid;\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));\r\n        gap:20px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-card{\r\n        background: var(--unl-fondo-card);\r\n        border:1px solid var(--unl-borde);\r\n        border-radius: var(--unl-radio);\r\n        padding:24px 22px;\r\n        position:relative;\r\n        overflow:hidden;\r\n        transition: transform .35s ease, box-shadow .35s ease, border-color .35s ease;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-card:hover{\r\n        transform: translateY(-4px);\r\n        box-shadow: 0 14px 28px -14px rgba(18,71,44,.25);\r\n        border-color: var(--unl-verde-400);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-card::before{\r\n        content:"";\r\n        position:absolute; inset:0 0 auto 0; height:4px;\r\n        background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--unl-verde-600), var(--unl-agua-600));\r\n        transform-origin:left; transform:scaleX(0);\r\n        transition: transform .6s ease;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-card.unl-inview::before{ transform:scaleX(1); }\r\n      .unl-rank-icon{\r\n        width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;\r\n        background: var(--unl-verde-100);\r\n        display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\r\n        margin-bottom:16px; color: var(--unl-verde-700);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-icon svg{ width:24px;height:24px; }\r\n      .unl-rank-label{\r\n        font-size:13px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave); font-weight:600;\r\n        text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.03em; margin-bottom:5px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-number{\r\n        font-size:32px; font-weight:800; color: var(--unl-verde-800);\r\n        line-height:1; display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:5px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-number .unl-rank-suffix{ font-size:17px; font-weight:700; color: var(--unl-verde-600); }\r\n      .unl-rank-desc{ font-size:14px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave); margin-top:9px; line-height:1.5; }\r\n      .unl-rank-tag{\r\n        display:inline-block; margin-top:14px; font-size:12px; font-weight:700;\r\n        color: var(--unl-tierra-600); background: var(--unl-tierra-200);\r\n        padding:3px 9px; border-radius:6px;\r\n      }\r\n      /* Ring de progreso circular (áreas evaluadas) */\r\n      .unl-ring-block{\r\n        margin-top:40px; padding-top:35px;\r\n        border-top:1px dashed var(--unl-borde);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-ring-title{ font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 22px; color: var(--unl-verde-950); }\r\n      .unl-ring-grid{\r\n        display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px,1fr));\r\n        gap:20px; text-align:center;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-ring-item{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:10px; }\r\n      .unl-ring-svg{ width:88px; height:88px; }\r\n      .unl-ring-track{ fill:none; stroke: var(--unl-verde-100); stroke-width:8; }\r\n      .unl-ring-bar{\r\n        fill:none; stroke: var(--unl-verde-600); stroke-width:8; stroke-linecap:round;\r\n        stroke-dasharray: 251; stroke-dashoffset: 251;\r\n        transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.4s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-ring-pct{ font-size:15px; font-weight:800; fill: var(--unl-verde-800); }\r\n      .unl-ring-name{ font-size:12px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave); font-weight:600; line-height:1.3; }\r\n      /* SECCIÓN 2: INICIATIVAS INTERNACIONALES */\r\n      .unl-init-section{ position:relative; }\r\n      .unl-init-grid{\r\n        display:grid;\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\r\n        gap:24px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-card{\r\n        background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--unl-verde-950) 0%, var(--unl-verde-800) 100%);\r\n        border-radius: var(--unl-radio);\r\n        padding:28px;\r\n        color:#f2f8f4;\r\n        position:relative;\r\n        overflow:hidden;\r\n        min-height:260px;\r\n        display:flex; flex-direction:column;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-card.unl-agua{\r\n        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0c3b44 0%, #124f5c 100%);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-motif{\r\n        position:absolute; right:-22px; top:-22px; width:190px; height:190px;\r\n        opacity:.16; pointer-events:none;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-motif.unl-motif-atomo{ animation: unlSpin 22s linear infinite; }\r\n      .unl-init-card.unl-agua .unl-init-motif circle,\r\n      .unl-init-card.unl-agua .unl-init-motif ellipse{ stroke:#dff5f8; }\r\n      .unl-init-card:not(.unl-agua) .unl-init-motif path,\r\n      .unl-init-card:not(.unl-agua) .unl-init-motif circle{ stroke:#d9f0e2; fill:#d9f0e2; }\r\n      .unl-init-top{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:18px; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n      .unl-init-badge{\r\n        font-size:11px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em;\r\n        background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); padding:5px 10px; border-radius:999px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-year{ font-size:12px; color:#cfe6d8; font-weight:600; }\r\n      .unl-init-name{ font-size:20px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 9px; line-height:1.25; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n      .unl-init-desc{ font-size:15px; color:#d8ebe0; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 19px; flex:1; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n      .unl-init-progress-row{ margin-top:auto; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n      .unl-init-progress-label{\r\n        display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:12px;\r\n        color:#cfe6d8; margin-bottom:6px; font-weight:600;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-bar-track{\r\n        width:100%; height:8px; border-radius:999px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.14);\r\n        overflow:hidden;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-bar-fill{\r\n        height:100%; border-radius:999px;\r\n        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7fd7a5, #b7e8c9);\r\n        width:0%; transition: width 1.6s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-agua .unl-init-bar-fill{ background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6cc9d6, #a9e4ec); }\r\n      @keyframes unlSpin{ from{ transform: rotate(0deg);} to{ transform: rotate(360deg);} }\r\n      @keyframes unlPulse{\r\n        0%,100%{ opacity:1; transform:scale(1); }\r\n        50%{ opacity:.4; transform:scale(1.3); }\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-fade-up{\r\n        opacity:0; transform: translateY(18px);\r\n        transition: opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-fade-up.unl-inview{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }\r\n      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\r\n        #unl-rankings-iniciativas *{ animation:none !important; transition:none !important; }\r\n        .unl-fade-up{ opacity:1; transform:none; }\r\n      }\r\n      @media (max-width: 620px){\r\n        #unl-rankings-iniciativas{ padding: 40px 16px; }\r\n        .unl-rank-number{ font-size:26px; }\r\n      }\r\n    </style><div class="unl-rank-section"><p><span class="unl-sost-eyebrow">Reconocimientos</span></p><h2 class="unl-sost-h2">Rankings y reconocimientos en sostenibilidad</h2><p class="unl-sost-sub">Resultados obtenidos por la Universidad Nacional de Loja en los principales sistemas internacionales que evalúan investigación, impacto y sostenibilidad institucional.</p><div class="unl-rank-grid"><!-- Tarjeta 1: SCImago --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 8l9-5 9 5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><rect height="9" width="2.4" x="4" y="9"></rect><rect height="9" width="2.4" x="9" y="9"></rect><rect height="9" width="2.4" x="14" y="9"></rect><rect height="9" width="1.6" x="19" y="9"></rect><rect height="2" width="18" x="3" y="19"></rect></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">SCImago Institutions Rankings</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="8">0</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Entre universidades públicas del Ecuador por su impacto, la calidad y la visibilidad de la producción científica.</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición 2025</span></p></div><!-- Tarjeta 2: UI GreenMetric --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M4 10.5c2.5 1.2 5 1.2 8 .3s6-.3 8 1"></path><path d="M6 16c2 .8 4.2.8 6.5 0s4.8-.6 6.6.4"></path><path d="M12 3.5v17"></path></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">UI GreenMetric World University Rankings</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="004">0</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Entre universidades públicas del Ecuador por acciones en infraestructura sostenible, energía, manejo de residuos, agua, transporte y educación ambiental.</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición 2025</span></p></div><!-- Tarjeta 3: THE World University Rankings --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="18" rx="5" width="18" x="3" y="3"></rect><path d="M8 8h3.2v8H8z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path><path d="M13 8h1.4v8H13z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path><path d="M15.6 8h1.4v8h-1.4z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">THE World University Rankings</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="0005">0</span><span class="unl-rank-suffix">[EDITAR]</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Mejor universidad pública del Ecuador</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición 2025</span></p></div><!-- Tarjeta 4: Webometrics --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.2"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2"></circle><path d="M7.6 7.2l3 3.4M16.4 7.2l-3 3.4M7.6 16.8l3-3.4M16.4 16.8l-3-3.4"></path></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">Webometrics Ranking Web of Universities</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="000">0</span><span class="unl-rank-suffix">[EDITAR]</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Posición según presencia, apertura e impacto del sitio web institucional. [EDITAR con dato real]</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición [EDITAR año]</span></p></div></div><div class="unl-ring-block unl-fade-up"><h3 class="unl-ring-title">Desempeño por área evaluada [EDITAR con puntajes reales]</h3><div class="unl-ring-grid"><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="72" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">72%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Entorno e</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">infraestructura</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="58" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">58%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Energía y</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">cambio climático</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="65" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">65%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Gestión de</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">residuos</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="80" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">80%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Uso eficiente</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">del agua</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="61" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">61%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Transporte</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">sostenible</span></div><div class="unl-ring-item"><svg class="unl-ring-svg" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><circle class="unl-ring-track" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"></circle><circle class="unl-ring-bar" cx="50" cy="50" data-pct="88" r="40" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"></circle><text class="unl-ring-pct" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="55">88%</text> </svg><span class="unl-ring-name">Educación e</span><br><span class="unl-ring-name">investigación</span></div></div></div></div><!-- SECCIÓN 2: INICIATIVAS INTERNACIONALES --><div class="unl-init-section"><p><span class="unl-sost-eyebrow">Cooperación internacional</span></p><h2 class="unl-sost-h2">Iniciativas y concursos internacionales</h2><p class="unl-sost-sub">La UNL participa actualmente en las siguientes iniciativas internacionales orientadas a fortalecer su modelo de sostenibilidad institucional. [EDITAR: reemplazar nombres, descripciones y avance real]</p><div class="unl-init-grid"><!-- Iniciativa 1 --><div class="unl-init-card unl-fade-up"><svg class="unl-init-motif unl-motif-planta" aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M50 95V50" fill="none" stroke-width="2"></path><path d="M50 70C38 66 30 56 30 44" fill="none" stroke-width="2"></path><path d="M50 60C62 56 70 46 70 34" fill="none" stroke-width="2"></path><path d="M50 50C41 45 36 36 37 26" fill="none" stroke-width="2"></path><circle cx="30" cy="44" r="4"></circle><circle cx="70" cy="34" r="4"></circle><circle cx="37" cy="26" r="4"></circle><circle cx="50" cy="18" r="5"></circle></svg><div class="unl-init-top"><span class="unl-init-badge">Iniciativa 1</span> <span class="unl-init-year">[EDITAR año inicio]</span></div><h3 class="unl-init-name">[EDITAR: nombre de la iniciativa internacional 1]</h3><p class="unl-init-desc">[EDITAR: descripción breve — qué es la iniciativa, quién la convoca y qué compromiso concreto asumió la UNL al participar].</p><div class="unl-init-progress-row"><div class="unl-init-progress-label"><span>Avance del compromiso</span><span class="unl-init-pct">0%</span></div><div class="unl-init-bar-track"><div class="unl-init-bar-fill" data-pct="45">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div><!-- Iniciativa 2 --><div class="unl-init-card unl-agua unl-fade-up"><svg class="unl-init-motif unl-motif-atomo" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" viewbox="0 0 100 100"><ellipse cx="50" cy="50" rx="42" ry="16"></ellipse><ellipse cx="50" cy="50" rx="42" ry="16" transform="rotate(60 50 50)"></ellipse><ellipse cx="50" cy="50" rx="42" ry="16" transform="rotate(120 50 50)"></ellipse><circle cx="50" cy="50" fill="currentColor" r="6" stroke="none"></circle><circle cx="92" cy="50" fill="currentColor" r="3" stroke="none"></circle><circle cx="26" cy="78" fill="currentColor" r="3" stroke="none"></circle><circle cx="26" cy="22" fill="currentColor" r="3" stroke="none"></circle></svg><div class="unl-init-top"><span class="unl-init-badge">Iniciativa 2</span> <span class="unl-init-year">[EDITAR año inicio]</span></div><h3 class="unl-init-name">[EDITAR: nombre de la iniciativa internacional 2]</h3><p class="unl-init-desc">[EDITAR: descripción breve — objetivo del concurso o red, alcance geográfico y en qué consiste la participación de la UNL].</p><div class="unl-init-progress-row"><div class="unl-init-progress-label"><span>Avance del compromiso</span><span class="unl-init-pct">0%</span></div><div class="unl-init-bar-track"><div class="unl-init-bar-fill" data-pct="62">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>\r\n(function(){\r\n  var root = document.getElementById('unl-rankings-iniciativas');\r\n  if(!root) return;\r\n  var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\r\n  function animateCount(el){\r\n    var target = parseInt(el.getAttribute('data-target'), 10) || 0;\r\n    if(reduce){ el.textContent = target; return; }\r\n    var start = 0, dur = 1400, t0 = null;\r\n    function step(ts){\r\n      if(!t0) t0 = ts;\r\n      var p = Math.min((ts - t0) / dur, 1);\r\n      el.textContent = Math.round(start + (target - start) * p);\r\n      if(p < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);\r\n    }\r\n    requestAnimationFrame(step);\r\n  }\r\n  function animateRing(circle){\r\n    var pct = parseFloat(circle.getAttribute('data-pct')) || 0;\r\n    var offset = 251 - (251 * pct / 100);\r\n    circle.style.strokeDashoffset = offset;\r\n  }\r\n  function animateBar(bar){\r\n    var pct = parseFloat(bar.getAttribute('data-pct')) || 0;\r\n    bar.style.width = pct + '%';\r\n    var label = bar.closest('.unl-init-progress-row').querySelector('.unl-init-pct');\r\n    if(label) label.textContent = pct + '%';\r\n  }\r\n  var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){\r\n    entries.forEach(function(entry){\r\n      if(!entry.isIntersecting) return;\r\n      var el = entry.target;\r\n      el.classList.add('unl-inview');\r\n      el.querySelectorAll('.unl-rank-count').forEach(animateCount);\r\n      el.querySelectorAll('.unl-ring-bar').forEach(animateRing);\r\n      el.querySelectorAll('.unl-init-bar-fill').forEach(animateBar);\r\n      io.unobserve(el);\r\n    });\r\n  }, { threshold: .3 });\r\n  root.querySelectorAll('.unl-fade-up, .unl-rank-card').forEach(function(el){\r\n    io.observe(el);\r\n  });\r\n})();\r\n</script>	full_html
texto_libre	0	111	1370	en	0	<p><br><style type="text/css">/* BASE */\r\n    body {\r\n      margin: 0;\r\n      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\r\n      background: #ffffff;\r\n      color: #111;\r\n      overflow-x: hidden;\r\n    }\r\n    /* FONDO */\r\n    .background {\r\n      position: fixed;\r\n      width: 100%;\r\n      height: 100%;\r\n      z-index: -2;\r\n      background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, #22c55e20, transparent 40%),\r\n                  radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, #16a34a15, transparent 40%);\r\n    }\r\n    /* HERO FULL IMAGE */\r\n    .hero {\r\n      min-height: 80vh;\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n      padding: 60px 8%;\r\n      position: relative;\r\n      color: white;\r\n    }\r\n    .hero::before {\r\n      content: "";\r\n      position: absolute;\r\n      inset: 0;\r\n      background: url('https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/IMG_0503.jpeg') center/cover no-repeat;\r\n      z-index: -1;\r\n    }\r\n    .hero::after {\r\n      content: "";\r\n      position: absolute;\r\n      inset: 0;\r\n      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\r\n      z-index: -1;\r\n    }\r\n    .hero h1 {\r\n      font-size: 3rem;\r\n    }\r\n    .hero span {\r\n      color: #22c55e;\r\n    }\r\n    /* PLANTA */\r\n    .plant-container {\r\n      position: fixed;\r\n      left: 40px;\r\n      top: 0;\r\n      height: 100vh;\r\n      width: 80px;\r\n    }\r\n    .stem {\r\n      width: 6px;\r\n      background: linear-gradient(#16a34a, #22c55e);\r\n      height: 0;\r\n      margin: auto;\r\n      transition: height 0.2s ease-out;\r\n    }\r\n    .leaf {\r\n      width: 22px;\r\n      height: 12px;\r\n      background: #22c55e;\r\n      border-radius: 20px 4px 20px 4px;\r\n      position: absolute;\r\n      opacity: 0;\r\n      transform: scale(0) rotate(0deg);\r\n      transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease;\r\n    }\r\n    .l1 { top: 150px; left: 43px; transform-origin: left center; }\r\n    .l2 { top: 350px; left: 6px;  transform-origin: right center; }\r\n    .l3 { top: 550px; left: 43px; transform-origin: left center; }\r\n    .l4 { top: 750px; left: 6px;  transform-origin: right center; }\r\n    .leaf.active { opacity: 1; }\r\n    .l1.active { transform: scale(1) rotate(-18deg); }\r\n    .l2.active { transform: scale(1) rotate(18deg); }\r\n    .l3.active { transform: scale(1) rotate(-18deg); }\r\n    .l4.active { transform: scale(1) rotate(18deg); }\r\n    /* SECCIONES */\r\n    .section {\r\n      padding: 50px 8%;\r\n    }\r\n    /* TITULOS */\r\n    h2 {\r\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n    }\r\n    /* GRID */\r\n    .grid {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));\r\n      gap: 15px;\r\n    }\r\n    /* CARD */\r\n    .card {\r\n      background: #f9fafb;\r\n      padding: 20px;\r\n      border-radius: 14px;\r\n      border: 1px solid #eee;\r\n    }\r\n    /* BOTÓN LINK */\r\n    .btn {\r\n      display: inline-block;\r\n      margin-top: 10px;\r\n      padding: 8px 18px;\r\n      border-radius: 20px;\r\n      background: #16a34a;\r\n      color: white;\r\n      text-decoration: none;\r\n    }\r\n    /* ACCORDION */\r\n    .accordion-item {\r\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n      border-radius: 12px;\r\n      overflow: hidden;\r\n      border: 1px solid #eee;\r\n    }\r\n    .accordion-header {\r\n      padding: 15px;\r\n      cursor: pointer;\r\n      background: #f9fafb;\r\n      font-weight: 600;\r\n    }\r\n    .accordion-content {\r\n      max-height: 0;\r\n      overflow: hidden;\r\n      transition: 0.4s;\r\n      padding: 0 15px;\r\n    }\r\n    .accordion-content a {\r\n      display: block;\r\n      margin: 10px 0;\r\n    }\r\n    /* REVEAL */\r\n    .reveal {\r\n      opacity: 0;\r\n      transform: translateY(30px);\r\n      transition: 0.6s;\r\n    }\r\n    .reveal.active {\r\n      opacity: 1;\r\n      transform: translateY(0);\r\n    }\r\n    /* ICONO + */\r\n    .accordion-header {\r\n      position: relative;\r\n      padding-right: 40px;\r\n    }\r\n    .accordion-header::after {\r\n      content: "+";\r\n      position: absolute;\r\n      right: 15px;\r\n      top: 50%;\r\n      transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(0deg);\r\n      font-size: 20px;\r\n      font-weight: bold;\r\n      color: #16a34a;\r\n      transition: transform 0.3s ease;\r\n    }\r\n    /* cuando está abierto */\r\n    .accordion-header.active::after {\r\n      transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(45deg);\r\n    }\r\n    </style></p><div class="background">&nbsp;</div><!-- PLANTA --><div class="plant-container"><div class="stem" id="stem">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l1" id="l1">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l2" id="l2">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l3" id="l3">&nbsp;</div><div class="leaf l4" id="l4">&nbsp;</div></div><!-- HERO --><div class="hero"><div><h1 class="text-align-center">UNL <span>SOSTENIBLE</span></h1><p class="text-align-center">Innovación, educación y compromiso con el futuro.</p></div></div><!-- POLÍTICAS --><div class="section"><h2><meta charset="UTF-8"></h2><p>La Universidad Nacional de Loja asume su compromiso con el modelo UNL Sostenible, una estrategia institucional orientada a integrar la sostenibilidad en todos sus ámbitos: académico, investigativo, de ge y vinculación con la sociedad. Este compromiso forma parte del Plan Estratégico de Desarrollo Institucional, que busca promover una universidad responsable con el entorno, que fomente la innovación, el uso eficiente de los recursos y la formación de ciudadanos comprometidos con un desarrollo equilibrado y sostenible para el sur del Ecuador y el mundo.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2></div><!-- ACCORDION --><div class="section"><h2>Recursos institucionales</h2><p>Asegura equidad, accesibilidad y participación plena en la UNL</p><div class="accordion"><!-- POLITICAS --><div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header">Políticas y planes</div><div class="accordion-content"><a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/unl_politica_de_inclusion_educativa_2025.pdf" target="_blank">Política de inclusión</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/14-04-26_UNL_PLAN%20SOSTENIBIIDAD%20FINAL%20pdf.pdf" target="_blank">Plan de Gestión de Sostenibilidad</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/PROPUESTA%20POLITICA%20COMPRAS%20E%20INVERSIONES%20SOSTENIBLES%20.pdf" target="_blank">Política de Compras e Inversiones Sostenibles</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/pol%C3%ADtica_de_sostenibilidad_unl_certificacion-signed.pdf" target="_blank">Política de Sostenibilidad de la Universidad Nacional de Loja</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/resoluci%C3%B3n_so-no.03-rocs-no.8.4-07-02-2026_aprobacion_politica_de_sostenibilidad.pdf" target="_blank">Resolución Nro. SO-No.03-ROCS-No-8.4-07-04-2026</a></div></div><!-- PARTICIPACIÓN --><p>Accede a nuestras líneas de participación institucional</p></div><div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header">Participación y democracia</div><div class="accordion-content"><a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/Acuerdo%20SENESCYT-CZ7-2023-001-OS%20Asociacio%CC%81n%20General%20de%20Docentes%20Universitarios%20de%20Loja%20%E2%80%9CAGEDUL%E2%80%9D.pdf" target="_blank">AGEDUL</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/ASA-UNL.PDF.pdf" target="_blank">ASA</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/ESTATUTO%20FEUE%20LOJA.pdf" target="_blank">FEUE Loja</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-11/Sindicatos%20de%20trabajadores%20la%20Argelia_UNL.pdf" target="_blank">Sindicato La Argelia</a></div></div><!-- DOCUMENTOS --><p>Documento guía para la gestión estratégica de la UNL</p><div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header">Documentos institucionales</div><div class="accordion-content"><a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-10/PEDI_UNL_2024-2028_ACTUALIZADO_PND_2025-2029_VFINAL_OCS_15-10-25.pdf" target="_blank">Plan Estratégico de Desarrollo Institucional (PEDI)</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-10/Informe%20Autodiagno%CC%81stico%20RESIES%20UNL-1.pdf" target="_blank">Informe de Autodiagnóstico RESIES</a> <a class="btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-06/2025_unl_memoria_sostenibilidad_29-05-26_1.pdf" target="_blank">Memoria de Sostenibilidad</a></div></div></div><script>\r\n// REVEAL + PLANTA\r\nwindow.addEventListener("scroll", () => {\r\n  document.querySelectorAll(".reveal").forEach(el => {\r\n    let top = el.getBoundingClientRect().top;\r\n    if (top < window.innerHeight - 80) {\r\n      el.classList.add("active");\r\n    }\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  // PLANTA: crecimiento proporcional al scroll real de la página\r\n  let scrollable = document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;\r\n  let progress = scrollable > 0 ? window.scrollY / scrollable : 0;\r\n  progress = Math.min(Math.max(progress, 0), 1);\r\n\r\n  let maxStemHeight = 780; // debe cubrir el top de la última hoja (l4: 750px)\r\n  let stem = document.getElementById("stem");\r\n  let growth = progress * maxStemHeight;\r\n  stem.style.height = growth + "px";\r\n\r\n  document.querySelectorAll(".leaf").forEach(leaf => {\r\n    let leafTop = parseInt(getComputedStyle(leaf).top, 10);\r\n    if (growth >= leafTop) {\r\n      leaf.classList.add("active");\r\n    } else {\r\n      leaf.classList.remove("active");\r\n    }\r\n  });\r\n});\r\n// ACCORDION\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll(".accordion-header").forEach(header => {\r\n  header.addEventListener("click", () => {\r\n    let content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    document.querySelectorAll(".accordion-content").forEach(item => {\r\n      if (item !== content) item.style.maxHeight = null;\r\n    });\r\n    content.style.maxHeight = content.scrollHeight + "px";\r\n  });\r\n});\r\n</script><!--\r\n  ==========================================================================\r\n  UNL SOSTENIBLE — Secciones nuevas: "Rankings y reconocimientos" +\r\n  "Iniciativas internacionales"\r\n  ==========================================================================\r\n  CAMBIOS EN ESTA VERSIÓN\r\n  1. Todas las medidas de texto/espaciado pasaron de rem a px.\r\n  2. Los iconos de la sección de rankings ahora representan a los 4 sistemas\r\n     de evaluación (SCImago, UI GreenMetric, THE World University Rankings,\r\n     Webometrics). Son versiones simplificadas/genéricas inspiradas en la\r\n     forma de cada símbolo (columnas, globo, insignia, red), NO reproducciones\r\n     exactas de los logotipos originales -> los logos oficiales son marca\r\n     registrada de cada organización, así que para el logo pixel-perfecto\r\n     te recomiendo descargarlo del kit de prensa/branding de cada ranking\r\n     y reemplazar el <svg> de ese icono por su <img> oficial.\r\n  3. El fondo decorativo de las tarjetas de "Iniciativas internacionales" ya\r\n     no es una hoja tipo burbuja: ahora la tarjeta verde tiene un patrón de\r\n     planta/ramificación (sostenibilidad) y la tarjeta agua tiene un patrón\r\n     de átomo/órbitas (investigación).\r\n  4. Sigue sin tocar la paleta de colores del sitio (variables --unl-verde-*,\r\n     --unl-agua-*, --unl-tierra-* al inicio del <style>).\r\n  5. Los textos marcados "[EDITAR]" siguen siendo plantilla: reemplázalos\r\n     con los datos reales de la universidad.\r\n  ==========================================================================\r\n--><section class="unl-sost-wrap" id="unl-rankings-iniciativas"><style type="text/css">#unl-rankings-iniciativas{\r\n        --unl-verde-950:#0b2b1c;\r\n        --unl-verde-800:#12472c;\r\n        --unl-verde-700:#1b5e39;\r\n        --unl-verde-600:#2c7a4b;\r\n        --unl-verde-400:#5aa878;\r\n        --unl-verde-200:#bfe0cd;\r\n        --unl-verde-100:#e4f3ea;\r\n        --unl-tierra-600:#8a6a3f;\r\n        --unl-tierra-200:#ecdfc7;\r\n        --unl-agua-600:#1f7a8c;\r\n        --unl-agua-200:#cfeef2;\r\n        --unl-texto:#16241c;\r\n        --unl-texto-suave:#4a5c52;\r\n        --unl-borde:#d8e6dc;\r\n        --unl-fondo-card:#ffffff;\r\n        --unl-radio:14px;\r\n        font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n        color: var(--unl-texto);\r\n        max-width: 1180px;\r\n        margin: 0 auto;\r\n        padding: 56px 20px;\r\n        box-sizing: border-box;\r\n      }\r\n      #unl-rankings-iniciativas *{ box-sizing: border-box; }\r\n      .unl-sost-eyebrow{\r\n        display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\r\n        font-size:12px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.08em;\r\n        text-transform:uppercase; color: var(--unl-verde-700);\r\n        background: var(--unl-verde-100);\r\n        border:1px solid var(--unl-verde-200);\r\n        padding:5px 12px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:14px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-sost-eyebrow .dot{\r\n        width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;\r\n        background: var(--unl-verde-600);\r\n        animation: unlPulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-sost-h2{\r\n        font-size: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 34px);\r\n        font-weight: 800; line-height:1.2; margin:0 0 10px;\r\n        color: var(--unl-verde-950);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-sost-sub{\r\n        font-size:16px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave);\r\n        max-width:62ch; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 35px;\r\n      }\r\n      /* ============ SECCIÓN 1: RANKINGS ============ */\r\n      .unl-rank-section{ margin-bottom:72px; position:relative; }\r\n      .unl-rank-grid{\r\n        display:grid;\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));\r\n        gap:20px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-card{\r\n        background: var(--unl-fondo-card);\r\n        border:1px solid var(--unl-borde);\r\n        border-radius: var(--unl-radio);\r\n        padding:24px 22px;\r\n        position:relative;\r\n        overflow:hidden;\r\n        transition: transform .35s ease, box-shadow .35s ease, border-color .35s ease;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-card:hover{\r\n        transform: translateY(-4px);\r\n        box-shadow: 0 14px 28px -14px rgba(18,71,44,.25);\r\n        border-color: var(--unl-verde-400);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-card::before{\r\n        content:"";\r\n        position:absolute; inset:0 0 auto 0; height:4px;\r\n        background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--unl-verde-600), var(--unl-agua-600));\r\n        transform-origin:left; transform:scaleX(0);\r\n        transition: transform .6s ease;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-card.unl-inview::before{ transform:scaleX(1); }\r\n      .unl-rank-icon{\r\n        width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;\r\n        background: var(--unl-verde-100);\r\n        display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\r\n        margin-bottom:16px; color: var(--unl-verde-700);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-icon svg{ width:24px;height:24px; }\r\n      .unl-rank-label{\r\n        font-size:13px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave); font-weight:600;\r\n        text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.03em; margin-bottom:5px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-number{\r\n        font-size:32px; font-weight:800; color: var(--unl-verde-800);\r\n        line-height:1; display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:5px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-rank-number .unl-rank-suffix{ font-size:17px; font-weight:700; color: var(--unl-verde-600); }\r\n      .unl-rank-desc{ font-size:14px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave); margin-top:9px; line-height:1.5; }\r\n      .unl-rank-tag{\r\n        display:inline-block; margin-top:14px; font-size:12px; font-weight:700;\r\n        color: var(--unl-tierra-600); background: var(--unl-tierra-200);\r\n        padding:3px 9px; border-radius:6px;\r\n      }\r\n      /* Ring de progreso circular (áreas evaluadas) */\r\n      .unl-ring-block{\r\n        margin-top:40px; padding-top:35px;\r\n        border-top:1px dashed var(--unl-borde);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-ring-title{ font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 22px; color: var(--unl-verde-950); }\r\n      .unl-ring-grid{\r\n        display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px,1fr));\r\n        gap:20px; text-align:center;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-ring-item{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:10px; }\r\n      .unl-ring-svg{ width:88px; height:88px; }\r\n      .unl-ring-track{ fill:none; stroke: var(--unl-verde-100); stroke-width:8; }\r\n      .unl-ring-bar{\r\n        fill:none; stroke: var(--unl-verde-600); stroke-width:8; stroke-linecap:round;\r\n        stroke-dasharray: 251; stroke-dashoffset: 251;\r\n        transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.4s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-ring-pct{ font-size:15px; font-weight:800; fill: var(--unl-verde-800); }\r\n      .unl-ring-name{ font-size:12px; color: var(--unl-texto-suave); font-weight:600; line-height:1.3; }\r\n      /* ============ SECCIÓN 2: INICIATIVAS INTERNACIONALES ============ */\r\n      .unl-init-section{ position:relative; }\r\n      .unl-init-grid{\r\n        display:grid;\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\r\n        gap:24px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-card{\r\n        background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--unl-verde-950) 0%, var(--unl-verde-800) 100%);\r\n        border-radius: var(--unl-radio);\r\n        padding:28px;\r\n        color:#f2f8f4;\r\n        position:relative;\r\n        overflow:hidden;\r\n        min-height:260px;\r\n        display:flex; flex-direction:column;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-card.unl-agua{\r\n        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0c3b44 0%, #124f5c 100%);\r\n      }\r\n      /* --- Fondos decorativos temáticos --- */\r\n      .unl-init-motif{\r\n        position:absolute; right:-22px; top:-22px; width:190px; height:190px;\r\n        opacity:.16; pointer-events:none;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-motif.unl-motif-atomo{ animation: unlSpin 22s linear infinite; }\r\n      .unl-init-card.unl-agua .unl-init-motif circle,\r\n      .unl-init-card.unl-agua .unl-init-motif ellipse{ stroke:#dff5f8; }\r\n      .unl-init-card:not(.unl-agua) .unl-init-motif path,\r\n      .unl-init-card:not(.unl-agua) .unl-init-motif circle{ stroke:#d9f0e2; fill:#d9f0e2; }\r\n      .unl-init-top{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:18px; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n      .unl-init-badge{\r\n        font-size:11px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em;\r\n        background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); padding:5px 10px; border-radius:999px;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-year{ font-size:12px; color:#cfe6d8; font-weight:600; }\r\n      .unl-init-name{ font-size:20px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 9px; line-height:1.25; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n      .unl-init-desc{ font-size:15px; color:#d8ebe0; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 19px; flex:1; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n      .unl-init-progress-row{ margin-top:auto; position:relative; z-index:1; }\r\n      .unl-init-progress-label{\r\n        display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:12px;\r\n        color:#cfe6d8; margin-bottom:6px; font-weight:600;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-bar-track{\r\n        width:100%; height:8px; border-radius:999px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.14);\r\n        overflow:hidden;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-init-bar-fill{\r\n        height:100%; border-radius:999px;\r\n        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7fd7a5, #b7e8c9);\r\n        width:0%; transition: width 1.6s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-agua .unl-init-bar-fill{ background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6cc9d6, #a9e4ec); }\r\n      @keyframes unlSpin{ from{ transform: rotate(0deg);} to{ transform: rotate(360deg);} }\r\n      @keyframes unlPulse{\r\n        0%,100%{ opacity:1; transform:scale(1); }\r\n        50%{ opacity:.4; transform:scale(1.3); }\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-fade-up{\r\n        opacity:0; transform: translateY(18px);\r\n        transition: opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;\r\n      }\r\n      .unl-fade-up.unl-inview{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }\r\n      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\r\n        #unl-rankings-iniciativas *{ animation:none !important; transition:none !important; }\r\n        .unl-fade-up{ opacity:1; transform:none; }\r\n      }\r\n      @media (max-width: 620px){\r\n        #unl-rankings-iniciativas{ padding: 40px 16px; }\r\n        .unl-rank-number{ font-size:26px; }\r\n      }\r\n    </style><!-- ===================== SECCIÓN 1: RANKINGS ===================== --><div class="unl-rank-section"><p><span class="unl-sost-eyebrow">Reconocimientos</span></p><h2 class="unl-sost-h2">Rankings y reconocimientos en sostenibilidad</h2><p class="unl-sost-sub">Resultados obtenidos por la Universidad Nacional de Loja en los principales sistemas internacionales que evalúan investigación, impacto y sostenibilidad institucional.</p><div class="unl-rank-grid"><!-- Tarjeta 1: SCImago --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 8l9-5 9 5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><rect height="9" width="2.4" x="4" y="9"></rect><rect height="9" width="2.4" x="9" y="9"></rect><rect height="9" width="2.4" x="14" y="9"></rect><rect height="9" width="1.6" x="19" y="9"></rect><rect height="2" width="18" x="3" y="19"></rect></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">SCImago Institutions Rankings</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="8">0</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Entre universidades públicas del Ecuador por su impacto, la calidad y la visibilidad de la producción científica.</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición 2025</span></p></div><!-- Tarjeta 2: UI GreenMetric --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M4 10.5c2.5 1.2 5 1.2 8 .3s6-.3 8 1"></path><path d="M6 16c2 .8 4.2.8 6.5 0s4.8-.6 6.6.4"></path><path d="M12 3.5v17"></path></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">UI GreenMetric World University Rankings</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="004">0</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Entre universidades públicas del Ecuador por acciones en infraestructura sostenible, energía, manejo de residuos, agua, transporte y educación ambiental.</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición 2025</span></p></div><!-- Tarjeta 3: THE World University Rankings --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="18" rx="5" width="18" x="3" y="3"></rect><path d="M8 8h3.2v8H8z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path><path d="M13 8h1.4v8H13z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path><path d="M15.6 8h1.4v8h-1.4z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path></svg></div><div class="unl-rank-label">THE World University Rankings</div><div class="unl-rank-number"><span class="unl-rank-count" data-target="0005">0</span><span class="unl-rank-suffix">[EDITAR]</span></div><p class="unl-rank-desc">Mejor universidad pública del Ecuador</p><p><span class="unl-rank-tag">Edición 2025</span></p></div><!-- Tarjeta 4: Webometrics --><div class="unl-rank-card unl-fade-up"><div class="unl-rank-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.2"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2"></circle><path d="M7.6 7.2l3 3.4M16.4 7.2l-