po */\r\n    .group-card img {\r\n        max-width: 100%;\r\n        height: auto;\r\n        border-radius: 8px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* Título del grupo */\r\n    .group-title {\r\n        margin-top: 12px;\r\n        font-size: 1.2em;\r\n        font-weight: bold;\r\n        color: #333;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* Diseño responsivo */\r\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\r\n        .grid-container {\r\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .facultad-carrera {\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n</style><!-- HTML Mejorado --><div class="row m-auto text-center"><div class="facultad-carrera"><a href="/investigacion/proyectos-investigacion/2017-2018/" hreflang="es">Periodo 2017-2018</a></div><div class="facultad-carrera"><a href="/investigacion/proyectos-investigacion/2019-2021/" hreflang="es">Periodo 2019-2021</a></div><div class="facultad-carrera"><a href="/investigacion/proyectos-investigacion/2021-2023/" hreflang="es">Periodo 2021-2023</a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class="facultad-carrera"><a href="/investigacion/proyectos-investigacion/2023-2025/" hreflang="es">Periodo 2023-2025</a></div><div class="facultad-carrera"><a href="/investigacion/proyectos-investigacion/2025-2027/" hreflang="es">Periodo 2025-2027</a></div><div class="facultad-carrera"><a href="/investigacion/proyectos-investigacion/convocatorias" hreflang="es">Convocatoria a Proyectos de investigación con fondos institucionales</a></div></div>	full_html
texto_libre	0	119	1770	es	0	<p class="text-align-justify"><strong>&nbsp;Horizonte Europa</strong> es el programa marco de investigación e innovación (I+I) de la Unión Europea (UE) para el período 2021-2027.</p><p class="text-align-justify">El objetivo general del programa es alcanzar un impacto científico, tecnológico, económico y social de las inversiones de la UE en I+I, fortaleciendo de esta manera sus bases científicas y tecnológicas y fomentando la competitividad de todos los Estados Miembros (EEMM)</p><p class="text-align-justify">Con un presupuesto de <strong>95.517 millones de euros</strong> (en precios corrientes) para este periodo de siete años, Horizonte Europa será el Programa Marco con el mayor presupuesto hasta la fecha. El programa está diseñado con una mentalidad de inversión más que como un instrumento exclusivamente de financiación, y contará con una planificación que ayudará a la UE a realizar la transición hacia un futuro próspero y sostenible</p><p class="text-align-justify">Horizonte Europa se basa en tres pilares principales:</p><p class="text-align-justify">I. <strong>Ciencia Excelente:</strong> Este pilar se centra en la excelencia científica y tecnológica, con el objetivo de aumentar la calidad y la excelencia en la investigación y la innovación en la UE</p><p class="text-align-justify">II. <strong>Desafíos Globales y Competitividad Industrial Europea:</strong> Este pilar busca enfrentar los desafíos globales y mejorar la competitividad industrial en Europa</p><p class="text-align-justify">III. <strong>Europa Innovadora:</strong> Este pilar se centra en la innovación en la industria y la transformación digital de las sociedades</p><p class="text-align-justify">Además de estos pilares, el programa contará con un eje transversal y dos programas complementarios: el Fondo Europeo de Defensa y la Acción de Investigación y Innovación de la Alianza e Innovación de Investigación del Océano Atlántico y la Declaración.</p><p class="text-align-justify">Puntos Nacionales de Contacto (NCP por sus siglas en inglés)</p><p class="text-align-justify">Los Puntos Nacionales de Contacto (NCP) son actores clave en el programa Horizonte Europa, que tienen como objetivo principal promover y facilitar la participación de los investigadores y organizaciones de sus respectivos países en dicho programa. Sus funciones incluyen informar, aumentar la conciencia, circular documentos, coordinar reuniones informativas, promocionar, asistir, aconsejar y capacitar a los posibles participantes</p><p class="text-align-justify">Los NCP actúan como enlaces entre la Comisión Europea y la comunidad de investigación e innovación de cada país, brindando apoyo y orientación en todas las etapas del proceso de participación en Horizonte Europa</p><p class="text-align-justify">Los NCP de Ecuador están disponibles <a href="https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/support/ncp;sortQuery=country;countryGroups=MS,AC,PAC,3C;countries=20000879;functions=2,8"><strong>AQUÍ</strong></a></p><p class="text-align-justify">En el caso de la UNL, el responsable del NCP está a cargo de las convocatorias relacionadas con: Cultura, Creatividad y Sociedad Inclusiva.</p><p class="text-align-justify">A continuación, puede encontrar el enlace sobre la:&nbsp;<a href="https://www.fecyt.es/es/publicacion/guia-para-la-participacion-en-el-programa-horizonte-europa-para-america-latina-y-el"><strong>Guía para la participación en el programa Horizonte Europa para América Latina</strong></a></p>	full_html
texto_libre	0	160	1993	es	0	<style type="text/css">/* =====================================================\r\nRESET\r\n===================================================== */\r\n\r\n*{\r\n  margin:0;\r\n  padding:0;\r\n  box-sizing:border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\nhtml{\r\n  scroll-behavior:smooth;\r\n}\r\n\r\nbody{\r\n\r\n  font-family:\r\n    "Montserrat",\r\n    -apple-system,\r\n    BlinkMacSystemFont,\r\n    "Segoe UI",\r\n    sans-serif;\r\n\r\n  background:#ffffff;\r\n\r\n  color:#0b2341;\r\n\r\n  overflow-x:hidden;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =====================================================\r\nVARIABLES\r\n===================================================== */\r\n\r\n:root{\r\n\r\n  --primary:#0b2341;\r\n  --secondary:#17365d;\r\n\r\n  --text:#0b2341;\r\n\r\n  --text-soft:#5d6b84;\r\n\r\n  --white:#ffffff;\r\n\r\n  --border:rgba(11,35,65,.08);\r\n\r\n  --shadow:\r\n    0 10px 40px rgba(11,35,65,.08);\r\n\r\n  --radius:30px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =====================================================\r\nGLOBAL\r\n===================================================== */\r\n\r\na{\r\n  text-decoration:none;\r\n  color:inherit;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.container{\r\n  width:min(1400px,92%);\r\n  margin:auto;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =====================================================\r\nHERO\r\n===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.hero{\r\n\r\n  position:relative;\r\n\r\n  min-height:100vh;\r\n\r\n  display:flex;\r\n\r\n  align-items:center;\r\n\r\n  overflow:hidden;\r\n\r\n  padding:120px 0 80px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =====================================================\r\nIMAGE BACKGROUND\r\n===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.hero-bg{\r\n\r\n  position:absolute;\r\n\r\n  inset:0;\r\n\r\n  z-index:1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.hero-bg img{\r\n\r\n  width:100%;\r\n\r\n  height:100%;\r\n\r\n  object-fit:cover;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =====================================================\r\nWHITE OVERLAY\r\n===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.hero-overlay{\r\n\r\n  position:absolute;\r\n\r\n  inset:0;\r\n\r\n  z-index:2;\r\n\r\n  background:\r\n    linear-gradient(\r\n      90deg,\r\n      rgba(255,255,255,.96) 0%,\r\n      rgba(255,255,255,.92) 28%,\r\n      rgba(255,255,255,.70) 48%,\r\n      rgba(255,255,255,.20) 70%,\r\n      rgba(255,255,255,.05) 100%\r\n    );\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =====================================================\r\nDECORATION\r\n===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.hero-decoration{\r\n\r\n  position:absolute;\r\n\r\n  left:-200px;\r\n\r\n  bottom:-220px;\r\n\r\n  width:600px;\r\n\r\n  height:600px;\r\n\r\n  border-radius:50%;\r\n\r\n  background:\r\n    radial-gradient(\r\n      circle,\r\n      rgba(11,35,65,.06),\r\n      transparent 70%\r\n    );\r\n\r\n  z-index:2;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =====================================================\r\nCONTENT\r\n===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.hero-content{\r\n\r\n  position:relative;\r\n\r\n  z-index:5;\r\n\r\n  max-width:700px;\r\n\r\n  animation:fadeUp 1s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.hero-content h1{\r\n\r\n  font-size:clamp(4rem,7vw,7rem);\r\n\r\n  line-height:.95;\r\n\r\n  font-weight:900;\r\n\r\n  letter-spacing:-1px;\r\n\r\n  margin-bottom:35px;\r\n\r\n  color:#0b2341;\r\n\r\n  text-shadow:\r\n    0 10px 40px rgba(255,255,255,.95);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.hero-content p{\r\n\r\n  max-width:620px;\r\n\r\n  font-size:1.7rem;\r\n\r\n  line-height:2;\r\n\r\n  color:#44536d;\r\n\r\n  margin-bottom:45px;\r\n\r\n  font-weight:450;\r\n\r\n  text-shadow:\r\n    0 5px 30px rgba(255,255,255,.95);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =====================================================\r\nBUTTONS\r\n===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.hero-buttons{\r\n  display:flex;\r\n  gap:20px;\r\n  flex-wrap:wrap;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn{\r\n\r\n  padding:18px 34px;\r\n\r\n  border-radius:18px;\r\n\r\n  font-weight:700;\r\n\r\n  transition:.4s ease;\r\n\r\n  display:inline-flex;\r\n\r\n  align-items:center;\r\n\r\n  gap:12px;\r\n\r\n  font-size:1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-primary{\r\n\r\n  background:\r\n    linear-gradient(\r\n      135deg,\r\n      #0b2341,\r\n      #17365d\r\n    );\r\n\r\n  color:white;\r\n\r\n  box-shadow:\r\n    0 15px 35px rgba(11,35,65,.25);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-primary:hover{\r\n  transform:translateY(-4px);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-secondary{\r\n\r\n  background:\r\n    rgba(255,255,255,.92);\r\n\r\n  border:\r\n    1px solid rgba(11,35,65,.08);\r\n\r\n  color:#0b2341;\r\n\r\n  backdrop-filter:blur(10px);\r\n\r\n  box-shadow:\r\n    0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-secondary:hover{\r\n  background:white;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =====================================================\r\nFLOATING STATS\r\n===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.hero-stats{\r\n\r\n  position:absolute;\r\n\r\n  right:70px;\r\n\r\n  bottom:70px;\r\n\r\n  z-index:6;\r\n\r\n  display:flex;\r\n\r\n  gap:20px;\r\n\r\n  flex-wrap:wrap;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.stat-box{\r\n\r\n  min-width:220px;\r\n\r\n  background:\r\n    rgba(255,255,255,.92);\r\n\r\n  border:\r\n    1px solid rgba(11,35,65,.06);\r\n\r\n  backdrop-filter:blur(14px);\r\n\r\n  border-radius:26px;\r\n\r\n  padding:24px 28px;\r\n\r\n  box-shadow:\r\n    0 20px 40px rgba(11,35,65,.10);\r\n\r\n  animation:fadeUp 1.2s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.stat-box h3{\r\n\r\n  font-size:3rem;\r\n\r\n  color:#0b2341;\r\n\r\n  margin-bottom:8px;\r\n\r\n  font-weight:900;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.stat-box p{\r\n\r\n  color:#5d6b84;\r\n\r\n  font-size:1rem;\r\n\r\n  line-height:1.5;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =====================================================\r\nSECTION\r\n===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.section{\r\n\r\n  padding:120px 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.section-title{\r\n\r\n  text-align:center;\r\n\r\n  margin-bottom:70px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.section-title span{\r\n\r\n  color:#17365d;\r\n\r\n  font-weight:800;\r\n\r\n  letter-spacing:1px;\r\n\r\n  text-transform:uppercase;\r\n\r\n  font-size:.82rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.section-title h2{\r\n\r\n  font-size:clamp(2.8rem,5vw,4rem);\r\n\r\n  margin-top:16px;\r\n\r\n  color:#0b2341;\r\n\r\n  font-weight:900;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.section-title p{\r\n\r\n  max-width:760px;\r\n\r\n  margin:auto;\r\n\r\n  margin-top:24px;\r\n\r\n  line-height:1.9;\r\n\r\n  color:#5d6b84;\r\n\r\n  font-size:1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =====================================================\r\nTIMELINE\r\n===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.timeline-grid{\r\n\r\n  display:grid;\r\n\r\n  grid-template-columns:\r\n    repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));\r\n\r\n  gap:28px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.timeline-card{\r\n\r\n  background:#ffffff;\r\n\r\n  border:\r\n    1px solid rgba(11,35,65,.08);\r\n\r\n  border-radius:30px;\r\n\r\n  padding:35px;\r\n\r\n  transition:.4s ease;\r\n\r\n  box-shadow:\r\n    0 10px 30px rgba(11,35,65,.05);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.timeline-card:hover{\r\n\r\n  transform:translateY(-8px);\r\n\r\n  box-shadow:\r\n    0 20px 40px rgba(11,35,65,.08);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.timeline-card h3{\r\n\r\n  font-size:2rem;\r\n\r\n  color:#0b2341;\r\n\r\n  margin-bottom:18px;\r\n\r\n  font-weight:900;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.timeline-card p{\r\n\r\n  color:#5d6b84;\r\n\r\n  line-height:1.9;\r\n\r\n  margin-bottom:28px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.card-btn{\r\n\r\n  display:inline-flex;\r\n\r\n  align-items:center;\r\n\r\n  gap:10px;\r\n\r\n  color:#0b2341;\r\n\r\n  font-weight:700;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =====================================================\r\nDOCUMENTS\r\n===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.docs-grid{\r\n\r\n  display:grid;\r\n\r\n  grid-template-columns:\r\n    repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));\r\n\r\n  gap:28px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.doc-card{\r\n\r\n  background:#ffffff;\r\n\r\n  border:\r\n    1px solid rgba(11,35,65,.08);\r\n\r\n  border-radius:28px;\r\n\r\n  padding:35px;\r\n\r\n  box-shadow:\r\n    0 10px 30px rgba(11,35,65,.05);\r\n\r\n  transition:.4s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.doc-card:hover{\r\n\r\n  transform:translateY(-8px);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.doc-icon{\r\n\r\n  width:85px;\r\n\r\n  height:85px;\r\n\r\n  border-radius:24px;\r\n\r\n  background:\r\n    linear-gradient(\r\n      135deg,\r\n      rgba(11,35,65,.08),\r\n      rgba(23,54,93,.12)\r\n    );\r\n\r\n  display:flex;\r\n\r\n  align-items:center;\r\n\r\n  justify-content:center;\r\n\r\n  margin-bottom:24px;\r\n\r\n  font-size:1.2rem;\r\n\r\n  font-weight:900;\r\n\r\n  color:#0b2341;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.doc-card h4{\r\n\r\n  font-size:1.4rem;\r\n\r\n  margin-bottom:14px;\r\n\r\n  color:#0b2341;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.doc-card p{\r\n\r\n  color:#5d6b84;\r\n\r\n  line-height:1.9;\r\n\r\n  margin-bottom:28px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.doc-actions{\r\n  display:flex;\r\n  gap:14px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.doc-btn{\r\n\r\n  flex:1;\r\n\r\n  text-align:center;\r\n\r\n  padding:14px;\r\n\r\n  border-radius:14px;\r\n\r\n  font-weight:700;\r\n\r\n  transition:.3s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.view-btn{\r\n\r\n  background:#f5f7fb;\r\n\r\n  color:#0b2341;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.download-btn{\r\n\r\n  background:\r\n    linear-gradient(\r\n      135deg,\r\n      #0b2341,\r\n      #17365d\r\n    );\r\n\r\n  color:white;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.doc-btn:hover{\r\n  transform:translateY(-2px);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =====================================================\r\nFOOTER\r\n===================================================== */\r\n\r\nfooter{\r\n\r\n  padding:80px 0;\r\n\r\n  border-top:\r\n    1px solid rgba(11,35,65,.08);\r\n\r\n  margin-top:100px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.footer-content{\r\n\r\n  display:flex;\r\n\r\n  justify-content:space-between;\r\n\r\n  gap:60px;\r\n\r\n  flex-wrap:wrap;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.footer-brand h3{\r\n\r\n  font-size:2rem;\r\n\r\n  margin-bottom:20px;\r\n\r\n  font-weight:900;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.footer-brand p{\r\n\r\n  max-width:500px;\r\n\r\n  color:#5d6b84;\r\n\r\n  line-height:1.9;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.footer-links{\r\n\r\n  display:flex;\r\n\r\n  gap:80px;\r\n\r\n  flex-wrap:wrap;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.footer-links h4{\r\n\r\n  margin-bottom:18px;\r\n\r\n  color:#0b2341;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.footer-links a{\r\n\r\n  display:block;\r\n\r\n  margin-bottom:14px;\r\n\r\n  color:#5d6b84;\r\n\r\n  transition:.3s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.footer-links a:hover{\r\n  color:#0b2341;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =====================================================\r\nANIMATIONS\r\n===================================================== */\r\n\r\n@keyframes fadeUp{\r\n\r\n  from{\r\n    opacity:0;\r\n    transform:translateY(50px);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  to{\r\n    opacity:1;\r\n    transform:translateY(0);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =====================================================\r\nRESPONSIVE\r\n===================================================== */\r\n\r\n@media(max-width:980px){\r\n\r\n  .hero{\r\n\r\n    min-height:auto;\r\n\r\n    padding:120px 0 140px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .hero-content h1{\r\n    font-size:4rem;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .hero-overlay{\r\n\r\n    background:\r\n      linear-gradient(\r\n        180deg,\r\n        rgba(255,255,255,.95),\r\n        rgba(255,255,255,.80)\r\n      );\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .hero-stats{\r\n\r\n    position:relative;\r\n\r\n    right:auto;\r\n\r\n    bottom:auto;\r\n\r\n    margin-top:50px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media(max-width:680px){\r\n\r\n  .hero-content h1{\r\n    font-size:3rem;\r\n    letter-spacing:-2px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .hero-content p{\r\n    font-size:1rem;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .hero-buttons{\r\n    flex-direction:column;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .btn{\r\n    width:100%;\r\n    justify-content:center;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .hero-stats{\r\n    flex-direction:column;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .stat-box{\r\n    width:100%;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n}\r\n</style><!-- =====================================================\r\nHERO\r\n===================================================== --><section class="hero"><!-- IMAGE --><div class="hero-bg"><!-- CAMBIA ESTA IMAGEN --><img src="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-05/RENDICION7%20-%20MESAS%20DE%20TRABAJO.jpg" alt=""></div><!-- OVERLAY --><div class="hero-overlay">&nbsp;</div><!-- DECORATION --><div class="hero-decoration">&nbsp;</div><!-- CONTENT --><div class="container"><div class="hero-content"><h1>Transparencia y Rendición de Cuentas</h1><p>Acceda de forma clara, organizada y pública a los procesos de rendición de cuentas de la Universidad Nacional de Loja.</p><div class="hero-buttons"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#procesos">Explorar procesos → </a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-03/INFORME%20RENDICION%20CUENTAS%20UNL%202025_VP.pdf" title="Rendición de cuentas 2025">Informe 2025&nbsp;</a></div></div></div><!-- FLOATING STATS --><div class="hero-stats"><div class="stat-box"><h3>6</h3><p>Años publicados</p></div><div class="stat-box"><h3>+50</h3><p>Documentos públicos</p></div><div class="stat-box"><h3>100%</h3><p>Acceso institucional</p></div></div></section><!-- =====================================================\r\nTIMELINE\r\n===================================================== --><section class="section" id="procesos"><div class="container"><div class="section-title"><p><span>Histórico institucional&nbsp;</span></p><h2>Procesos de Rendición</h2><p>Consulte los procesos institucionales organizados por año y acceda rápidamente a la documentación pública.<br>&nbsp;</p></div><div class="timeline-grid"><div class="timeline-card"><h3>2025</h3><p>Rendición de cuentas 2025</p><p><a class="card-btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/rendicion_cuentas/2025" title="Rendición de cuentas 2025">Ver más →</a></p></div><div class="timeline-card"><h3>2024</h3><p>Rendición de cuentas 2024</p><p><a class="card-btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/rendicion_cuentas/2024" title="Rendición de cuentas 2024">Ver más →</a></p></div><div class="timeline-card"><h3>2023</h3><p>Rendición de cuentas 2023</p><p><a class="card-btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/rendicion_cuentas/2023" title="Rendición de cuentas 2023">Ver más →</a></p></div><div class="timeline-card"><h3>2022</h3><p>Rendición de cuentas 2022</p><p><a class="card-btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/rendicion_cuentas/2022" title="Rendición de cuentas 202 ">Ver más →</a></p></div><div class="timeline-card"><h3>2021</h3><p>Rendición de cuentas 2021</p><p><a class="card-btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/rendicion_cuentas/2021" title="Rendición de cuentas 2021">Ver más →</a></p></div><div class="timeline-card"><h3>2020</h3><p>Rendición de cuentas 2020</p><p><a class="card-btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/rendicion_cuentas/2020" title="Rendición de cuentas 2020">Ver más →</a></p></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-title"><p><span>Documentación pública&nbsp;</span></p><h2>Documentos Destacados</h2></div><div class="docs-grid"><div class="doc-card"><div class="doc-icon">PDF</div><h4>Informe UNL 2025</h4><p>Informe institucional</p><p><a class="doc-btn download-btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-03/INFORME%20RENDICION%20CUENTAS%20UNL%202025_VP.pdf">Ver</a></p></div><div class="doc-card"><div class="doc-icon">DOC</div><h4>Formulario CPCCS UNL 2025</h4><p>Registro oficial de participación ciudadana y socialización institucional.</p><p><a class="doc-btn download-btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/Rendici%C3%B3n%20de%20Cuentas%20UNL%202025_0.pdf">Ver</a></p></div><div class="doc-card"><div class="doc-icon">DATA</div><h4>Presentación&nbsp;</h4><p>Presentación de deliberación pública&nbsp;</p><p><a class="doc-btn download-btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/Rendici%C3%B3n%20de%20Cuentas%20UNL%202025_0.pdf">Ver</a></p></div></div></div></section><!-- =====================================================\r\nFOOTER\r\n===================================================== --><footer><div class="container footer-content"><div class="footer-brand"><h3>UNL Transparencia</h3><p>Portal institucional de acceso público para consulta, seguimiento y transparencia de los procesos de rendición de cuentas de la Universidad Nacional de Loja.</p></div><div class="footer-links"><div><h4>Portal</h4><p><a href="#">Inicio Procesos Documentos</a></p></div><div><h4>Institución</h4><p><a href="https://unl.edu.