%202025_0.pdf">Ver</a></p></div><div class="doc-card"><div class="doc-icon">DATA</div><h4>Presentación&nbsp;</h4><p>Presentación de deliberación pública&nbsp;</p><p><a class="doc-btn download-btn" href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2026-04/Rendici%C3%B3n%20de%20Cuentas%20UNL%202025_0.pdf">Ver</a></p></div></div></div></section><!-- =====================================================\r\nFOOTER\r\n===================================================== --><footer><div class="container footer-content"><div class="footer-brand"><h3>UNL Transparencia</h3><p>Portal institucional de acceso público para consulta, seguimiento y transparencia de los procesos de rendición de cuentas de la Universidad Nacional de Loja.</p></div><div class="footer-links"><div><h4>Portal</h4><p><a href="#">Inicio Procesos Documentos</a></p></div><div><h4>Institución</h4><p><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/">Universidad Nacional de Loja&nbsp;</a><br>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></footer><script>\r\n/* =====================================================\r\nANIMACIÓN SUAVE HERO\r\n===================================================== */\r\nwindow.addEventListener("scroll", () => {\r\n  const scroll = window.scrollY;\r\n  const bg = document.querySelector(".hero-bg img");\r\n  bg.style.transform =\r\n    `scale(1.05) translateY(${scroll * 0.15}px)`;\r\n});\r\n</script>	full_html
texto_libre	0	162	2114	es	0	<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>La Universidad Nacional de Loja se prepara para elegir a los nuevos representantes de su Órgano Colegiado Superior (OCS). según el&nbsp;<a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/archivo/2020-01/ESTATUTO%20ORGANICO%206-11-2019%2C%20VALIDADO%20POR%20EL%20CES.PDF">Estatuto de la institución</a>.</p><p class="text-align-center"><strong>&nbsp;¿Qué se elige?</strong></p><ul><li data-list-item-id="ec901315f312ce5f4fb9f27af58f13925">Representantes al Órgano Colegiado Superior (OCS)</li><li data-list-item-id="e0d3f1906ff114a27621fb905bfbd7a4b">8 docentes titulares (con dos alternos cada uno)</li><li data-list-item-id="e81934313c184ec47e4d0edc496508042">2 estudiantes (con dos alternos)</li><li data-list-item-id="ed4855d8e6319a0198f5752f25a5be03d">&nbsp;1 servidor/a o trabajador/a (con dos alternos)</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/WhatsApp%20Image%202025-06-12%20at%201.05.08%20PM.jpeg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="bd514ad1-4b7f-40cc-848a-42936eee8e74" data-entity-type="file" alt="Banner 3" width="1126" height="392"><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p><p class="text-align-center"><!-- HTML Mejorado -->&nbsp;</p><p><a href="javascript:void(0)">Estudiantes</a></p><ul><li data-list-item-id="e80cd109664e93263796644203b0cd2c4"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_lista_certificada_estudiantes_elecciones_2025_-_farnr-signed.pdf">Facultad Agropecuaria y de Recursos Naturales Renovables</a></li><li data-list-item-id="e0db7a28f819bcb97edd181eff895da7b"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_lista_certificada_estudiantes_elecciones_2025_-_feac-signed.pdf">Facultad de la Educación el Arte y la Comunicación</a></li><li data-list-item-id="ef7c22b2d631e8c685c72bec55cc9877e"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_lista_certificada_estudiantes_elecciones_2025_-_feirnnr-signed.pdf">Facultad de la Energía, las Industrias y los Recursos Naturales no Renovables</a></li><li data-list-item-id="ea1befc2b118ad66452796821fa6218fc"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_lista_certificada_estudiantes_elecciones_2025_-_fjsa-signed.pdf">Facultad Jurídica, Social y Administrativa</a></li><li data-list-item-id="ef4f4486a87899e3ff86b487c84e7b477"><a href="https://www.unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_lista_certificada_estudiantes_elecciones_2025_-_fsh-signed.pdf">Facultad de la Salud Humana</a></li><li data-list-item-id="e64e93473a2eb7993b01050be5ab9eefc"><a href="https://www.unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_lista_certificada_estudiantes_elecciones_2025_-_ued-signed.pdf">Unidad de Educación a Distancia y en Línea</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/NOMINA%20SERVIDORES%20ELECCIONES%20OCS-signed.pdf">Servidores</a></p><p><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/NOMINA%20DOCENTES%20ELECCIONES%20OCS-signed.pdf">Docentes</a></p><p><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/NOMINA%20TRABAJADORES%20ELECCIONES%20OCS-signed.pdf">Trabajadores</a></p><table class="table"><tbody><tr><td><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/25d79dfe-702e-4c29-bca4-77657026f428.jpeg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="0f6643a9-395d-4d1a-bb2a-bac678cf50ea" data-entity-type="file" alt="Convocatoria " width="289" height="468"></td><td><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/Nu%CC%81mero%20de%20lectores%20habilitados%20.jpeg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="fdef90e7-6601-457b-bbd7-50ae88133d58" data-entity-type="file" alt="Número de electores " width="308" height="499"><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p></td><td><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/WhatsApp%20Image%202025-06-13%20at%208.20.14%20AM.jpeg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="db406c56-281a-4ec4-ad18-a903476ecd6d" data-entity-type="file" alt="NOMINA ELECTORES " width="339" height="425"><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/bc65fe31-6867-4b47-a8e6-b5ad32fe4c2a.jpeg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="ca784f4d-fef5-4585-9eb8-bf386075d29e" data-entity-type="file" alt="Recintos electores " width="302" height="378"><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p></td><td><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/WhatsApp%20Image%202025-07-10%20at%2012.08.13%20PM%20%281%29.jpeg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="d9da27ae-6b54-42b6-99d0-798d59dea348" data-entity-type="file" alt="Comunicado elecciones 1" width="311" height="390"><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p></td><td><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/WhatsApp%20Image%202025-07-10%20at%2012.08.13%20PM.jpg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="da728bf1-c7f0-42f8-b18f-7090e4e0d7f6" data-entity-type="file" alt="Comunicado elecciones 2" width="315" height="394"><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/Imagen%20de%20WhatsApp%202025-07-10%20a%20las%2018.43.01_469b6939_0.jpg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="dac4d600-5bc1-41fb-b079-81930eab9856" data-entity-type="file" alt="Invitación" width="306" height="383"></td><td><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/elecciones.jpg" data-align="center" data-entity-uuid="11183b91-890d-4094-90bb-5a79b6f408df" data-entity-type="file" alt="comunicado elecciones 3" width="302" height="378"></td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p><p class="text-align-center"><strong>Modalidad de sufragio&nbsp;</strong></p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Presencial, con juntas receptoras del voto por estamento.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Electrónico remoto, si así lo dispone el Tribunal Electoral General.</p><p class="text-align-center"><strong>Cronograma&nbsp;</strong></p><p><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/archivo/2025-05/Cronograma%20para%20elecciones%20%20OCS%202025%20OFICIAL-signed-signed.pdf">Descarga</a></p><table class="table"><tbody><tr><td><p class="text-align-center"><strong>¿Quiénes deben votar?</strong></p><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Docentes titulares<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Estudiantes regulares (a partir del tercer ciclo o su equivalente)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Servidores administrativos y trabajadores titulares</p></td><td>&nbsp;</td><td><p class="text-align-center"><strong>¿Dónde votar?</strong></p><p><a href="https://lugarvotacion.unl.edu.ec/">Conoce tu lugar de votación</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p><p><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/archivo/2025-05/Cronograma%20para%20elecciones%20%20OCS%202025%20OFICIAL-signed-signed.pdf"><strong>NOMINA DE CANDIDATOS POR EL MOVIMIENTO ACADÉMICO POLÍTICO TRANSFORMACIÓN UNIVERSITARIA.</strong></a></p><p><strong>Padrón Electoral&nbsp;</strong></p><p class="text-align-center"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p><table class="table"><tbody><tr><td><h3>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span> </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/PADRON%20ELECTORAL%20SERVIDORES%20CON%20NOMBRAMIENTO%20DEFINITIVO.pdf"> Servidores</a></h3></td><td><h3 class="text-align-center">&nbsp;<span> </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/PADRON%20ELECTORAL%20DOCENTES.pdf">Docentes</a></h3></td><td><h3 class="text-align-center">&nbsp;<span> </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/PADRON%20ELECTORAL%20TRABAJADORES%20CON%20CONTRATO%20INDEFINIDO.pdf">Trabajadores</a></h3></td></tr></tbody></table><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p><table class="table"><tbody><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="5"><h3>Estudiantes</h3><p>&nbsp;</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="2"><h4><strong>Femenino</strong></h4></td><td><span>&nbsp;</span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_FEMENINO_JUNTA_01-signed.pdf">Junta 1</a></td><td><span>&nbsp;</span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_FEMENINO_JUNTA_02-signed.pdf">Junta 2</a></td><td><span>&nbsp; </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_FEMENINO_JUNTA_03-signed.pdf">Junta&nbsp;3</a></td><td><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_FEMENINO_JUNTA_04-signed.pdf"> Junta&nbsp;4</a></td><td><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_FEMENINO_JUNTA_05-signed.pdf">Junta&nbsp;5</a></td></tr><tr><td><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_FEMENINO_JUNTA_06-signed.pdf">Junta&nbsp;6</a></td><td><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_FEMENINO_JUNTA_07-signed.pdf">Junta&nbsp;7</a></td><td><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_FEMENINO_JUNTA_08-signed.pdf">Junta&nbsp;8</a></td><td><span>&nbsp; </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_FEMENINO_JUNTA_09-signed.pdf">Junta&nbsp;9</a></td><td><span>&nbsp; </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_FEMENINO_JUNTA_10-signed.pdf">Junta&nbsp;10</a></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="2"><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><strong>Masculino</strong></h4></td><td><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>&nbsp; </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_MASCULINO_JUNTA_01-signed.pdf">Junta 1</a></p></td><td><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>&nbsp; </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_MASCULINO_JUNTA_02-signed.pdf">Junta 2</a></p></td><td><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_MASCULINO_JUNTA_03-signed.pdf">Junta&nbsp;3</a></p></td><td><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_MASCULINO_JUNTA_04-signed.pdf">Junta&nbsp;4</a></p></td><td><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_MASCULINO_JUNTA_05-signed.pdf">Junta&nbsp;5</a></p></td></tr><tr><td><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_MASCULINO_JUNTA_06-signed.pdf">Junta&nbsp;6</a></td><td><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_MASCULINO_JUNTA_07-signed.pdf">Junta&nbsp;7</a></td><td><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_MASCULINO_JUNTA_08-signed.pdf">Junta&nbsp;8</a></td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" rowspan="1"><h5 class="text-align-center">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_UED-signed.pdf">Unidad de Educación a Distancia y en Línea</a>&nbsp;</h5></td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p class="text-align-justify">&nbsp;</p><p>Según el art. 39 de&nbsp;<a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/archivo/2021-06/REGLAMENTO%20DE%20ELECCIONES%20%20ORGANO%20COLEGIADO%20SUPERIOR.%20aprobado%20%2828-06-2021%29.docx-signed-signed-signed.pdf">Reglamento de Elecciones</a>, siguiendo el debido proceso, se aplicarán las sanciones señaladas en la Ley Orgánica de Educación Superior, las previstas en el Estatuto Orgánico de la Universidad; las establecidas en la Ley Orgánica de Servicio Público, y, Código del Trabajo. Los estudiantes que no integren la Junta Receptora del Voto y que no justifiquen su inasistencia al sufragio, serán sancionados con una multa equivalente al cinco por ciento (5 %) de un salario básico vigente del trabajador en general.</p><p>Conoce aquí los requisitos en caso de&nbsp;<a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-07/JUSTIFICACION%20DE%20ESTUDIANTES%20QUE%20NO%20VOTARON.pdf">ausentismo de sufragio justificado.</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-07/INSTRUCTIVO%20-%20CERTIFICACION-signed-signed-signed.pdf"><strong>Instructivo para realizar el Voto Electrónico Remoto</strong></a></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter&amp;display=swap');</p>	formato_texto_redactores
