-entity-uuid="11183b91-890d-4094-90bb-5a79b6f408df" data-entity-type="file" alt="comunicado elecciones 3" width="302" height="378"></td><td style="width:399px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p><div style="background-color:#fbecec;border-left:5px solid #93000b;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:10px;padding:20px;"><p class="text-align-center" style="color:#93000b;font-size:18px;margin:0;"><strong>Modalidad de sufragio&nbsp;</strong></p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Presencial, con juntas receptoras del voto por estamento.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Electrónico remoto, si así lo dispone el Tribunal Electoral General.</p></div><div style="background-color:#fbecec;border-left:5px solid #93000b;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:10px;padding:20px;"><p class="text-align-center" style="color:#93000b;font-size:18px;margin:0;"><strong>Cronograma&nbsp;</strong></p><div class="row m-auto text-center"><div class="facultad-carrera"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/archivo/2025-05/Cronograma%20para%20elecciones%20%20OCS%202025%20OFICIAL-signed-signed.pdf" hreflang="es">Descarga</a></div></div></div><table class="table" style="width:100%;" border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="5"><tbody><tr><td><div style="background-color:#fbecec;border-left:5px solid #93000b;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:10px;padding:20px;"><p class="text-align-center" style="color:#93000b;font-size:18px;margin:0;"><strong>¿Quiénes deben votar?</strong></p><p class="text-align-center" style="color:#93000b;font-size:18px;margin:0;">&nbsp;</p><p><meta charset="UTF-8">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Docentes titulares<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Estudiantes regulares (a partir del tercer ciclo o su equivalente)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Servidores administrativos y trabajadores titulares</p></div></td><td class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</td><td><div style="background-color:#fbecec;border-left:5px solid #93000b;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:10px;padding:20px;"><p class="text-align-center" style="color:#93000b;font-size:18px;margin:0;"><strong>¿Dónde votar?</strong></p><div class="row m-auto text-center"><div class="facultad-carrera" style="background-color:#93000b;color:#FFF;"><a style="color:#FFF;" href="https://lugarvotacion.unl.edu.ec/" hreflang="es" rel="noopener noreferer" target="_blank" title="Conoce tu lugar de votación">Conoce tu lugar de votación</a></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p><div class="row m-auto text-center"><div class="facultad-carrera"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/archivo/2025-05/Cronograma%20para%20elecciones%20%20OCS%202025%20OFICIAL-signed-signed.pdf" hreflang="es"><strong>NOMINA DE CANDIDATOS POR EL MOVIMIENTO ACADÉMICO POLÍTICO TRANSFORMACIÓN UNIVERSITARIA.</strong></a></div></div><div style="background-color:#fbecec;border-left:5px solid #93000b;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:10px;padding:20px;"><h1 class="text-align-center" style="color:#93000b;font-size:18px;margin:0px;">&nbsp;</h1><h1 class="text-align-center" style="color:#93000b;font-size:18px;margin:0px;"><strong>Padrón Electoral&nbsp;</strong></h1><p class="text-align-center" style="color:#93000b;font-size:18px;margin:0;"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p><table class="table" style="width:756px;" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td style="width:323px;"><h3>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="display:none;" id="cke_bm_730S"> </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"><a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/PADRON%20ELECTORAL%20SERVIDORES%20CON%20NOMBRAMIENTO%20DEFINITIVO.pdf"> Servidores</a></h3></td><td style="width:189px;"><h3 class="text-align-center">&nbsp;<span style="display:none;" id="cke_bm_760S"> </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/PADRON%20ELECTORAL%20DOCENTES.pdf">Docentes</a></h3></td><td style="width:234px;"><h3 class="text-align-center">&nbsp;<span style="display:none;" id="cke_bm_784S"> </span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/PADRON%20ELECTORAL%20TRABAJADORES%20CON%20CONTRATO%20INDEFINIDO.pdf">Trabajadores</a></h3></td></tr></tbody></table><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p></div></div><div style="background-color:#fbecec;border-left:5px solid #93000b;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:10px;padding:20px;"><p class="text-align-center">&nbsp;</p><table class="table" style="width:760px;" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td class="text-align-center" style="width:129px;" colspan="1" rowspan="5"><h3>Estudiantes</h3><p>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="text-align-center" style="width:93px;" colspan="1" rowspan="2"><h4><strong>Femenino</strong></h4></td><td style="width:108px;"><span style="display:none;" id="cke_bm_342S">&nbsp;</span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/referendum_17785896.png" data-entity-uuid="123c0ae9-c259-45d8-9f33-5e356199a020" data-entity-type="file" alt="imagen 1" width="28" height="28"> <a href="https://unl.edu.ec/sites/default/files/2025-06/_PADRON_ELECTORAL_2025_PRESENCIAL_FEMENINO_JUNTA_01-signed.pdf">Junta 1</a></td><td style="width:99px;"><span sty